(4127566, 592965, 64670, '<td valign="top">This image seems to lack a focus point.  The sky without clouds lacks interest as does the less than blue water and unattractive scrub in the front.  Perhaps if you cropped the top and bottom more and pumped up the selective colours of blues and neutral you''d have a ''popping'' image.</td>', 'This image seems to lack a focus point.  The sky without clouds lacks interest as does the less than blue water and unattractive scrub in the front.  Perhaps if you cropped the top and bottom more and pumped up the selective colours of blues and neutral you''d have a ''popping'' image.', '2007-10-01 06:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127567, 592023, 64670, '<td valign="top">The harsh sunlight doesn''t do this image any favours.  I think a shadier aspect and perhaps a closer focus on a few really lucious looking berries and you''d be in the game.</td>', 'The harsh sunlight doesn''t do this image any favours.  I think a shadier aspect and perhaps a closer focus on a few really lucious looking berries and you''d be in the game.', '2007-10-01 06:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127568, 583294, 64670, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image - those eyebrows do seem excessively dark and angular, but a great image all the same.</td>', 'Wonderful image - those eyebrows do seem excessively dark and angular, but a great image all the same.', '2007-10-01 06:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
