(4127570, 592949, 49109, '<td valign="top">good color, good sharpness on the frog. composition is too centered (face  exactly in image center), would have cropped off 20% at right and top. wrinkles in backdrop distract, so a tighter crop would have helped that, too.</td>', 'good color, good sharpness on the frog. composition is too centered (face  exactly in image center), would have cropped off 20% at right and top. wrinkles in backdrop distract, so a tighter crop would have helped that, too.', '2007-10-01 06:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
