(4127578, 593889, 49109, '<td valign="top">good POV and crop, but the blown out sky takes away from the image. white border might not be the best choice, it merges with the sky at right edge.</td>', 'good POV and crop, but the blown out sky takes away from the image. white border might not be the best choice, it merges with the sky at right edge.', '2007-10-01 06:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127581, 584373, 30982, '<td valign="top">Makes me smile!  Very good isolation of your subject, and I just love that one tooth.  Good warm color, too.</td>', 'Makes me smile!  Very good isolation of your subject, and I just love that one tooth.  Good warm color, too.', '2007-10-01 06:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127583, 592318, 49109, '<td valign="top">good naturally lighted portrait, though the crop is a bit tight (and the image too small:). Might have been helpful to use a reflector from her left to brighten her hair a bit.</td>', 'good naturally lighted portrait, though the crop is a bit tight (and the image too small:). Might have been helpful to use a reflector from her left to brighten her hair a bit.', '2007-10-01 06:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127585, 589325, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus shot and well presented for a centered composition.  A bit of detail is lost in the petals (and very hard to keep!) which may knock it down in score a bit.  The light vignetting around the edges does bother me just a bit - makes me want to put on my glasses, whereas the soft focus of the flower itself is just right.</td>', 'Nice soft focus shot and well presented for a centered composition.  A bit of detail is lost in the petals (and very hard to keep!) which may knock it down in score a bit.  The light vignetting around the edges does bother me just a bit - makes me want to put on my glasses, whereas the soft focus of the flower itself is just right.', '2007-10-01 06:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127586, 593884, 30982, '<td valign="top">What works well for this is a dramatic sky with good realistic color.  What lacks a bit is the somewhat flat foreground area - at least for me, but I tend to like pictures with more contrast than some.</td>', 'What works well for this is a dramatic sky with good realistic color.  What lacks a bit is the somewhat flat foreground area - at least for me, but I tend to like pictures with more contrast than some.', '2007-10-01 06:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127587, 593580, 49109, '<td valign="top">his pose and looks are not majestic at all. composition is too centered, his antlers an legs shouldn''t have been cropped</td>', 'his pose and looks are not majestic at all. composition is too centered, his antlers an legs shouldn''t have been cropped', '2007-10-01 06:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127589, 593472, 49109, '<td valign="top">OOF and motion blurred, probably wrong white balance, too. Sorry, doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'OOF and motion blurred, probably wrong white balance, too. Sorry, doesn''t work for me.', '2007-10-01 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127590, 584139, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent rich, bright and complimentary colors in this.  The diagonal composition with the shape of the reptile works well, too.  I suspect for a higher score here he needs to be in even crisper focus, but I''d guess this is doing pretty well.  Nice catch!</td>', 'Excellent rich, bright and complimentary colors in this.  The diagonal composition with the shape of the reptile works well, too.  I suspect for a higher score here he needs to be in even crisper focus, but I''d guess this is doing pretty well.  Nice catch!', '2007-10-01 06:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127592, 592421, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like this - from the tones to the reflections in the glasses and what looks like a rope in the background.  In my opinion, it''s well composed, well presented.</td>', 'I like this - from the tones to the reflections in the glasses and what looks like a rope in the background.  In my opinion, it''s well composed, well presented.', '2007-10-01 06:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127594, 593623, 68035, '<td valign="top">Glorious portrait of one of my favorite animals.  Seems to have lost a tad of sharpness in resizing but you get away with this because of the softness of what appears to be the light of a late afternoon.  Super 8</td>', 'Glorious portrait of one of my favorite animals.  Seems to have lost a tad of sharpness in resizing but you get away with this because of the softness of what appears to be the light of a late afternoon.  Super 8', '2007-10-01 06:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127598, 593589, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely B&amp;W conversion and quite a haunting picture.  The hand stretching through the railings seems very plaintive (almost as if it is stretching out to either stop a parent leaving or grasping for a balloon that has slipped from its grasp.<br/> <br/>Super shot 8</td>', 'Lovely B&W conversion and quite a haunting picture.  The hand stretching through the railings seems very plaintive (almost as if it is stretching out to either stop a parent leaving or grasping for a balloon that has slipped from its grasp. Super shot 8', '2007-10-01 06:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127599, 581010, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely expression on the childs face although appears quite noisy on my monitor</td>', 'Lovely expression on the childs face although appears quite noisy on my monitor', '2007-10-01 06:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127603, 593161, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow super abstract with great bokeh.  Only minor point may be to have cloned out the stick in the left bottom corner which is a bit of a distraction still a worthy 7</td>', 'Wow super abstract with great bokeh.  Only minor point may be to have cloned out the stick in the left bottom corner which is a bit of a distraction still a worthy 7', '2007-10-01 06:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127604, 583632, 68035, '<td valign="top">Quite a dark shot (atmospherically).  Love the fact that even though the person is looking in a mirror they seem very distanced from their own reflection</td>', 'Quite a dark shot (atmospherically).  Love the fact that even though the person is looking in a mirror they seem very distanced from their own reflection', '2007-10-01 06:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127606, 589877, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice angle on the car and well processed to render interesting texture and detail on the pavement and grass.  Can''t say it says alot to me, though, other than "car parked".  Then again, I''m not big on cars.</td>', 'A nice angle on the car and well processed to render interesting texture and detail on the pavement and grass.  Can''t say it says alot to me, though, other than "car parked".  Then again, I''m not big on cars.', '2007-10-01 06:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127610, 594060, 68035, '<td valign="top">Really simple but nice use of colours.  I am tempted to say I would have liked the facing part of the wood cropped out but I guess if you had done that you would have lost more than you gained in terms of the gentle yellow curve of the pot</td>', 'Really simple but nice use of colours.  I am tempted to say I would have liked the facing part of the wood cropped out but I guess if you had done that you would have lost more than you gained in terms of the gentle yellow curve of the pot', '2007-10-01 06:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127611, 594048, 30982, '<td valign="top">You got me to Google "Hiro", since I had no idea about the reference.  Apparently a character on a TV show?  (Note - I haven''t watched TV in several years.)  While this may be a good illustrative capture and have significance to those familiar with the show, I''m afraid it doesn''t have much for those of us who are not.</td>', 'You got me to Google "Hiro", since I had no idea about the reference.  Apparently a character on a TV show?  (Note - I haven''t watched TV in several years.)  While this may be a good illustrative capture and have significance to those familiar with the show, I''m afraid it doesn''t have much for those of us who are not.', '2007-10-01 06:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127612, 586490, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely time to photograph one of these guys - the little jewels of water on the web are nice!  Realizing you probably didn''t want to get too close (then the "ick!" factor comes into play), a slightly different angle rendering a bit of depth of field - ie part of the web and spider in sharp focus, the rest blurring in and out - would have added a nice touch to this.</td>', 'Lovely time to photograph one of these guys - the little jewels of water on the web are nice!  Realizing you probably didn''t want to get too close (then the "ick!" factor comes into play), a slightly different angle rendering a bit of depth of field - ie part of the web and spider in sharp focus, the rest blurring in and out - would have added a nice touch to this.', '2007-10-01 06:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127613, 591743, 68035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and the crashing wave that you have captured is incredible.  I like the way the power of the wave counterpoints with the calmness of the people on the dock</td>', 'Beautiful shot and the crashing wave that you have captured is incredible.  I like the way the power of the wave counterpoints with the calmness of the people on the dock', '2007-10-01 06:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
