(4127616, 592706, 68035, '<td valign="top">Love the colour of the arch.  Could possibly have done with being cropped slightly from the bottom to lose the disembodied head and the person reaching up with their camera.  Looks like an incredible building</td>', 'Love the colour of the arch.  Could possibly have done with being cropped slightly from the bottom to lose the disembodied head and the person reaching up with their camera.  Looks like an incredible building', '2007-10-01 06:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
