(4127619, 591744, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wonderful animal portrait, that feels like it could be in a book on nature.  Glorious reflection and I love the tight crop.  Stunning focus</td>', 'Wonderful animal portrait, that feels like it could be in a book on nature.  Glorious reflection and I love the tight crop.  Stunning focus', '2007-10-01 06:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127620, 587211, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow, a very ''arty'' shot (though let me emphasise this is not a bad thing) beautiful warm golden glow and great sharpness.  Love the smoky blue on the inside of the horn</td>', 'Wow, a very ''arty'' shot (though let me emphasise this is not a bad thing) beautiful warm golden glow and great sharpness.  Love the smoky blue on the inside of the horn', '2007-10-01 06:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127622, 589684, 49109, '<td valign="top">too centered, too noisy, too motion-blurred. if at least she was looking at the camera and the two persons at left edge were cropped off, this could be more than a below-average snapshot.</td>', 'too centered, too noisy, too motion-blurred. if at least she was looking at the camera and the two persons at left edge were cropped off, this could be more than a below-average snapshot.', '2007-10-01 06:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127623, 593916, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great shadow capture.  Not really sure whether the picture could have done with a slightly tighter crop left and right to retain the symettry but maybe help focus the eye on the key subject (which I take to be the cross) more</td>', 'Great shadow capture.  Not really sure whether the picture could have done with a slightly tighter crop left and right to retain the symettry but maybe help focus the eye on the key subject (which I take to be the cross) more', '2007-10-01 06:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127624, 593456, 49109, '<td valign="top">very nice colors and tones. good composition. rocks could be sharper.</td>', 'very nice colors and tones. good composition. rocks could be sharper.', '2007-10-01 07:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127625, 594049, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great ''old'' shot and the garage sign compliments the image completely.  Baeitiful red and blues. perhaps it could have been a fractional amount sharper on the grill but still a good 7</td>', 'Great ''old'' shot and the garage sign compliments the image completely.  Baeitiful red and blues. perhaps it could have been a fractional amount sharper on the grill but still a good 7', '2007-10-01 07:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127626, 593884, 49109, '<td valign="top">good composition. overall too pale, needs a boost in contrast, plants could also be more saturated.</td>', 'good composition. overall too pale, needs a boost in contrast, plants could also be more saturated.', '2007-10-01 07:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127627, 590758, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice ethereal quality to this image.  Not sure how it will fare in a FS but a lovely shot</td>', 'Nice ethereal quality to this image.  Not sure how it will fare in a FS but a lovely shot', '2007-10-01 07:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127628, 593572, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great desat here (no too overstated) on what was already a lovely image.  Bokeh and fra,me work very well</td>', 'Great desat here (no too overstated) on what was already a lovely image.  Bokeh and fra,me work very well', '2007-10-01 07:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127629, 592571, 49109, '<td valign="top">good capture, swirls are very appealing. contrast is too high, edges show a lot of pixelation from sharpening.</td>', 'good capture, swirls are very appealing. contrast is too high, edges show a lot of pixelation from sharpening.', '2007-10-01 07:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127630, 584617, 68797, '<td valign="top">gorgeous. this deserves a blue.</td>', 'gorgeous. this deserves a blue.', '2007-10-01 07:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127631, 592299, 68035, '<td valign="top">Stunning macro that should be in a book on entamology.  Great dof which works very well with the web</td>', 'Stunning macro that should be in a book on entamology.  Great dof which works very well with the web', '2007-10-01 07:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127632, 593679, 674, '<td valign="top">First Impression: A good candid image of village life<br/>Presentation:fair<br/>What I Like: the atmosphere of this image<br/>What I dont Like:The white line at the bottom<br/>IMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes<br/> <br/>Composition: good but  iwould have liked the two to be interacting with each other.<br/>Background : good<br/>Subject Placement:good<br/>Cropping: cropped too close to the feet.<br/>Focus: slightly soft<br/>Exposure:good<br/>Editing:good<br/> <br/>Total Averaged Rating :7</td>', 'First Impression: A good candid image of village lifePresentation:fairWhat I Like: the atmosphere of this imageWhat I dont Like:The white line at the bottomIMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes Composition: good but  iwould have liked the two to be interacting with each other.Background : goodSubject Placement:goodCropping: cropped too close to the feet.Focus: slightly softExposure:goodEditing:good Total Averaged Rating :7', '2007-10-01 07:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127633, 583581, 68035, '<td valign="top">Fun if somewhat surreal image.  I love the dodging and burning that you have executed on the clouds</td>', 'Fun if somewhat surreal image.  I love the dodging and burning that you have executed on the clouds', '2007-10-01 07:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127635, 591854, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great vortex effect.  The sky colour works very well with the tent.  outstanding image</td>', 'Great vortex effect.  The sky colour works very well with the tent.  outstanding image', '2007-10-01 07:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127639, 591228, 68035, '<td valign="top">You cant go wrong with the Northern Lights.  Excellent job as you have still managed to create a wow image when some shots of the Northern Lights are almost getting passed over simply because of the magnificence of earlier images that have been seen.  Love the composition with the chrchyard. 9</td>', 'You cant go wrong with the Northern Lights.  Excellent job as you have still managed to create a wow image when some shots of the Northern Lights are almost getting passed over simply because of the magnificence of earlier images that have been seen.  Love the composition with the chrchyard. 9', '2007-10-01 07:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127641, 594042, 674, '<td valign="top">First Impression: Not another nude!<br/>Presentation: good<br/>What I Like:that it is a silhouette<br/>What I dont Like:that it is not a proper silhouette<br/>IMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes<br/> <br/>Composition: fair<br/>Background :good<br/>Subject Placement:good<br/>Cropping:should have cropped above the little black triangle bottom right<br/>Focus: ok<br/>Exposure:ok<br/>Editing:ok<br/> <br/>Total Averaged Rating :6</td>', 'First Impression: Not another nude!Presentation: goodWhat I Like:that it is a silhouetteWhat I dont Like:that it is not a proper silhouetteIMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes Composition: fairBackground :goodSubject Placement:goodCropping:should have cropped above the little black triangle bottom rightFocus: okExposure:okEditing:ok Total Averaged Rating :6', '2007-10-01 07:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127642, 593762, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Picture postcard stuff.  Just a breathtaking reflection.  It seems a tiny bit washed out in some of the colours but still the kind of image that makes my jaw sag when I see it 8</td>', 'Wow.  Picture postcard stuff.  Just a breathtaking reflection.  It seems a tiny bit washed out in some of the colours but still the kind of image that makes my jaw sag when I see it 8', '2007-10-01 07:09:09.000000', NULL, 1);
