(4127644, 592782, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait and super B&amp;W concversion.  Love the DOF and the fact that you have avoided blow out on the nose</td>', 'Lovely portrait and super B&W concversion.  Love the DOF and the fact that you have avoided blow out on the nose', '2007-10-01 07:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
