(4127649, 593889, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot with great strong and contrasting lines.  Good B&amp;W conversion  although perhaps could have done with a little bit of burning on parts of the sky<br/> <br/>Lovely POV</td>', 'Lovely shot with great strong and contrasting lines.  Good B&W conversion  although perhaps could have done with a little bit of burning on parts of the sky Lovely POV', '2007-10-01 07:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127651, 593354, 68035, '<td valign="top">Excellent landscape that works very well in B&amp;W.  Super sky and I love the mist sweeping over the mountains</td>', 'Excellent landscape that works very well in B&W.  Super sky and I love the mist sweeping over the mountains', '2007-10-01 07:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127653, 591022, 674, '<td valign="top">First Impression: looks like an olden day industrial image<br/>Presentation: good<br/>What I Like:the focal point<br/>What I dont Like:nothing<br/>IMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes<br/> <br/>Composition: good the figures in the background give a sense of scale. good motion blur from moving parts<br/>Background : good<br/>Subject Placement:v good<br/>Cropping:good<br/>Focus: good<br/>Exposure:good<br/>Editing:good<br/> <br/>Total Averaged Rating :7</td>', 'First Impression: looks like an olden day industrial imagePresentation: goodWhat I Like:the focal pointWhat I dont Like:nothingIMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes Composition: good the figures in the background give a sense of scale. good motion blur from moving partsBackground : goodSubject Placement:v goodCropping:goodFocus: goodExposure:goodEditing:good Total Averaged Rating :7', '2007-10-01 07:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127655, 593282, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait and good backlighting.  Maybe lacks a wow factor to do brilliantly in the challenge but I know that if this was a shot of me I would cherish it and want it hanging on my wall</td>', 'Very nice portrait and good backlighting.  Maybe lacks a wow factor to do brilliantly in the challenge but I know that if this was a shot of me I would cherish it and want it hanging on my wall', '2007-10-01 07:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127656, 593899, 68035, '<td valign="top">Super soft shot which actually suits the dilapidation of the barn.  Seems a tad oversaturated in places on my monitor and I wonder what this would look like in B&amp;W<br/> <br/>Great backdrop</td>', 'Super soft shot which actually suits the dilapidation of the barn.  Seems a tad oversaturated in places on my monitor and I wonder what this would look like in B&W Great backdrop', '2007-10-01 07:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
