(4127668, 592392, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting on the face.</td>', 'Very nice lighting on the face.', '2007-10-01 07:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127669, 593894, 68035, '<td valign="top">Technically and compositionally good (I like the slight tilt that you have given it to create a strong diagonal line for the path)somehow though when I look at it I think of a clothing catalogue.  I guess in a way that this is good as it (imo) could hold its own in a publication, but in another I guess I dont feel the emotion that no doubt the couple have for each other</td>', 'Technically and compositionally good (I like the slight tilt that you have given it to create a strong diagonal line for the path)somehow though when I look at it I think of a clothing catalogue.  I guess in a way that this is good as it (imo) could hold its own in a publication, but in another I guess I dont feel the emotion that no doubt the couple have for each other', '2007-10-01 07:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127675, 594084, 41337, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.</td>', 'Fantastic.', '2007-10-01 07:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127678, 593354, 41337, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.', '2007-10-01 07:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127679, 589822, 68035, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot, a real shame about the other diver but I guess there was no way that they could be cropped out</td>', 'Stunning shot, a real shame about the other diver but I guess there was no way that they could be cropped out', '2007-10-01 07:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127681, 592492, 41337, '<td valign="top">Now that''s interesting.</td>', 'Now that''s interesting.', '2007-10-01 07:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127683, 592641, 41337, '<td valign="top">Still captivating.</td>', 'Still captivating.', '2007-10-01 07:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127690, 590208, 30982, '<td valign="top">A subtle nicely lit peaceful scene.  I''m not sure the small size does it fair justice (which unfortunately can hurt scores here).  I suspect just a touch more sharpening is needed, but overall I like the different "layers" presented here - sky, clouds, mountains, hill, water.</td>', 'A subtle nicely lit peaceful scene.  I''m not sure the small size does it fair justice (which unfortunately can hurt scores here).  I suspect just a touch more sharpening is needed, but overall I like the different "layers" presented here - sky, clouds, mountains, hill, water.', '2007-10-01 07:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127691, 592355, 30982, '<td valign="top">A pretty good shot of one of these elegant birds.  They''re hard to capture well because it''s easy to have the whites get "blown" - lose all detail - if you want the rest of the shot to be properly exposed.  A bit average in "appeal".</td>', 'A pretty good shot of one of these elegant birds.  They''re hard to capture well because it''s easy to have the whites get "blown" - lose all detail - if you want the rest of the shot to be properly exposed.  A bit average in "appeal".', '2007-10-01 07:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127692, 593643, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good detail in the feathers - nicely done with white birds.  I like how they''re apparently posed as a "gang", too.</td>', 'Very good detail in the feathers - nicely done with white birds.  I like how they''re apparently posed as a "gang", too.', '2007-10-01 07:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127693, 589209, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well photographed and a lovely tribute to a late-in-life wedding.  Black and white suits it well, too.</td>', 'Very well photographed and a lovely tribute to a late-in-life wedding.  Black and white suits it well, too.', '2007-10-01 07:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127695, 593747, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice, dramatic sky with good true-to-life color.  As a landscape, other than the sky, it somewhat lacks a "subject" - a focal point which the sky would serve to enhance or compliment.</td>', 'A nice, dramatic sky with good true-to-life color.  As a landscape, other than the sky, it somewhat lacks a "subject" - a focal point which the sky would serve to enhance or compliment.', '2007-10-01 07:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127696, 592748, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the collection of various body parts around the subject.  Makes for a unique portrait of sorts.  Probably not strong enough (no wow factor, emotive factor - the expression is kind of expressionless) for a high score here, but a good shot nonetheless.</td>', 'I like the collection of various body parts around the subject.  Makes for a unique portrait of sorts.  Probably not strong enough (no wow factor, emotive factor - the expression is kind of expressionless) for a high score here, but a good shot nonetheless.', '2007-10-01 07:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127698, 594046, 49109, '<td valign="top">very nice portrait, looks like you had fun shooting. like the sepia toning as well as the negative space here.</td>', 'very nice portrait, looks like you had fun shooting. like the sepia toning as well as the negative space here.', '2007-10-01 07:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127700, 593962, 49109, '<td valign="top">contrast is too high here, wish there was more drawing visible in the dark areas of the butterfly and in the bright petals. right and upper border look slightly blurred.</td>', 'contrast is too high here, wish there was more drawing visible in the dark areas of the butterfly and in the bright petals. right and upper border look slightly blurred.', '2007-10-01 07:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127702, 594040, 64670, '<td valign="top">Not really sure how the title pertains to the image, will be interested to see at the end.  Nice colours all the same.</td>', 'Not really sure how the title pertains to the image, will be interested to see at the end.  Nice colours all the same.', '2007-10-01 07:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127703, 593974, 64670, '<td valign="top">Strong image - I would have LOVED to see it as a B&amp;W.</td>', 'Strong image - I would have LOVED to see it as a B&W.', '2007-10-01 07:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127704, 594056, 30982, '<td valign="top">Pretty good graphic composition, but cutting off the edge of the rusted part kinda breaks the flow a bit.</td>', 'Pretty good graphic composition, but cutting off the edge of the rusted part kinda breaks the flow a bit.', '2007-10-01 07:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127705, 593904, 49109, '<td valign="top">cute! nice colors and good DOF, although point of focus seems to be a little behind his face</td>', 'cute! nice colors and good DOF, although point of focus seems to be a little behind his face', '2007-10-01 07:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127706, 593856, 64670, '<td valign="top">Wow - so very clear.</td>', 'Wow - so very clear.', '2007-10-01 07:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127707, 593620, 64670, '<td valign="top">I love how the clouds appear to have created layers.</td>', 'I love how the clouds appear to have created layers.', '2007-10-01 07:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127708, 583708, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - cow pictures are always fun.  Were it within your ability to do so, I think an even closer view of these three would be more effective.</td>', 'Heh - cow pictures are always fun.  Were it within your ability to do so, I think an even closer view of these three would be more effective.', '2007-10-01 07:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127709, 584360, 49109, '<td valign="top">for me the DOF is a bit too shallow, had lobved to see the lower parts of the seeds in focus, too. border doesn''t add here.</td>', 'for me the DOF is a bit too shallow, had lobved to see the lower parts of the seeds in focus, too. border doesn''t add here.', '2007-10-01 07:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127710, 592383, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice rack on that one - and I really like the grasses as the background - sets him apart nicely.</td>', 'Very nice rack on that one - and I really like the grasses as the background - sets him apart nicely.', '2007-10-01 07:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127711, 591740, 49109, '<td valign="top">way too dark at left side, had cropped off 20 % there. the man in raincoat is rather distracting</td>', 'way too dark at left side, had cropped off 20 % there. the man in raincoat is rather distracting', '2007-10-01 07:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127714, 593936, 64670, '<td valign="top">This face appears to have been overly processed or ''neat imaged''.  The model doesn''t look so thrilled with having her photo taken and the harsh lighting isn''t very appealing.<br/> <br/>Perhaps a really tight crop of her face would have worked better.  She has beautiful eyes.</td>', 'This face appears to have been overly processed or ''neat imaged''.  The model doesn''t look so thrilled with having her photo taken and the harsh lighting isn''t very appealing. Perhaps a really tight crop of her face would have worked better.  She has beautiful eyes.', '2007-10-01 07:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127715, 592832, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2007-10-01 07:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127717, 590303, 64670, '<td valign="top">Not sure how the title pertains to the image. The red ''frame'' is distracting to my eye, I think a tight crop of the kitty''s face would have worked better.</td>', 'Not sure how the title pertains to the image. The red ''frame'' is distracting to my eye, I think a tight crop of the kitty''s face would have worked better.', '2007-10-01 07:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127719, 583294, 30982, '<td valign="top">A beautiful model and I kinda like the spill of the hair.  I''m not overly fond of the pose - I guess because I don''t see a particular reason for it (other than it''s different) and the model looks somewhat disinterested.  Light is good, B&amp;W conversion is very good as well.</td>', 'A beautiful model and I kinda like the spill of the hair.  I''m not overly fond of the pose - I guess because I don''t see a particular reason for it (other than it''s different) and the model looks somewhat disinterested.  Light is good, B&W conversion is very good as well.', '2007-10-01 07:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127722, 593938, 54632, '<td valign="top">LOL @ the title! :) Nice picture.</td>', 'LOL @ the title! :) Nice picture.', '2007-10-01 08:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127723, 593977, 54632, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, nothing negative to say.</td>', 'I love this picture, nothing negative to say.', '2007-10-01 08:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127725, 593177, 54632, '<td valign="top">awesome pose, wish I could get my wedding brides to do that!</td>', 'awesome pose, wish I could get my wedding brides to do that!', '2007-10-01 08:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127729, 592387, 54632, '<td valign="top">except for the shadow of the hair on the neck, good smooth lighting.</td>', 'except for the shadow of the hair on the neck, good smooth lighting.', '2007-10-01 08:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127733, 587569, 54632, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture, i''d give this a 10 but i take points off only because the picture looks a little (luma not colour) noisy, and it looks as though theres some banding occuring across the top of the picture? This can sometimes be caused by the lens electronics though..? 7.</td>', 'Awesome capture, i''d give this a 10 but i take points off only because the picture looks a little (luma not colour) noisy, and it looks as though theres some banding occuring across the top of the picture? This can sometimes be caused by the lens electronics though..? 7.', '2007-10-01 08:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127736, 589327, 64670, '<td valign="top">This image seems to be suffering from lack of tripod.  Unless your intent was to present a blurred image, and then I recant my suggestion - GRIN!<br/> <br/>The extra frames don''t really appeal or add to the quality of the image.</td>', 'This image seems to be suffering from lack of tripod.  Unless your intent was to present a blurred image, and then I recant my suggestion - GRIN! The extra frames don''t really appeal or add to the quality of the image.', '2007-10-01 08:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127738, 593869, 54632, '<td valign="top">What is this place?!? It looks intriguing! I wish it was a little more contrasty at the top half of the picture, otherwise great photo. 7.</td>', 'What is this place?!? It looks intriguing! I wish it was a little more contrasty at the top half of the picture, otherwise great photo. 7.', '2007-10-01 08:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
