(4127897, 587189, 8637, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Seems a bit out of focus.', '2007-10-01 08:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127899, 591641, 53147, '<td valign="top">Blur and high key are friends of mine, but I wish there was more to the image or a tighter crop to really bring the focus on the girl. The left side just doesnt help the image IMO. But kudos for submitting something different. While you may not get a high score you sure will reach a more devoted group of viewers who crave something outside the DPC Free Study box.</td>', 'Blur and high key are friends of mine, but I wish there was more to the image or a tighter crop to really bring the focus on the girl. The left side just doesnt help the image IMO. But kudos for submitting something different. While you may not get a high score you sure will reach a more devoted group of viewers who crave something outside the DPC Free Study box.', '2007-10-01 08:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127902, 592641, 46177, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, love the lighting and his facial expression is great.  The red had really adds to the shot, good luck.</td>', 'Very nice portrait, love the lighting and his facial expression is great.  The red had really adds to the shot, good luck.', '2007-10-01 08:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127905, 581463, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good general image. I think the light on the left side is a bit harsh on her face and shoulder but could be easily fixed in post process. But the overall lighting is well done and the image appears clean. Not a wow image but one that is well done.</td>', 'Good general image. I think the light on the left side is a bit harsh on her face and shoulder but could be easily fixed in post process. But the overall lighting is well done and the image appears clean. Not a wow image but one that is well done.', '2007-10-01 08:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127909, 589123, 8637, '<td valign="top">Nice capture...I might have left the top of the little boy''s head in the frame.</td>', 'Nice capture...I might have left the top of the little boy''s head in the frame.', '2007-10-01 08:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127910, 592318, 80311, '<td valign="top">Very cute model!</td>', 'Very cute model!', '2007-10-01 08:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127911, 593550, 8637, '<td valign="top">Wow...that''s all I can say...wow!</td>', 'Wow...that''s all I can say...wow!', '2007-10-01 08:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127914, 593549, 53147, '<td valign="top">Cool cloud formations but a bit lacking overall as a photo. Pretty noisy in general and just not enough interest to carry the picture beyond the formations.</td>', 'Cool cloud formations but a bit lacking overall as a photo. Pretty noisy in general and just not enough interest to carry the picture beyond the formations.', '2007-10-01 08:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127916, 591886, 8637, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture...and great title!</td>', 'Excellent capture...and great title!', '2007-10-01 08:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127919, 587890, 8637, '<td valign="top">One of the nicest portraitures I have seen.</td>', 'One of the nicest portraitures I have seen.', '2007-10-01 08:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127920, 594044, 53147, '<td valign="top">A bit bright on the highlights throughout and the general composition is just a bit too busy. I know how hard it is to shoot these birds. Blown highlights and cruddy backgrounds plague me a swell.</td>', 'A bit bright on the highlights throughout and the general composition is just a bit too busy. I know how hard it is to shoot these birds. Blown highlights and cruddy backgrounds plague me a swell.', '2007-10-01 08:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127924, 593890, 53147, '<td valign="top">The horizon feels a bit tilted and the general composition just feels a bit flat to me. I liek the color but the image doesnt have anything that really grabs my attention which, to me, is crucial in a 500+ entry Free Study.</td>', 'The horizon feels a bit tilted and the general composition just feels a bit flat to me. I liek the color but the image doesnt have anything that really grabs my attention which, to me, is crucial in a 500+ entry Free Study.', '2007-10-01 08:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127932, 591740, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit more of the "Bells" to show the nice fall colors is needed to me.</td>', 'A bit more of the "Bells" to show the nice fall colors is needed to me.', '2007-10-01 09:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127933, 592736, 30982, '<td valign="top">My kind of subjec to shoot - I like the lines and curves - but a bit overdone in processing for scoring well here.</td>', 'My kind of subjec to shoot - I like the lines and curves - but a bit overdone in processing for scoring well here.', '2007-10-01 09:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127935, 592965, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and a pleasant location. That said it isnt a real eyegrabber for me. It seems to be missing compared to the landscapes I rated higher. Mayeb just no real main focus. Good shot overall, just not wow.</td>', 'Very nice colors and a pleasant location. That said it isnt a real eyegrabber for me. It seems to be missing compared to the landscapes I rated higher. Mayeb just no real main focus. Good shot overall, just not wow.', '2007-10-01 09:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127938, 593282, 3569, '<td valign="top">IMO, a bit more contrast is needed to make it sharper.</td>', 'IMO, a bit more contrast is needed to make it sharper.', '2007-10-01 09:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127939, 589797, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonal to the composition and good bokeh behind to outline your subject.  The lack of crisp focus on the insect and the OOF foreground will hurt your score some.</td>', 'Nice diagonal to the composition and good bokeh behind to outline your subject.  The lack of crisp focus on the insect and the OOF foreground will hurt your score some.', '2007-10-01 09:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127942, 594072, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail captured here. But for some reason moon shots dont grab me. There just isnt anything you can do to make them different from other straight forward moon shots. Very good technicals but lacking in the wow department.</td>', 'Very nice detail captured here. But for some reason moon shots dont grab me. There just isnt anything you can do to make them different from other straight forward moon shots. Very good technicals but lacking in the wow department.', '2007-10-01 09:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127943, 592752, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit more dof is needed on the drops to make them all in focus.  The bokeh background is nice.</td>', 'A bit more dof is needed on the drops to make them all in focus.  The bokeh background is nice.', '2007-10-01 09:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127945, 591429, 3569, '<td valign="top">the Blue on the flag appears to be blown out and not natural to me.</td>', 'the Blue on the flag appears to be blown out and not natural to me.', '2007-10-01 09:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127947, 589325, 53147, '<td valign="top">A possibly good image ruined by too much blur and the funky vignette. I think had the flower been sharp and the vignette left off this would have been a stronger image.</td>', 'A possibly good image ruined by too much blur and the funky vignette. I think had the flower been sharp and the vignette left off this would have been a stronger image.', '2007-10-01 09:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127948, 589081, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL - bonus point for the title alone.  The photograph is very well done, too - very nice light, love the barest hints of the web, and the DOF on the leaf is lovely.  Maybe she''s on a diet?</td>', 'LOL - bonus point for the title alone.  The photograph is very well done, too - very nice light, love the barest hints of the web, and the DOF on the leaf is lovely.  Maybe she''s on a diet?', '2007-10-01 09:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127949, 593468, 3569, '<td valign="top">Excellent Ruby-throated...</td>', 'Excellent Ruby-throated...', '2007-10-01 09:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127951, 588995, 3569, '<td valign="top">too overexposed to me.</td>', 'too overexposed to me.', '2007-10-01 09:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127952, 593714, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very lovely - I especially like the angle you chose to include the tree, and the focus on the single bloom.</td>', 'Very lovely - I especially like the angle you chose to include the tree, and the focus on the single bloom.', '2007-10-01 09:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127954, 594038, 53147, '<td valign="top">Pretty busy image working here. The birds kind of get lost in the background of the trees and the angle you caught them in isnt really flattering.</td>', 'Pretty busy image working here. The birds kind of get lost in the background of the trees and the angle you caught them in isnt really flattering.', '2007-10-01 09:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127955, 593703, 3569, '<td valign="top">Too over-processed, the lighter blues around the balloons is very distracting.</td>', 'Too over-processed, the lighter blues around the balloons is very distracting.', '2007-10-01 09:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127958, 593244, 30982, '<td valign="top">The frame is very much an element of the compostion, as is the foreground object.  Almost as though seen through the window of a vehicle as it passes by.</td>', 'The frame is very much an element of the compostion, as is the foreground object.  Almost as though seen through the window of a vehicle as it passes by.', '2007-10-01 09:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127959, 593568, 3569, '<td valign="top">This is very nice and should do well.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is very nice and should do well.  Good luck.', '2007-10-01 09:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127961, 585552, 53147, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good idea but probably better for a challenge that it could be more specifically suited for rather than a FS. The whites are a bit too bright for my tastes and the soft focus on the hands hurts the image as well.</td>', 'I think this is a good idea but probably better for a challenge that it could be more specifically suited for rather than a FS. The whites are a bit too bright for my tastes and the soft focus on the hands hurts the image as well.', '2007-10-01 09:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127965, 593926, 3569, '<td valign="top">interesting take, shows alot of different things, that''s good.</td>', 'interesting take, shows alot of different things, that''s good.', '2007-10-01 09:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127966, 593924, 53147, '<td valign="top">A bit soft on the focus (but whatcha gonna do - probably poor lighting) but I think this shot is also cropped a bit too tight. I feel like I want to see the front swimmers arms going into the water rather than just the splash coming up.</td>', 'A bit soft on the focus (but whatcha gonna do - probably poor lighting) but I think this shot is also cropped a bit too tight. I feel like I want to see the front swimmers arms going into the water rather than just the splash coming up.', '2007-10-01 09:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127967, 594044, 3569, '<td valign="top">background is too cluttered and distracting to me.</td>', 'background is too cluttered and distracting to me.', '2007-10-01 09:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127968, 592149, 53147, '<td valign="top">Kind of interesting image. I think the processing is a bit too heavy for it. You can see noise in the reds and oranges pretty bad. But the effect of the light rays is cool.</td>', 'Kind of interesting image. I think the processing is a bit too heavy for it. You can see noise in the reds and oranges pretty bad. But the effect of the light rays is cool.', '2007-10-01 09:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127970, 592813, 3569, '<td valign="top">"Long''s" couldn''t look any better, nice.</td>', '"Long''s" couldn''t look any better, nice.', '2007-10-01 09:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127971, 593627, 53147, '<td valign="top">Overall a kind of boring image. Looks like a cool location but not shot on a good day. Would like to see this processed a bit heavier to make it pop.</td>', 'Overall a kind of boring image. Looks like a cool location but not shot on a good day. Would like to see this processed a bit heavier to make it pop.', '2007-10-01 09:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127972, 591364, 3569, '<td valign="top">Looks like a cut &amp; paste too me.  Not natural at all.</td>', 'Looks like a cut & paste too me.  Not natural at all.', '2007-10-01 09:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127974, 585630, 53147, '<td valign="top">This image doesnt grab me. Seems like it was shot with a not long enough exposure to really allow the water to have that cool long exposure effect. As it is here it just seems out of focus and a bit flat.</td>', 'This image doesnt grab me. Seems like it was shot with a not long enough exposure to really allow the water to have that cool long exposure effect. As it is here it just seems out of focus and a bit flat.', '2007-10-01 09:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127976, 585552, 3569, '<td valign="top">The white background is too bright.  Did you try other colors? Might have worked better.</td>', 'The white background is too bright.  Did you try other colors? Might have worked better.', '2007-10-01 09:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127977, 593572, 3569, '<td valign="top">A slight more contrast and you could be in the top 10.</td>', 'A slight more contrast and you could be in the top 10.', '2007-10-01 09:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127978, 593484, 53147, '<td valign="top">A bit too out of focus and a lacking in the composition department. Doesnt have anything that grabs my attention or anything that has a focus point of interest.</td>', 'A bit too out of focus and a lacking in the composition department. Doesnt have anything that grabs my attention or anything that has a focus point of interest.', '2007-10-01 09:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127981, 593267, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and good acting from the model - the image does lack a bit of sharpness though and I think the rose might be a bit too clichéd for some.</td>', 'Nice concept and good acting from the model - the image does lack a bit of sharpness though and I think the rose might be a bit too clichéd for some.', '2007-10-01 09:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127982, 591277, 3569, '<td valign="top">It apears that this was hand help or windy conditions.  Only the lightning is in focus, typical of movement.</td>', 'It apears that this was hand help or windy conditions.  Only the lightning is in focus, typical of movement.', '2007-10-01 09:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127986, 593140, 78196, '<td valign="top">A pleasant shot with good composition, though it lacks the ''wow'' factor to do well in a free study. I also wonder if the image is a little on the flat side contrast-wise?</td>', 'A pleasant shot with good composition, though it lacks the ''wow'' factor to do well in a free study. I also wonder if the image is a little on the flat side contrast-wise?', '2007-10-01 09:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127987, 589570, 3569, '<td valign="top">nice sharpness and subject.  Not sure if I like the arched horizon or not.</td>', 'nice sharpness and subject.  Not sure if I like the arched horizon or not.', '2007-10-01 09:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127988, 588605, 3569, '<td valign="top">Now this is different.  Great creativity.</td>', 'Now this is different.  Great creativity.', '2007-10-01 09:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127989, 591979, 3569, '<td valign="top">quite nice.</td>', 'quite nice.', '2007-10-01 09:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127990, 583587, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice vivid colors, good sharpness. crop is very tight, a wider view had told more of the story. BTW: Am I supposed to understand the title?</td>', 'nice vivid colors, good sharpness. crop is very tight, a wider view had told more of the story. BTW: Am I supposed to understand the title?', '2007-10-01 09:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127991, 589512, 78196, '<td valign="top">I think that if the lion were looking into the camera, your score for this would gain at least a mark. As it is we are left feeling detached and the image quality is not particularly great - it''s just a bit too noisy and over-sharpened. However I do think you''ve done remarkably well under difficult shooting conditions.</td>', 'I think that if the lion were looking into the camera, your score for this would gain at least a mark. As it is we are left feeling detached and the image quality is not particularly great - it''s just a bit too noisy and over-sharpened. However I do think you''ve done remarkably well under difficult shooting conditions.', '2007-10-01 09:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127992, 591157, 53147, '<td valign="top">Looks like a cool location but the image overall is lacking. Pretty noisy in general and the composition doesnt grab me. The kid also ruins it. Had you been taking the shot from the perspective of where the couple is looking I think you would have had a much stronger image.</td>', 'Looks like a cool location but the image overall is lacking. Pretty noisy in general and the composition doesnt grab me. The kid also ruins it. Had you been taking the shot from the perspective of where the couple is looking I think you would have had a much stronger image.', '2007-10-01 09:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127993, 593979, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and DOF, but just not sharp enough unfortunately.</td>', 'Nice composition and DOF, but just not sharp enough unfortunately.', '2007-10-01 09:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127994, 580889, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can see this as an ad for a fragrance called "Meadows".  Nice use of DOF.</td>', 'I can see this as an ad for a fragrance called "Meadows".  Nice use of DOF.', '2007-10-01 09:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127995, 593762, 3569, '<td valign="top">The ole Snake and Tetons.  I have some shots from the same spot.  Always a great spot and your shot is nice too.</td>', 'The ole Snake and Tetons.  I have some shots from the same spot.  Always a great spot and your shot is nice too.', '2007-10-01 09:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127996, 593572, 49109, '<td valign="top">very good focus and composition. the selective desat wasn''t helpful here, makes his eyes look as if he wears make-up.</td>', 'very good focus and composition. the selective desat wasn''t helpful here, makes his eyes look as if he wears make-up.', '2007-10-01 09:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4127997, 593176, 78196, '<td valign="top">I think this is exceptional. Very good PP and composition.</td>', 'I think this is exceptional. Very good PP and composition.', '2007-10-01 09:19:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4128000, 585834, 53147, '<td valign="top">Feels a little tilted to the right. The composition also seems a bit setup (yes I know its setup but that doesnt necessarily mean it has to feel that way). Just doesnt grab my attention.</td>', 'Feels a little tilted to the right. The composition also seems a bit setup (yes I know its setup but that doesnt necessarily mean it has to feel that way). Just doesnt grab my attention.', '2007-10-01 09:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128001, 593580, 3569, '<td valign="top">A slight more dof and you would have score a bit higher IMO.  The face needs to be in focus.</td>', 'A slight more dof and you would have score a bit higher IMO.  The face needs to be in focus.', '2007-10-01 09:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128002, 592392, 78196, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good here and the subject is a very interesting one. IMO a wee bit of USM could have done wonders here, and with these kind of shots it does help if the subject is looking into the camera.</td>', 'The lighting is good here and the subject is a very interesting one. IMO a wee bit of USM could have done wonders here, and with these kind of shots it does help if the subject is looking into the camera.', '2007-10-01 09:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128003, 592832, 30982, '<td valign="top">An very good capture of fireworks - good comp, crisp and clean, great color.</td>', 'An very good capture of fireworks - good comp, crisp and clean, great color.', '2007-10-01 09:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128004, 593762, 49109, '<td valign="top">good postcard-like shot. makes the eye wander around.</td>', 'good postcard-like shot. makes the eye wander around.', '2007-10-01 09:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128005, 591743, 53147, '<td valign="top">Really not a good image at all. It looks like the location has potential though. Really noisy and has a sloppy feel to its postprocessing.</td>', 'Really not a good image at all. It looks like the location has potential though. Really noisy and has a sloppy feel to its postprocessing.', '2007-10-01 09:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128006, 592706, 3569, '<td valign="top">Focus appears to be off where it is needed to me.</td>', 'Focus appears to be off where it is needed to me.', '2007-10-01 09:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128007, 593603, 30982, '<td valign="top">Do they want to land in water?  Lovely reflections - nice light for this.</td>', 'Do they want to land in water?  Lovely reflections - nice light for this.', '2007-10-01 09:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128008, 592684, 3569, '<td valign="top">the reds are a bit too much and unnatural to me.  Nice snake though.</td>', 'the reds are a bit too much and unnatural to me.  Nice snake though.', '2007-10-01 09:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128009, 593884, 78196, '<td valign="top">The top part of the sky is excellent, though perhaps a little dark. Below that it''s all a bit too bright and some of the clouds look unnaturally burnt out. Having said all that I really like the shot and the clouds at the top are super.</td>', 'The top part of the sky is excellent, though perhaps a little dark. Below that it''s all a bit too bright and some of the clouds look unnaturally burnt out. Having said all that I really like the shot and the clouds at the top are super.', '2007-10-01 09:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128010, 591716, 49109, '<td valign="top">good DOF and composition, too much shadows in front of her and on her front for my taste.</td>', 'good DOF and composition, too much shadows in front of her and on her front for my taste.', '2007-10-01 09:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128011, 581734, 3569, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Did you try a tighter crop.  I think a closer shot would have worked better.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Did you try a tighter crop.  I think a closer shot would have worked better.', '2007-10-01 09:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128012, 589327, 53147, '<td valign="top">Oh man this is a rough one. I think there are just too many things not good about this image to list. The one I will mention though is the border. Really bad border. If you are interested in more of a critique please feel free to PM.</td>', 'Oh man this is a rough one. I think there are just too many things not good about this image to list. The one I will mention though is the border. Really bad border. If you are interested in more of a critique please feel free to PM.', '2007-10-01 09:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128013, 592808, 49109, '<td valign="top">good color and crop. too soft overall.</td>', 'good color and crop. too soft overall.', '2007-10-01 09:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128014, 593754, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice conversion and an interesting subject. His expression seems to be hiding so many things.</td>', 'Nice conversion and an interesting subject. His expression seems to be hiding so many things.', '2007-10-01 09:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128015, 592565, 3569, '<td valign="top">not sure what it is, but your shot doesn''t look natural.  Over processing?</td>', 'not sure what it is, but your shot doesn''t look natural.  Over processing?', '2007-10-01 09:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128016, 592759, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice and quiet.  I like the one cloud and its reflection.</td>', 'Nice and quiet.  I like the one cloud and its reflection.', '2007-10-01 09:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128017, 593566, 49109, '<td valign="top">too tilted, too dark, too little detail.</td>', 'too tilted, too dark, too little detail.', '2007-10-01 09:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128018, 592301, 3569, '<td valign="top">a bit too dark to me.  Great subject though.</td>', 'a bit too dark to me.  Great subject though.', '2007-10-01 09:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128019, 594028, 3569, '<td valign="top">whites are to yellowish to me.</td>', 'whites are to yellowish to me.', '2007-10-01 09:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128022, 593461, 49109, '<td valign="top">very well composed, though the sky is quite dull you turned this into a very vivid scene</td>', 'very well composed, though the sky is quite dull you turned this into a very vivid scene', '2007-10-01 09:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128023, 590813, 3569, '<td valign="top">Add a bit mor brightness to the yellows and it would be stunning.</td>', 'Add a bit mor brightness to the yellows and it would be stunning.', '2007-10-01 09:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128024, 592093, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  I''d have titled it Mischief or Imp!  Cute expression.</td>', 'Heh!  I''d have titled it Mischief or Imp!  Cute expression.', '2007-10-01 09:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128026, 593908, 3569, '<td valign="top">If you had cropped the left side a bit more and a higher score from me.</td>', 'If you had cropped the left side a bit more and a higher score from me.', '2007-10-01 09:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128027, 593282, 78196, '<td valign="top">A daring composition which doesn''t quite work for me. Firstly, you need to lose that dark bit in the bottom left which is very easy to do under advanced editing. The crop is an awkward one - I would think if a little more of your subject was included it could work better. Overall I think the brightness of your background is interfering with your subject, the bit next to the arm is the most obvious example.</td>', 'A daring composition which doesn''t quite work for me. Firstly, you need to lose that dark bit in the bottom left which is very easy to do under advanced editing. The crop is an awkward one - I would think if a little more of your subject was included it could work better. Overall I think the brightness of your background is interfering with your subject, the bit next to the arm is the most obvious example.', '2007-10-01 09:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128029, 585834, 3569, '<td valign="top">nice sharpness and shading.</td>', 'nice sharpness and shading.', '2007-10-01 09:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128030, 587487, 78196, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting, but lacking a tiny bit in sharpness.</td>', 'Very nice lighting, but lacking a tiny bit in sharpness.', '2007-10-01 09:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128032, 593566, 3569, '<td valign="top">too spread out to me.  Closer is better, maybe on one musicial.</td>', 'too spread out to me.  Closer is better, maybe on one musicial.', '2007-10-01 09:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128033, 588995, 53147, '<td valign="top">Pretty rough shot. I normally like high key and high contrast type shots but this just feels blown. The desat also doesnt do much for th image either.</td>', 'Pretty rough shot. I normally like high key and high contrast type shots but this just feels blown. The desat also doesnt do much for th image either.', '2007-10-01 09:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128037, 593990, 3569, '<td valign="top">Just the face next time.  The face is so nice.</td>', 'Just the face next time.  The face is so nice.', '2007-10-01 09:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128038, 591985, 49109, '<td valign="top">very good natural portrait. composition is too centered, blown-out and blurry sky distracts, had cropped this to portrait format</td>', 'very good natural portrait. composition is too centered, blown-out and blurry sky distracts, had cropped this to portrait format', '2007-10-01 09:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128040, 593831, 3569, '<td valign="top">Too much open space on right to me.</td>', 'Too much open space on right to me.', '2007-10-01 09:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128041, 593452, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely well done portrait.  Has nice light from the side, nothing blown, clean whites of the eye (I''ve accepted that people prefer them that way, but I still like "normal" eyes), nice natural smile.  About the only thing I might suggest you''d have done differently is not have a top with a design on it.  Nice work.</td>', 'Lovely well done portrait.  Has nice light from the side, nothing blown, clean whites of the eye (I''ve accepted that people prefer them that way, but I still like "normal" eyes), nice natural smile.  About the only thing I might suggest you''d have done differently is not have a top with a design on it.  Nice work.', '2007-10-01 09:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128042, 591371, 53147, '<td valign="top">Man - what a sucky shot. I think this would have been better with a lighter feel to it. And the eyes are just way too black.</td>', 'Man - what a sucky shot. I think this would have been better with a lighter feel to it. And the eyes are just way too black.', '2007-10-01 09:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128043, 584358, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a slight tilt to the right.  Love the perspective.</td>', 'This has a slight tilt to the right.  Love the perspective.', '2007-10-01 09:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128044, 591335, 3569, '<td valign="top">Interesting take.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting take.  Nicely done.', '2007-10-01 09:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128046, 593819, 49109, '<td valign="top">way too soft overall, not a single detail to rest one''s eyes on.</td>', 'way too soft overall, not a single detail to rest one''s eyes on.', '2007-10-01 09:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128048, 592738, 53147, '<td valign="top">I think what would have made this shot better is if you had scrapped it and went with something else. Say like some fern type leaves using a cool mulitply layer or something. Yeah - that would have been awesome.</td>', 'I think what would have made this shot better is if you had scrapped it and went with something else. Say like some fern type leaves using a cool mulitply layer or something. Yeah - that would have been awesome.', '2007-10-01 09:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
