(4128051, 589735, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like this.  Now if I could only explain why, exactly, I like this... I love the fence as the supporting structure to the spider''s "pose" - I like the defensive/sensing pose of the subject.  I love the shadow of the links on the post and the fact you caught the spider in just the right place.  And of course the sky is a nice blue.</td>', 'Oh, I like this.  Now if I could only explain why, exactly, I like this... I love the fence as the supporting structure to the spider''s "pose" - I like the defensive/sensing pose of the subject.  I love the shadow of the links on the post and the fact you caught the spider in just the right place.  And of course the sky is a nice blue.', '2007-10-01 09:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128053, 593703, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks to have a vignette/halo around the edge of the mountain. Love the balloons.</td>', 'Looks to have a vignette/halo around the edge of the mountain. Love the balloons.', '2007-10-01 09:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128055, 584617, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very cool image. Had this just been the woman stretched out it would be severley lacking, but the child is a perfect fit. I also really like the expression on the moms face. Just a great sense of calm and contentment. One of my faves of the challenge.</td>', 'Very cool image. Had this just been the woman stretched out it would be severley lacking, but the child is a perfect fit. I also really like the expression on the moms face. Just a great sense of calm and contentment. One of my faves of the challenge.', '2007-10-01 09:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128056, 593603, 53147, '<td valign="top">One of my faves of the challenge. Great colors, detail, the reflection is so cool. Just an awesome pic overall. Hope this is scoring gangbusters for you.</td>', 'One of my faves of the challenge. Great colors, detail, the reflection is so cool. Just an awesome pic overall. Hope this is scoring gangbusters for you.', '2007-10-01 09:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128057, 593924, 3569, '<td valign="top">Good angle and eye.  Clean-up some of the small white spots and it would be much better.</td>', 'Good angle and eye.  Clean-up some of the small white spots and it would be much better.', '2007-10-01 09:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128058, 593315, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and perspective.</td>', 'Nice lighting and perspective.', '2007-10-01 09:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128059, 589090, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. The processing is appealing to me. I wish her foot wasnt cropped out.</td>', 'Very nice image. The processing is appealing to me. I wish her foot wasnt cropped out.', '2007-10-01 09:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128060, 582999, 3569, '<td valign="top">the face appears out-of-focus, can''t really tell.</td>', 'the face appears out-of-focus, can''t really tell.', '2007-10-01 09:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128061, 592872, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really nostalgic.  The horizon is tilted to the right a smidge.</td>', 'Really nostalgic.  The horizon is tilted to the right a smidge.', '2007-10-01 09:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128063, 584358, 3569, '<td valign="top">Quite nice in all ways</td>', 'Quite nice in all ways', '2007-10-01 09:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128066, 594049, 30982, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the clouds reflected, which I''m sure you did, too.  Love the composition in general. Well seen.</td>', 'I particularly like the clouds reflected, which I''m sure you did, too.  Love the composition in general. Well seen.', '2007-10-01 09:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128067, 593825, 15711, '<td valign="top">For some reason the watch really pulls my eye away from her face. Love the lighting.</td>', 'For some reason the watch really pulls my eye away from her face. Love the lighting.', '2007-10-01 09:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128068, 590208, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very interesting location and a very pleasing shot. I wish the building had more of a red/brown tone. As it is here it feels a bit too yellow/green and blends with the background too much. Wish it stood out a bit stronger. Very nice overall though.</td>', 'Very interesting location and a very pleasing shot. I wish the building had more of a red/brown tone. As it is here it feels a bit too yellow/green and blends with the background too much. Wish it stood out a bit stronger. Very nice overall though.', '2007-10-01 09:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128069, 587383, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely candid portrait here.  I have to be honest and say sometimes I struggle with the idea of PP''ing what is potentially a fairly emotive slice of someones life (possibly to do with the idea that I am not sure whether we should ''glamorise'' poverty etc) but I think you have done this well and discretely in this shot<br/> <br/>Good job</td>', 'Lovely candid portrait here.  I have to be honest and say sometimes I struggle with the idea of PP''ing what is potentially a fairly emotive slice of someones life (possibly to do with the idea that I am not sure whether we should ''glamorise'' poverty etc) but I think you have done this well and discretely in this shot Good job', '2007-10-01 09:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128070, 584617, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOAH.  Really unusual and so artfully done.  Beautiful lighting. 9</td>', 'WOAH.  Really unusual and so artfully done.  Beautiful lighting. 9', '2007-10-01 09:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128071, 593455, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very cool location. The composition holds up well to the busyness of of it all. I do wish the woman was just a bit further to the right. But as is its a very cool image. Good luck with this one.</td>', 'Very cool location. The composition holds up well to the busyness of of it all. I do wish the woman was just a bit further to the right. But as is its a very cool image. Good luck with this one.', '2007-10-01 09:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128072, 593478, 53147, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Great colors and textures. The flowing curtain gives life to an otherwise desolate feeling image. Probably isnt scoring great for you (or as well as I would like to see it) as it isnt really a DPC friendly image. But I will hopefully help out. 8 for now.</td>', 'I really like this shot. Great colors and textures. The flowing curtain gives life to an otherwise desolate feeling image. Probably isnt scoring great for you (or as well as I would like to see it) as it isnt really a DPC friendly image. But I will hopefully help out. 8 for now.', '2007-10-01 09:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128073, 589681, 68035, '<td valign="top">Very nice Pano shot.  I like the light flares (though you can be sure that others wont) beuatiful purple sky and the border works well</td>', 'Very nice Pano shot.  I like the light flares (though you can be sure that others wont) beuatiful purple sky and the border works well', '2007-10-01 09:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128074, 593159, 3569, '<td valign="top">Its running off the page.  To me, the fence/rail needs to begin a bit more on right side and continue to the center to keep my eye from sliding off the edge..</td>', 'Its running off the page.  To me, the fence/rail needs to begin a bit more on right side and continue to the center to keep my eye from sliding off the edge..', '2007-10-01 09:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128075, 593924, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love this.  Anytime I see swim pics, I have to comment. Great diagonal line. I wish the red lane markers were parallel with the horizon line though. Nice shot.</td>', 'Love this.  Anytime I see swim pics, I have to comment. Great diagonal line. I wish the red lane markers were parallel with the horizon line though. Nice shot.', '2007-10-01 09:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128077, 591909, 53147, '<td valign="top">Be careful - he might suffocate. Very cool capture and excellent processing. But if my assumptions are correct this is nothing unusual.</td>', 'Be careful - he might suffocate. Very cool capture and excellent processing. But if my assumptions are correct this is nothing unusual.', '2007-10-01 09:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128078, 594037, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting with the lane dividers and the lines of the rays almost intersecting.  Wonderful tones.</td>', 'Interesting with the lane dividers and the lines of the rays almost intersecting.  Wonderful tones.', '2007-10-01 09:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128080, 592860, 30982, '<td valign="top">This wants to have a story to it, but I''m not sure what that story wants to be.  What is she looking at, why is the shot cut off where it is?  I like the shadow of the stairs and the glint of sunshine on her earring.  I''m not fond of the way the shot is cropped at the bottom though I''m sure you probably intended it that way and I just can''t figure it out.</td>', 'This wants to have a story to it, but I''m not sure what that story wants to be.  What is she looking at, why is the shot cut off where it is?  I like the shadow of the stairs and the glint of sunshine on her earring.  I''m not fond of the way the shot is cropped at the bottom though I''m sure you probably intended it that way and I just can''t figure it out.', '2007-10-01 09:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128081, 593549, 3569, '<td valign="top">Brighten the whites a bit more in the middle cloud and you have a winner.</td>', 'Brighten the whites a bit more in the middle cloud and you have a winner.', '2007-10-01 09:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128083, 592885, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very cool image. Great location and just the right amount of mist. 8</td>', 'Very cool image. Great location and just the right amount of mist. 8', '2007-10-01 09:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128084, 590403, 68035, '<td valign="top">Excellent landscape which really illustrates the bleak harshness of the desert well.  Not sure whether this was taken from up a mountain or in the air.   Super entry 7</td>', 'Excellent landscape which really illustrates the bleak harshness of the desert well.  Not sure whether this was taken from up a mountain or in the air.   Super entry 7', '2007-10-01 09:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128085, 594085, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great timing.</td>', 'Great timing.', '2007-10-01 09:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128087, 593452, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice honest portrait. I wish her hair wasn''t covering the eye to our right.  Not loving the frame. I''d remove the brown border. She''s lovely.</td>', 'Nice honest portrait. I wish her hair wasn''t covering the eye to our right.  Not loving the frame. I''d remove the brown border. She''s lovely.', '2007-10-01 09:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128088, 585397, 15711, '<td valign="top">OH there she is!!!!!  Stunning and just wonderful.</td>', 'OH there she is!!!!!  Stunning and just wonderful.', '2007-10-01 09:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128089, 593385, 3569, '<td valign="top">Slightly over-sharped to me.</td>', 'Slightly over-sharped to me.', '2007-10-01 09:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128091, 593637, 53147, '<td valign="top">Adorable image. Perfect pose and wonderful processing. I love shots like these that are done right. And this is done very right. Bumping up to 9.</td>', 'Adorable image. Perfect pose and wonderful processing. I love shots like these that are done right. And this is done very right. Bumping up to 9.', '2007-10-01 09:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128093, 587211, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great colors, lighting and general textures. I think this would work great as a print.</td>', 'Great colors, lighting and general textures. I think this would work great as a print.', '2007-10-01 09:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128094, 593597, 15711, '<td valign="top">The setting is gorgeous.  It seems a touch blanched out in the mountain department.  I''d love to see an adjustment of possibly curves or levels.  Perfect focus and detail though. ;~D</td>', 'The setting is gorgeous.  It seems a touch blanched out in the mountain department.  I''d love to see an adjustment of possibly curves or levels.  Perfect focus and detail though. ;~D', '2007-10-01 09:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128095, 587890, 78196, '<td valign="top">Well lit and an unusual choice of colour for your background. However if I''m being honest there doesn''t seem to be anything interesting in her expression. I don''t feel any sort of communication or empathy with the subject. It''s all a subjective thing and others will probably think differently.</td>', 'Well lit and an unusual choice of colour for your background. However if I''m being honest there doesn''t seem to be anything interesting in her expression. I don''t feel any sort of communication or empathy with the subject. It''s all a subjective thing and others will probably think differently.', '2007-10-01 09:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128096, 583294, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I like the lighting on her body but the shadow on her head/hair seems a touch odd.</td>', 'Interesting. I like the lighting on her body but the shadow on her head/hair seems a touch odd.', '2007-10-01 09:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128097, 592299, 53147, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for a good spider shot, and this falls right there. Great detail and very nice DOF on the web. I do think the border detracts from it though. Takes away from the softness of the web on the edges.</td>', 'I am a sucker for a good spider shot, and this falls right there. Great detail and very nice DOF on the web. I do think the border detracts from it though. Takes away from the softness of the web on the edges.', '2007-10-01 09:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128099, 593461, 68035, '<td valign="top">I have to say i really like this shot.  The diagonal that you have created with the lines from the kite is understated but cool.  Equally I have to say great cropping to get the kit flier and the kite positioned as they are<br/> <br/>The other people in the frame should really be a distraction, but for some reason they arent and add to the general feel of the shot<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'I have to say i really like this shot.  The diagonal that you have created with the lines from the kite is understated but cool.  Equally I have to say great cropping to get the kit flier and the kite positioned as they are The other people in the frame should really be a distraction, but for some reason they arent and add to the general feel of the shot 8', '2007-10-01 09:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128100, 593573, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus and catch lights.  She''s a cutie.  She looks a bit concerned. LOL</td>', 'Perfect focus and catch lights.  She''s a cutie.  She looks a bit concerned. LOL', '2007-10-01 09:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128101, 589371, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting angle on this structure, but overexposed with respect to the sky.  That leaves the shot feeling a bit washed out.  About the only way I know to compensate for a bright sky like that and still keep the light correct on your subject is to use filters of some kind, and I''m not familiar enough with them to tell you how to use them.  I still think it''s a really cool angle.</td>', 'An interesting angle on this structure, but overexposed with respect to the sky.  That leaves the shot feeling a bit washed out.  About the only way I know to compensate for a bright sky like that and still keep the light correct on your subject is to use filters of some kind, and I''m not familiar enough with them to tell you how to use them.  I still think it''s a really cool angle.', '2007-10-01 09:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128102, 581610, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very cool image. I am curious as to how you achieved this in advanced editing. Hope you listed your details. This could do very well if it passes validation. 8</td>', 'Very cool image. I am curious as to how you achieved this in advanced editing. Hope you listed your details. This could do very well if it passes validation. 8', '2007-10-01 09:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128103, 591228, 15711, '<td valign="top">Man, you Icelanders have it over any of the rest of us when it comes to landscapes and skies.  I recognize the locale from previous entries. Man, that aurora borealis is something isn''t it?</td>', 'Man, you Icelanders have it over any of the rest of us when it comes to landscapes and skies.  I recognize the locale from previous entries. Man, that aurora borealis is something isn''t it?', '2007-10-01 09:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128105, 592976, 78196, '<td valign="top">A lovely subject, sensibly composed and with a well-chosen border. However this isn''t going to score highly because the image is too dark and the subject not sharp enough. I''m spotting noise artefacts around the top of the petals as well.</td>', 'A lovely subject, sensibly composed and with a well-chosen border. However this isn''t going to score highly because the image is too dark and the subject not sharp enough. I''m spotting noise artefacts around the top of the petals as well.', '2007-10-01 09:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128106, 593596, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great detail on this shot. Interesting pose and model. Lit wonderfully and excellent processing.</td>', 'Great detail on this shot. Interesting pose and model. Lit wonderfully and excellent processing.', '2007-10-01 09:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128107, 593916, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well seen and very appropriately titled.</td>', 'Very well seen and very appropriately titled.', '2007-10-01 09:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128108, 593317, 68035, '<td valign="top">I always think that late september is one of the best times to visit Venice (not too hot/smelly) or overly crowded.  A very nice shot with a wonderful range of colours (it reminds me of a jigsaw) possibly could have done with a touch of dodging and burning to bring the sky out but other than that very good</td>', 'I always think that late september is one of the best times to visit Venice (not too hot/smelly) or overly crowded.  A very nice shot with a wonderful range of colours (it reminds me of a jigsaw) possibly could have done with a touch of dodging and burning to bring the sky out but other than that very good', '2007-10-01 09:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128109, 580764, 53147, '<td valign="top">This looks like an outtake from an earlier ribbon winner. And a good choice as well. Excellent DOF and very pleasing colors. I hope this does well for you.</td>', 'This looks like an outtake from an earlier ribbon winner. And a good choice as well. Excellent DOF and very pleasing colors. I hope this does well for you.', '2007-10-01 09:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128110, 593603, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow - talk about post card material.</td>', 'Wow - talk about post card material.', '2007-10-01 09:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128111, 593571, 78196, '<td valign="top">A great subject and a well composed photo. However, it isn''t particularly sharp and the orange/red of the beat and the legs appears unnaturally saturated.</td>', 'A great subject and a well composed photo. However, it isn''t particularly sharp and the orange/red of the beat and the legs appears unnaturally saturated.', '2007-10-01 09:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128113, 593692, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m sensing a bit of blotching in the background.  I might do a selective adjustment and up the black a smidge.  I just love this grass with its graceful curves.</td>', 'I''m sensing a bit of blotching in the background.  I might do a selective adjustment and up the black a smidge.  I just love this grass with its graceful curves.', '2007-10-01 09:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128114, 589763, 78196, '<td valign="top">That is without question the strangest-looking spider I''ve ever seen. It''s a well taken shot but I wonder whether you could have been more daring with the DOF, especially bearing in mind how busy the background is.</td>', 'That is without question the strangest-looking spider I''ve ever seen. It''s a well taken shot but I wonder whether you could have been more daring with the DOF, especially bearing in mind how busy the background is.', '2007-10-01 09:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128118, 592299, 78196, '<td valign="top">The lighting is super on this but the DOF is too narrow - the spider''s back isn''t in focus.</td>', 'The lighting is super on this but the DOF is too narrow - the spider''s back isn''t in focus.', '2007-10-01 09:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128120, 593787, 30982, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look pleased with you for shooting her but the result is quite nice.  It has an ever so slight greenish tint to it but it doesn''t really bother me.</td>', 'She doesn''t look pleased with you for shooting her but the result is quite nice.  It has an ever so slight greenish tint to it but it doesn''t really bother me.', '2007-10-01 09:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128121, 592301, 78196, '<td valign="top">Gosh. With eye contact with the subject and better lighting this could have been absolutely exceptional. It''s still a fascinating face to look at, though.</td>', 'Gosh. With eye contact with the subject and better lighting this could have been absolutely exceptional. It''s still a fascinating face to look at, though.', '2007-10-01 09:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128122, 588605, 68035, '<td valign="top">So much to like about this photo, yet if I am being 100% honest somehow the mix of a lot of great elements doesnt quite come together.  I dont know whether I can pinpoint what it is but I feel that it is in part to do with the colours.  Sorry if this sounds like a negative comment, it is not meant to be and I would say that I do like the shot a lot</td>', 'So much to like about this photo, yet if I am being 100% honest somehow the mix of a lot of great elements doesnt quite come together.  I dont know whether I can pinpoint what it is but I feel that it is in part to do with the colours.  Sorry if this sounds like a negative comment, it is not meant to be and I would say that I do like the shot a lot', '2007-10-01 09:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128124, 593024, 15711, '<td valign="top">A bit over exposed but the focus on the fly is good.</td>', 'A bit over exposed but the focus on the fly is good.', '2007-10-01 09:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128125, 593523, 15711, '<td valign="top">hee hee - there is another shot of these guys from someone else. ;~D</td>', 'hee hee - there is another shot of these guys from someone else. ;~D', '2007-10-01 09:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128126, 584360, 53147, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Very nice detail and DOF and a pleasing composition. I guess my biggest complaint is the border. Doesnt do anything to help the image at all.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Very nice detail and DOF and a pleasing composition. I guess my biggest complaint is the border. Doesnt do anything to help the image at all.', '2007-10-01 09:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
