(4128129, 588995, 78196, '<td valign="top">This is going to bomb I''m afraid. The image is obviously taken with a very low quality camera (camera phone?) and the subject is completely blown out by the flash. Even without these flaws the shot isn''t interesting enough to compete in a free study.</td>', 'This is going to bomb I''m afraid. The image is obviously taken with a very low quality camera (camera phone?) and the subject is completely blown out by the flash. Even without these flaws the shot isn''t interesting enough to compete in a free study.', '2007-10-01 09:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
