(4128234, 593379, 78196, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to spot the smile. A daring shot to put in a free study - I think it could do with a little more contrast to really blacken the blacks and make the colours jump out a bit more. Noise reduction wouldn''t hurt either.</td>', 'Took me a second to spot the smile. A daring shot to put in a free study - I think it could do with a little more contrast to really blacken the blacks and make the colours jump out a bit more. Noise reduction wouldn''t hurt either.', '2007-10-01 10:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128236, 589327, 8643, '<td valign="top">Great subject but can I see camera shake?</td>', 'Great subject but can I see camera shake?', '2007-10-01 10:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128238, 594029, 46177, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and lovely crop. I wish the Dragonfly was a little lighter for more contrast but still nicely captured.</td>', 'Very pretty and lovely crop. I wish the Dragonfly was a little lighter for more contrast but still nicely captured.', '2007-10-01 10:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128240, 590603, 78196, '<td valign="top">Super black and white - the light is amazing.</td>', 'Super black and white - the light is amazing.', '2007-10-01 10:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128241, 593806, 46177, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting. What is she hiding from??</td>', 'Great composition and lighting. What is she hiding from??', '2007-10-01 10:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128242, 594084, 78196, '<td valign="top">This should do well. Really excellent B&amp;W.</td>', 'This should do well. Really excellent B&W.', '2007-10-01 10:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128243, 593703, 8643, '<td valign="top">A tad oversharpened for my taste.</td>', 'A tad oversharpened for my taste.', '2007-10-01 10:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128244, 594049, 46177, '<td valign="top">I like the crop and subdued colours, very nice.</td>', 'I like the crop and subdued colours, very nice.', '2007-10-01 10:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128246, 593466, 15711, '<td valign="top">Woah - love the Moody Blues'' reference. Great shot. His eyes have such an intensity to them.  Sad and emotive. 7</td>', 'Woah - love the Moody Blues'' reference. Great shot. His eyes have such an intensity to them.  Sad and emotive. 7', '2007-10-01 10:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128248, 592990, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great treatment. Love the colors and dark tones.</td>', 'Great treatment. Love the colors and dark tones.', '2007-10-01 10:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128249, 593455, 46177, '<td valign="top">Overall very interesting shot. I think it would have been a little more interesting if the girl was more in the third, but still well done.</td>', 'Overall very interesting shot. I think it would have been a little more interesting if the girl was more in the third, but still well done.', '2007-10-01 10:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128250, 592898, 78196, '<td valign="top">I''m really sorry but I''m unable to spot a grammatical mistake and not correct it - your ''it''s'' in the title should not have an apostrophe.<br/> <br/>That aside, a lovely and well composed photograph spoilt a little by the harsh lighting which has created a blown-out highlight on the main subject.</td>', 'I''m really sorry but I''m unable to spot a grammatical mistake and not correct it - your ''it''s'' in the title should not have an apostrophe. That aside, a lovely and well composed photograph spoilt a little by the harsh lighting which has created a blown-out highlight on the main subject.', '2007-10-01 10:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128254, 592234, 46177, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and lighting.</td>', 'Great contrast and lighting.', '2007-10-01 10:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128255, 591901, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh that is cool. Eerie. Love the blue tones.</td>', 'Oh that is cool. Eerie. Love the blue tones.', '2007-10-01 10:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128258, 593325, 46177, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, love the pure black back ground makes him really stand out.</td>', 'Very cool shot, love the pure black back ground makes him really stand out.', '2007-10-01 10:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128260, 594068, 15711, '<td valign="top">How wonderful.  Their distorted long noses make them look so comical. Great bokeh.  This is fabulous.</td>', 'How wonderful.  Their distorted long noses make them look so comical. Great bokeh.  This is fabulous.', '2007-10-01 10:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128262, 593703, 78196, '<td valign="top">This would have been a lovely shot were it not for the completely overdone post-processing. The blue sky is dreadful and has created a halo effect around the balloons.</td>', 'This would have been a lovely shot were it not for the completely overdone post-processing. The blue sky is dreadful and has created a halo effect around the balloons.', '2007-10-01 10:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128264, 590813, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOVE LOVE!!!  I''d kill the wide border though - it''s a touch distracting from those divine leaves.  I''m such a fan of fall colors!!!!</td>', 'LOVE LOVE!!!  I''d kill the wide border though - it''s a touch distracting from those divine leaves.  I''m such a fan of fall colors!!!!', '2007-10-01 10:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128268, 591622, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is fantastic. The lighting, his expression - the placement of his arms.  WOW  This has a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=5728" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">kiwiness</a> feel to it. Love the harlequin sweater. Great tones.</td>', 'Oh this is fantastic. The lighting, his expression - the placement of his arms.  WOW  This has a  kiwiness feel to it. Love the harlequin sweater. Great tones.', '2007-10-01 10:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128270, 593714, 15711, '<td valign="top">So pretty!!!  Usually you think of bright but this really works with the deeper tones.</td>', 'So pretty!!!  Usually you think of bright but this really works with the deeper tones.', '2007-10-01 10:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128273, 593827, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a stunning horse.  My only complaint is that his eye looks a touch flat with no light reflection.  What a beauty.</td>', 'What a stunning horse.  My only complaint is that his eye looks a touch flat with no light reflection.  What a beauty.', '2007-10-01 10:13:04.000000', NULL, 1);
