(4128283, 590290, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!  great composition and light. The hint of reddish purple in the duotone adds an unexpected bit of color.  Well done.</td>', 'WOW!!!  great composition and light. The hint of reddish purple in the duotone adds an unexpected bit of color.  Well done.', '2007-10-01 10:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
