(4128321, 593530, 53147, '<td valign="top">An ok candid. The processing feels a bit off and overall just an ok shot. Nothign really powerful or wow about it. PS - I think rhythm is spelled wrong - but who am I to complain - I spelled it wrong in one of my past entries as well.</td>', 'An ok candid. The processing feels a bit off and overall just an ok shot. Nothign really powerful or wow about it. PS - I think rhythm is spelled wrong - but who am I to complain - I spelled it wrong in one of my past entries as well.', '2007-10-01 10:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
