(4128443, 592592, 25728, '<td valign="top">I like it quite a bit, but I think I am turned off by the unnaturally saturated cyans and greens. They contrast delightfully with the warm tones, but they are just a hair over the "actually occurring in nature" line. Otherwise, you were spot on in your composition and timing (waves and tides). The mist in the distance helped to add to the fairytale sort of feel you have going on here. Overall, fantastic shot but be careful about being too heavy handed on the Cyan saturation.</td>', 'I like it quite a bit, but I think I am turned off by the unnaturally saturated cyans and greens. They contrast delightfully with the warm tones, but they are just a hair over the "actually occurring in nature" line. Otherwise, you were spot on in your composition and timing (waves and tides). The mist in the distance helped to add to the fairytale sort of feel you have going on here. Overall, fantastic shot but be careful about being too heavy handed on the Cyan saturation.', '2007-10-01 10:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128445, 592496, 2223, '<td valign="top">Very nice... love the dof and the color tones.</td>', 'Very nice... love the dof and the color tones.', '2007-10-01 10:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
