(4128469, 591743, 73235, '<td valign="top">I like your composition. Unfortunately the technical part let''s you down,<br/>For a silhouette the background is too dark (not enough contrast). I assume that this was not your intention. In advanced editing you can process the same picture twice. Once for the foreground, to brighten the light house and the wave (good timing btw). The second time for the sky. Then you can combine both and you have a picture that shows more details in the forewgroud and keeps the dramatic sky.<br/>IMO the picture is a bit oversharpened (bright halo arond the edges) and suffers from a lot of noise (high ISO?).</td>', 'I like your composition. Unfortunately the technical part let''s you down,For a silhouette the background is too dark (not enough contrast). I assume that this was not your intention. In advanced editing you can process the same picture twice. Once for the foreground, to brighten the light house and the wave (good timing btw). The second time for the sky. Then you can combine both and you have a picture that shows more details in the forewgroud and keeps the dramatic sky.IMO the picture is a bit oversharpened (bright halo arond the edges) and suffers from a lot of noise (high ISO?).', '2007-10-01 10:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
