(4128569, 593411, 25728, '<td valign="top">Very nice balance of Ambient with Flash! Not easy to do, and the sun catch in the background only attests to your timing. Great shot.</td>', 'Very nice balance of Ambient with Flash! Not easy to do, and the sun catch in the background only attests to your timing. Great shot.', '2007-10-01 11:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
