(4128574, 593163, 43774, '<td valign="top">Sweet horse, good pose. Unfortunately your depth of field is too shallow and the entire horse''s face is not in focus. I guess that is because of the early morning light which is not bright enough. Not sure if fill flash would have helped.</td>', 'Sweet horse, good pose. Unfortunately your depth of field is too shallow and the entire horse''s face is not in focus. I guess that is because of the early morning light which is not bright enough. Not sure if fill flash would have helped.', '2007-10-01 11:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128575, 592074, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I love the color.</td>', 'Very nicely done. I love the color.', '2007-10-01 11:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128576, 581010, 70000, '<td valign="top">adorable, well composed, the colors are off so I think a black and white of this would have looked better and then the graininess would have matched the rest of the photo</td>', 'adorable, well composed, the colors are off so I think a black and white of this would have looked better and then the graininess would have matched the rest of the photo', '2007-10-01 11:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
