(4128589, 593835, 46177, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous eyes, I just wish the midtones had been a little lighter so I could see more of her face. Nice crop and pose and I love the softness. 8</td>', 'Gorgeous eyes, I just wish the midtones had been a little lighter so I could see more of her face. Nice crop and pose and I love the softness. 8', '2007-10-01 11:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
