(4128705, 586043, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely. The purple bokeh adds tremendously to the colors in the parrot. Plus his eye is tack-sharp. Great work. 8.</td>', 'This is really lovely. The purple bokeh adds tremendously to the colors in the parrot. Plus his eye is tack-sharp. Great work. 8.', '2007-10-01 11:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
