(4128710, 593050, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the expression and feeling of movement in the shirt. I''m not wild about the color of the b/g - I don''t think it does anything for the subject. Still a nice, clean pregnancy photo that Claudia ought to like a lot.</td>', 'I like the expression and feeling of movement in the shirt. I''m not wild about the color of the b/g - I don''t think it does anything for the subject. Still a nice, clean pregnancy photo that Claudia ought to like a lot.', '2007-10-01 11:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
