(4128716, 586679, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - creative and nicely composed. I''ll bet it would make a beautiful framed print. 8.</td>', 'I like this a lot - creative and nicely composed. I''ll bet it would make a beautiful framed print. 8.', '2007-10-01 11:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
