(4128870, 593747, 53147, '<td valign="top">Kind of cool clouds but the colors just feel way overdone. Doesnt stand up well against other landscapes in the challenge.</td>', 'Kind of cool clouds but the colors just feel way overdone. Doesnt stand up well against other landscapes in the challenge.', '2007-10-01 11:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
