(4128885, 589702, 53147, '<td valign="top">Simple shot. Wish it was processed a bit heavier. As it is it has a bit of a flat feeling to it.</td>', 'Simple shot. Wish it was processed a bit heavier. As it is it has a bit of a flat feeling to it.', '2007-10-01 11:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
