(4128895, 592879, 73235, '<td valign="top">very colorful and high contrast picture. considereing the lighting (no flash) good exposure. If I had one suggestion for imporvement: the focus is on his chest, not on his face/eyes. You probaly went with center-point focus? If you select a focus point that is in his face, well, you get his face in focus. brilliant logic, isn''t it? :) <br/>The contrast between the blue background the the skin tones works very well here.</td>', 'very colorful and high contrast picture. considereing the lighting (no flash) good exposure. If I had one suggestion for imporvement: the focus is on his chest, not on his face/eyes. You probaly went with center-point focus? If you select a focus point that is in his face, well, you get his face in focus. brilliant logic, isn''t it? :) The contrast between the blue background the the skin tones works very well here.', '2007-10-01 11:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4128899, 593703, 3102, '<td valign="top">Eeee-gads.  Why couldn''t you have left the sky alone...!?  I''d bet the original image would have done really well, but the fake blue sky is terribly distracting here.</td>', 'Eeee-gads.  Why couldn''t you have left the sky alone...!?  I''d bet the original image would have done really well, but the fake blue sky is terribly distracting here.', '2007-10-01 11:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
