(4128930, 583708, 53147, '<td valign="top">I normally like cow pics but this one falls a bit flat. The horizon is a bit off and makes me feel like everyone is leaning to the right. A bit flat in colors and lighting. I think I personally prefer my cows a tad overprocessed.</td>', 'I normally like cow pics but this one falls a bit flat. The horizon is a bit off and makes me feel like everyone is leaning to the right. A bit flat in colors and lighting. I think I personally prefer my cows a tad overprocessed.', '2007-10-01 12:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
