(4128952, 593123, 66597, '<td valign="top">Most interesting. I like the DOF and highlighted area of the web. I think this would be much stronger if the white area to the very left were burned out. It draws attention away from the spiders.</td>', 'Most interesting. I like the DOF and highlighted area of the web. I think this would be much stronger if the white area to the very left were burned out. It draws attention away from the spiders.', '2007-10-01 12:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
