(4128957, 593484, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but could be a little sharper. I think the size constraints work against you on this one.</td>', 'Very pretty, but could be a little sharper. I think the size constraints work against you on this one.', '2007-10-01 12:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
