(4129443, 586490, 66597, '<td valign="top">The dew drops are fabulous here! A slightly shorter DOF would make this even more stunning, but it''s a great photo.</td>', 'The dew drops are fabulous here! A slightly shorter DOF would make this even more stunning, but it''s a great photo.', '2007-10-01 13:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
