(4129480, 592520, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice candid scene. with the movie star pictures in the background the left man makes me think he was Al Pacino. Crop at left is a bit tight and lights on the right mans shirt are blown, but that''s a minor flaw.</td>', 'nice candid scene. with the movie star pictures in the background the left man makes me think he was Al Pacino. Crop at left is a bit tight and lights on the right mans shirt are blown, but that''s a minor flaw.', '2007-10-01 13:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129481, 593284, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely gorgeous. Wonderful long exposure and rich colors. My first 10 of this challenge.</td>', 'This is absolutely gorgeous. Wonderful long exposure and rich colors. My first 10 of this challenge.', '2007-10-01 13:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129483, 593518, 40088, '<td valign="top">nice light on the mountains, I like this sort of blue and green colors</td>', 'nice light on the mountains, I like this sort of blue and green colors', '2007-10-01 13:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129484, 593568, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  The shot has a great mood to it.  One of my top picks this time.</td>', 'Great colors.  The shot has a great mood to it.  One of my top picks this time.', '2007-10-01 13:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129487, 593740, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait work and I realize the hair over half the face is intentional (and very pretty hair - love the color) but I would liked just a bit of that side of the face, too.  This does work nicely, though.</td>', 'Nice portrait work and I realize the hair over half the face is intentional (and very pretty hair - love the color) but I would liked just a bit of that side of the face, too.  This does work nicely, though.', '2007-10-01 13:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129488, 593882, 66597, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this doesn''t work so well for me. The monastery looks unnaturally white (with parts blown out) against the gray cliffs. I think this might be more effective in color?</td>', 'Sorry, this doesn''t work so well for me. The monastery looks unnaturally white (with parts blown out) against the gray cliffs. I think this might be more effective in color?', '2007-10-01 13:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129491, 585669, 40088, '<td valign="top">nice photo, these bees look so soft and wooly</td>', 'nice photo, these bees look so soft and wooly', '2007-10-01 14:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129492, 593803, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I love how his face is so still despite the rest of the motion.  Hotel lobby or office?  ''Twere me I''d have cloned the fire alarm box mostly to get rid of that bit of red up there.  Still, a fun and enjoyably odd shot.</td>', 'LOL!  I love how his face is so still despite the rest of the motion.  Hotel lobby or office?  ''Twere me I''d have cloned the fire alarm box mostly to get rid of that bit of red up there.  Still, a fun and enjoyably odd shot.', '2007-10-01 14:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129494, 593835, 71188, '<td valign="top">Tad too dark.</td>', 'Tad too dark.', '2007-10-01 14:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129496, 593734, 71188, '<td valign="top">Nice fall colors.</td>', 'Nice fall colors.', '2007-10-01 14:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129497, 593786, 674, '<td valign="top">First Impression: a beautiful bird image<br/>Presentation: good<br/>What I Like: the sharp focus on the feathers<br/>What I dont Like: The dark splodges at the bottom<br/>IMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes<br/> <br/>Composition: good<br/>Background :would have been better if you could have got just blue sky.<br/>Subject Placement:good<br/>Cropping:good<br/>Focus: excellent<br/>Exposure: v good<br/>Editing:good<br/> <br/>Total Averaged Rating :6</td>', 'First Impression: a beautiful bird imagePresentation: goodWhat I Like: the sharp focus on the feathersWhat I dont Like: The dark splodges at the bottomIMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes Composition: goodBackground :would have been better if you could have got just blue sky.Subject Placement:goodCropping:goodFocus: excellentExposure: v goodEditing:good Total Averaged Rating :6', '2007-10-01 14:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129499, 593603, 71188, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Love the colors and reflections.</td>', 'Nice shot. Love the colors and reflections.', '2007-10-01 14:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
