(4129509, 591371, 674, '<td valign="top">First Impression: a visitor from outer space<br/>Presentation:fair<br/>What I Like:the catch lights<br/>What I dont Like: you''ve cut two of his feet off<br/>IMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes<br/> <br/>Composition: good<br/>Background : good<br/>Subject Placement: good<br/>Cropping: a bit too tight<br/>Focus: excellent macro<br/>Exposure:good<br/>Editing: good<br/> <br/>Total Averaged Rating :</td>', 'First Impression: a visitor from outer spacePresentation:fairWhat I Like:the catch lightsWhat I dont Like: you''ve cut two of his feet offIMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes Composition: goodBackground : goodSubject Placement: goodCropping: a bit too tightFocus: excellent macroExposure:goodEditing: good Total Averaged Rating :', '2007-10-01 14:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129513, 591157, 40088, '<td valign="top">very nice scene, the softness works well</td>', 'very nice scene, the softness works well', '2007-10-01 14:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129517, 588375, 30982, '<td valign="top">A well balanced landscape.  I like how the angle of the clouds follows that of the hills.</td>', 'A well balanced landscape.  I like how the angle of the clouds follows that of the hills.', '2007-10-01 14:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129520, 593610, 40088, '<td valign="top">the high contrast grabs the attention very well, leading lines rules of thirds all good</td>', 'the high contrast grabs the attention very well, leading lines rules of thirds all good', '2007-10-01 14:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129522, 594049, 73235, '<td valign="top">Nice old truck. unfortunately your composition does not do it justice.<br/>I like the idea you had, showing the garage sign, a shallower DOF would have blurred the sign more and would have highlighted the truck.<br/>I wish you would have waited for the shadow to cover the entire truck, not just parts of it - causing the high contrast areas. If you look at the words Chevrolet in front, you see how beautifully the blue sky shows up in the shady part and how washed out the left part is. The reflections of the clauds/sky in the windshield also take away from your picture. Just a person opinion, but I would not have cut the light in half. <br/>All of this is just my thinking and my ideas. Showing the beauty of cars is not easy. Usually it''s done by unusual/low angles and from the side.</td>', 'Nice old truck. unfortunately your composition does not do it justice.I like the idea you had, showing the garage sign, a shallower DOF would have blurred the sign more and would have highlighted the truck.I wish you would have waited for the shadow to cover the entire truck, not just parts of it - causing the high contrast areas. If you look at the words Chevrolet in front, you see how beautifully the blue sky shows up in the shady part and how washed out the left part is. The reflections of the clauds/sky in the windshield also take away from your picture. Just a person opinion, but I would not have cut the light in half. All of this is just my thinking and my ideas. Showing the beauty of cars is not easy. Usually it''s done by unusual/low angles and from the side.', '2007-10-01 14:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129523, 580764, 73235, '<td valign="top">I love the shallow DOF. beautiful and supporting bokeh. good focus</td>', 'I love the shallow DOF. beautiful and supporting bokeh. good focus', '2007-10-01 14:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129525, 593184, 674, '<td valign="top">First Impression: nice record shot<br/>Presentation: good<br/>What I Like: the way the branch partially frames the image<br/>What I dont Like: the lighting is harsh<br/>IMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes<br/> <br/>Composition: nicely composed<br/>Background : good<br/>Subject Placement: a little too central but good<br/>Cropping: good<br/>Focus: good<br/>Exposure: too brightly lit has blown the light feathers<br/>Editing: good<br/> <br/>Total Averaged Rating :7</td>', 'First Impression: nice record shotPresentation: goodWhat I Like: the way the branch partially frames the imageWhat I dont Like: the lighting is harshIMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes Composition: nicely composedBackground : goodSubject Placement: a little too central but goodCropping: goodFocus: goodExposure: too brightly lit has blown the light feathersEditing: good Total Averaged Rating :7', '2007-10-01 14:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129526, 591743, 40088, '<td valign="top">this sort of light is very special IRL and on this photo the effect is still there, well done!</td>', 'this sort of light is very special IRL and on this photo the effect is still there, well done!', '2007-10-01 14:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
