(4129532, 584289, 73235, '<td valign="top">I look at your picture and feel that something does not fit. Dn''t get me wrong, technically your pciture is sound and solid. When I was the little girls age, I thought the waves were HUGE and the beach endless. Somehow the perspective of your picture does not support the title. Beuatiful colors and placement of your models</td>', 'I look at your picture and feel that something does not fit. Dn''t get me wrong, technically your pciture is sound and solid. When I was the little girls age, I thought the waves were HUGE and the beach endless. Somehow the perspective of your picture does not support the title. Beuatiful colors and placement of your models', '2007-10-01 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4129534, 593744, 73235, '<td valign="top">good focus, strong colors, nice bokeh, a well rounded macro shot. good job</td>', 'good focus, strong colors, nice bokeh, a well rounded macro shot. good job', '2007-10-01 14:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
