(4129563, 586453, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice expressions captured here and that''s more than half the battle shooting people.  Focus is a tad soft, and it''s a bit "flat" as they say, but it looks like natural light and unless you carry around reflectors, it''s hard to get natural light to go where you want it to on demand.</td>', 'Nice expressions captured here and that''s more than half the battle shooting people.  Focus is a tad soft, and it''s a bit "flat" as they say, but it looks like natural light and unless you carry around reflectors, it''s hard to get natural light to go where you want it to on demand.', '2007-10-01 14:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
