(4129985, 589467, 43774, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fine family outing. Unfortunately I am let down by the technicals of the photo. It looks tilted. Not sure what processing you used but I can see halos around the people and that does not add to the photo. The woman''s arm is cut off and that makes for a lopsided composition. A little more time spent on composing this shot would have made it look better and not so much like a snapshot.</td>', 'Looks like a fine family outing. Unfortunately I am let down by the technicals of the photo. It looks tilted. Not sure what processing you used but I can see halos around the people and that does not add to the photo. The woman''s arm is cut off and that makes for a lopsided composition. A little more time spent on composing this shot would have made it look better and not so much like a snapshot.', '2007-10-01 15:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
