(4130210, 594040, 3727, '<td valign="top">Did not appeal to me, be interested in knowing more about what it actually it is but its very abstract and can''t decipher subject (aside from water dots on a glass). The lighting goes from dark to bright along with colors and it doesn''t work... too extreme from either spectrum</td>', 'Did not appeal to me, be interested in knowing more about what it actually it is but its very abstract and can''t decipher subject (aside from water dots on a glass). The lighting goes from dark to bright along with colors and it doesn''t work... too extreme from either spectrum', '2007-10-01 17:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130217, 585317, 3727, '<td valign="top">Rated low, it''s an ok type sunset pic (other factors removed), the over turned row boats in corner is a nice touch. The picture is very grainy which doesn''t add anything and not sure what the blue streak is but looks like a smudge on the picture rather then something of interest to look at.</td>', 'Rated low, it''s an ok type sunset pic (other factors removed), the over turned row boats in corner is a nice touch. The picture is very grainy which doesn''t add anything and not sure what the blue streak is but looks like a smudge on the picture rather then something of interest to look at.', '2007-10-01 17:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130220, 593908, 73235, '<td valign="top">very interesting pic. may be a bit too much frame. handheld, as it is not very crisp and sharp? but my compliments seeing this detail.</td>', 'very interesting pic. may be a bit too much frame. handheld, as it is not very crisp and sharp? but my compliments seeing this detail.', '2007-10-01 17:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130221, 591639, 73235, '<td valign="top">very cute. It''s diffucult to take a good looking picture of a black dog. well done</td>', 'very cute. It''s diffucult to take a good looking picture of a black dog. well done', '2007-10-01 17:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130223, 583708, 55005, '<td valign="top">I love the idea.  I think a tighter crop might have made it a bit stronger -- there is too much going on on the background.</td>', 'I love the idea.  I think a tighter crop might have made it a bit stronger -- there is too much going on on the background.', '2007-10-01 17:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130224, 593443, 73235, '<td valign="top">RGB, works in most cases, doesn''t it? good lines.</td>', 'RGB, works in most cases, doesn''t it? good lines.', '2007-10-01 17:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130226, 592383, 55005, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and colors here.  Your title made me laugh. :)</td>', 'I really like the composition and colors here.  Your title made me laugh. :)', '2007-10-01 17:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130227, 593949, 3727, '<td valign="top">Not sure if a filter was used here or if it was standard PP, rated the picture low either way. Very blotchy and nothing really appealing. Colors (red, green, yellows etc) on the ground don''t look natural or fit. Diff take on lone tree in feild type picture but doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Not sure if a filter was used here or if it was standard PP, rated the picture low either way. Very blotchy and nothing really appealing. Colors (red, green, yellows etc) on the ground don''t look natural or fit. Diff take on lone tree in feild type picture but doesn''t work for me.', '2007-10-01 17:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130228, 591882, 73235, '<td valign="top">nice motion blur of the train. a bit hot in the bright areas. I think the impact could be higher if the non moving parts would be more focused.</td>', 'nice motion blur of the train. a bit hot in the bright areas. I think the impact could be higher if the non moving parts would be more focused.', '2007-10-01 17:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130229, 582840, 55005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  I love her eyes.  Her shoulder is a bit distracting, though.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  I love her eyes.  Her shoulder is a bit distracting, though.', '2007-10-01 17:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130231, 593571, 73235, '<td valign="top">beautiful bright colors, good details in the feathers and the wood. good centered but uncentered composition, nice bokeh</td>', 'beautiful bright colors, good details in the feathers and the wood. good centered but uncentered composition, nice bokeh', '2007-10-01 17:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130232, 592869, 55005, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful.  Love the colors and all the sky details.</td>', 'Really beautiful.  Love the colors and all the sky details.', '2007-10-01 17:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130234, 593470, 73235, '<td valign="top">good capture of the sky. IMO a bit dark at the bottom. good composition</td>', 'good capture of the sky. IMO a bit dark at the bottom. good composition', '2007-10-01 17:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130240, 593024, 73235, '<td valign="top">very bright. too hot in the white areas. good composition. creative focus.</td>', 'very bright. too hot in the white areas. good composition. creative focus.', '2007-10-01 17:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130249, 592234, 73235, '<td valign="top">For my taste too bright in the whites and too dark in the shadows.</td>', 'For my taste too bright in the whites and too dark in the shadows.', '2007-10-01 17:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130256, 593311, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo, but I just wanted to make a brief comment on the composition.  I''m not sure how this could be corrected within your shooting environment either.  The only point of discomfort within this composition is the point at which the horizon and your subject come together.  This feeling is reminiscent of the water horizon cutting off the head of a person on the beach or lake shore.  This composition would be significantly stronger with the horizon line either above the top of the lighthouse or closer to the bottom of it.</td>', 'This is an excellent photo, but I just wanted to make a brief comment on the composition.  I''m not sure how this could be corrected within your shooting environment either.  The only point of discomfort within this composition is the point at which the horizon and your subject come together.  This feeling is reminiscent of the water horizon cutting off the head of a person on the beach or lake shore.  This composition would be significantly stronger with the horizon line either above the top of the lighthouse or closer to the bottom of it.', '2007-10-01 17:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130259, 590559, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and an unusual composition makes four work, especially as the back black and white kitty is the odd one out, so to speak. I like this a lot.</td>', 'Great lighting and an unusual composition makes four work, especially as the back black and white kitty is the odd one out, so to speak. I like this a lot.', '2007-10-01 17:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130261, 593102, 66597, '<td valign="top">I imagine this is spectacular as a large print. The size constraints will probably work against you here, unfortunately.</td>', 'I imagine this is spectacular as a large print. The size constraints will probably work against you here, unfortunately.', '2007-10-01 17:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130263, 592074, 73235, '<td valign="top">A couple of randowm thoughts as a reaction to your picture: the lighting is too harsh and blows out section of his face and shirt. THe light also is the reason for motion blur of the singer, while the mike is sharp and crisp. distracting background, eyes are closed</td>', 'A couple of randowm thoughts as a reaction to your picture: the lighting is too harsh and blows out section of his face and shirt. THe light also is the reason for motion blur of the singer, while the mike is sharp and crisp. distracting background, eyes are closed', '2007-10-01 17:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130265, 590480, 772, '<td valign="top">The border is more interesting than the photo in the fact that the blue and brown, neither of which exist within the image, argue attention away from the subject.</td>', 'The border is more interesting than the photo in the fact that the blue and brown, neither of which exist within the image, argue attention away from the subject.', '2007-10-01 17:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130267, 584369, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and the lighting is nice overall, though I''m not sure about the highlighted area on the left. The whites are very well done.</td>', 'Great DOF and the lighting is nice overall, though I''m not sure about the highlighted area on the left. The whites are very well done.', '2007-10-01 17:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130269, 594068, 73235, '<td valign="top">lovely presenstation. nice contrast between the "mode" and the background. good focus and details. well done</td>', 'lovely presenstation. nice contrast between the "mode" and the background. good focus and details. well done', '2007-10-01 17:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130271, 593913, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual perspective here, but the photo has a blue cast (especially in the whites of her eyes) that seems a little off.</td>', 'I like the unusual perspective here, but the photo has a blue cast (especially in the whites of her eyes) that seems a little off.', '2007-10-01 17:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130274, 583294, 73235, '<td valign="top">generally good lighting, may be just a bit more to her hair. nice portrait.</td>', 'generally good lighting, may be just a bit more to her hair. nice portrait.', '2007-10-01 17:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130281, 593934, 73235, '<td valign="top">strong complimentatry colors, good details</td>', 'strong complimentatry colors, good details', '2007-10-01 17:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130289, 592736, 73235, '<td valign="top">I know you intended this PP, it''s not really working for me. I see the lines and symetry in your picture and see how you want to highlight them through your processing. It''s not enough to make it pop out.</td>', 'I know you intended this PP, it''s not really working for me. I see the lines and symetry in your picture and see how you want to highlight them through your processing. It''s not enough to make it pop out.', '2007-10-01 17:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130293, 594060, 73235, '<td valign="top">not overly exciting in both the selection of your subject and the presentation.</td>', 'not overly exciting in both the selection of your subject and the presentation.', '2007-10-01 17:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130304, 591537, 55005, '<td valign="top">Her expression is just so typical.  :O  I love all the wrikles but I wish they were a bit more in focus.  Great image nevertheless!</td>', 'Her expression is just so typical.  :O  I love all the wrikles but I wish they were a bit more in focus.  Great image nevertheless!', '2007-10-01 17:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130310, 584862, 55005, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Love the contrasting colors.</td>', 'Great idea!  Love the contrasting colors.', '2007-10-01 17:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130311, 592492, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love the foreground with the impressionistic feeling of the boat and the beautiful lighting. Unfortunately it does not match the sharp lights of the b/g well to my eye. If those were cloned out I think this would be remarkable.</td>', 'I love the foreground with the impressionistic feeling of the boat and the beautiful lighting. Unfortunately it does not match the sharp lights of the b/g well to my eye. If those were cloned out I think this would be remarkable.', '2007-10-01 17:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130314, 593083, 772, '<td valign="top">looks like the cow kux klan :)</td>', 'looks like the cow kux klan :)', '2007-10-01 17:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130316, 593936, 55005, '<td valign="top">Nice protrait. Hot spots in her hair are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice protrait. Hot spots in her hair are a bit distracting.', '2007-10-01 17:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130317, 592355, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of heron fishing - exposure looks good and reflection is nice.</td>', 'Nice capture of heron fishing - exposure looks good and reflection is nice.', '2007-10-01 17:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130320, 593320, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great idea and nice b/w conversion, but I''m not sure the execution works for me.</td>', 'Great idea and nice b/w conversion, but I''m not sure the execution works for me.', '2007-10-01 17:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130322, 594048, 66597, '<td valign="top">A most interesting photo. I like the angle and b/w conversion.</td>', 'A most interesting photo. I like the angle and b/w conversion.', '2007-10-01 17:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130324, 593418, 55005, '<td valign="top">Love the light, the transformation from b&amp;w to color.</td>', 'Love the light, the transformation from b&w to color.', '2007-10-01 17:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130328, 593861, 66597, '<td valign="top">Simple and pretty - nice silhouette and placement relative to the moon.</td>', 'Simple and pretty - nice silhouette and placement relative to the moon.', '2007-10-01 17:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130329, 594084, 66597, '<td valign="top">A remarkable photo. I love the clouds and silhouette here. This one could hang in a gallery. 10.</td>', 'A remarkable photo. I love the clouds and silhouette here. This one could hang in a gallery. 10.', '2007-10-01 17:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130330, 593898, 55005, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture.  Great detail on the wings.</td>', 'Amazing capture.  Great detail on the wings.', '2007-10-01 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130332, 593610, 66597, '<td valign="top">Lovely lines and colors, but perhaps a touch too much saturation - or maybe this is HDR? The yellow line in particular seems a little overdone. Still a very nice entry.</td>', 'Lovely lines and colors, but perhaps a touch too much saturation - or maybe this is HDR? The yellow line in particular seems a little overdone. Still a very nice entry.', '2007-10-01 17:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130334, 591277, 52765, '<td valign="top">Horizon is not level</td>', 'Horizon is not level', '2007-10-01 17:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130335, 593600, 66597, '<td valign="top">Intriguing! I like this a lot, especially your choice of frame, which gives it a curved feeling. 8.</td>', 'Intriguing! I like this a lot, especially your choice of frame, which gives it a curved feeling. 8.', '2007-10-01 17:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130337, 591170, 66597, '<td valign="top">I always enjoy a moody, dark photo :-) Lovely.</td>', 'I always enjoy a moody, dark photo :-) Lovely.', '2007-10-01 17:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130338, 591854, 52765, '<td valign="top">Amazing</td>', 'Amazing', '2007-10-01 17:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130343, 594052, 66597, '<td valign="top">A nice capture of motion, but the photo seems a little skewed.</td>', 'A nice capture of motion, but the photo seems a little skewed.', '2007-10-01 17:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130346, 583294, 55005, '<td valign="top">Your light is superb. I just love her shiny eyes.  Wonderful tones throughout.  One of the favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Your light is superb. I just love her shiny eyes.  Wonderful tones throughout.  One of the favorites in this challenge.', '2007-10-01 17:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130347, 592706, 66597, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF here. Pity about the woman with the camera in the foreground. Still, you did a great job of drawing the eye to the subject.</td>', 'Love the DOF here. Pity about the woman with the camera in the foreground. Still, you did a great job of drawing the eye to the subject.', '2007-10-01 17:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130351, 593110, 55005, '<td valign="top">Such a tranquil place! Love all the details here.  Beautiful tones.</td>', 'Such a tranquil place! Love all the details here.  Beautiful tones.', '2007-10-01 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4130383, 590400, 84818, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. Great sunset captured.</td>', 'Love the colors. Great sunset captured.', '2007-10-01 17:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130389, 585669, 73235, '<td valign="top">nice bokeh and colors. seems to be out of focus or DOF is too shallow</td>', 'nice bokeh and colors. seems to be out of focus or DOF is too shallow', '2007-10-01 18:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130390, 593579, 84818, '<td valign="top">Very unique shot. Love the colors.</td>', 'Very unique shot. Love the colors.', '2007-10-01 18:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130395, 593468, 84818, '<td valign="top">Awesome..hard bird to capture this well and my favorite bird.</td>', 'Awesome..hard bird to capture this well and my favorite bird.', '2007-10-01 18:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130397, 590945, 84818, '<td valign="top">Love the idea and the colors.</td>', 'Love the idea and the colors.', '2007-10-01 18:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130404, 593320, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the bottom half of this photo more than the top half. The top doesn''t seem to be in focus but I really like the textures on the bottom.</td>', 'I like the bottom half of this photo more than the top half. The top doesn''t seem to be in focus but I really like the textures on the bottom.', '2007-10-01 18:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130407, 593796, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the bright leaf against the dark grate, I like that they are both at an angle.</td>', 'Love the bright leaf against the dark grate, I like that they are both at an angle.', '2007-10-01 18:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130408, 589327, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh dear. This looks like a great setting and a great opportunity but it also looks very out of focus and exposed incorrectly.</td>', 'Oh dear. This looks like a great setting and a great opportunity but it also looks very out of focus and exposed incorrectly.', '2007-10-01 18:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130412, 593734, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful photo. The colours are just amazing, the caribou/reindeer has a great pose.</td>', 'What a beautiful photo. The colours are just amazing, the caribou/reindeer has a great pose.', '2007-10-01 18:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130415, 589205, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a great shot, love the wide angle and perspective.</td>', 'What a great shot, love the wide angle and perspective.', '2007-10-01 18:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130416, 592093, 43774, '<td valign="top">Aw, a fun shot! It''s a bit bright for my tastes but nice nonetheless.</td>', 'Aw, a fun shot! It''s a bit bright for my tastes but nice nonetheless.', '2007-10-01 18:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130423, 593979, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cool DOF. I do wish you had cropped the house out, though. It looks tilted and really distracts from the rest of the photo. Just that one lone sunflower in focus in a field of sunflowers would be more dramatic without anything else distracting from it. I''d also crop out the partial out of focus sunflower in front.</td>', 'Very cool DOF. I do wish you had cropped the house out, though. It looks tilted and really distracts from the rest of the photo. Just that one lone sunflower in focus in a field of sunflowers would be more dramatic without anything else distracting from it. I''d also crop out the partial out of focus sunflower in front.', '2007-10-01 18:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130425, 592187, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice light in this, I like that you can see water drops form the wheel</td>', 'Nice light in this, I like that you can see water drops form the wheel', '2007-10-01 18:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130426, 593283, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cool pose, wonderful photo</td>', 'Very cool pose, wonderful photo', '2007-10-01 18:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130428, 593242, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I like the pose of the eagle. I wish it wasn''t so centered though.</td>', 'Cool shot, I like the pose of the eagle. I wish it wasn''t so centered though.', '2007-10-01 18:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130430, 593549, 43774, '<td valign="top">Those are amazing clouds! I wish they were a bit more in focus, the entire photo seems fuzzy.</td>', 'Those are amazing clouds! I wish they were a bit more in focus, the entire photo seems fuzzy.', '2007-10-01 18:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130436, 592706, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic ceiling! Love the colour of it. I would have cropped out the person in front and tried to make it more symmetrical.</td>', 'What a fantastic ceiling! Love the colour of it. I would have cropped out the person in front and tried to make it more symmetrical.', '2007-10-01 18:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130437, 593282, 71951, '<td valign="top">The lighting is pretty good, but the lower left corner is grey. If this isn''t on purpose you could have cloned out the vignetting.</td>', 'The lighting is pretty good, but the lower left corner is grey. If this isn''t on purpose you could have cloned out the vignetting.', '2007-10-01 18:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130438, 580764, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clear, very sharp, great DOF, wonderful macro</td>', 'Very clear, very sharp, great DOF, wonderful macro', '2007-10-01 18:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130439, 593604, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely sense of freedom here, very nice tones.</td>', 'Lovely sense of freedom here, very nice tones.', '2007-10-01 18:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130441, 586664, 71951, '<td valign="top">Great animal photo with nice editing, too bad they only had one complete antler.</td>', 'Great animal photo with nice editing, too bad they only had one complete antler.', '2007-10-01 18:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130442, 590559, 43774, '<td valign="top">How cute!!!!! Oh my gosh, I can just see this on a poster with some sort of witty saying. Too adorable!</td>', 'How cute!!!!! Oh my gosh, I can just see this on a poster with some sort of witty saying. Too adorable!', '2007-10-01 18:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130443, 581610, 71951, '<td valign="top">Cool editing and composition, a very creative photo.</td>', 'Cool editing and composition, a very creative photo.', '2007-10-01 18:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130445, 591701, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, lots of character. Unfortunately I find the face too dark and the background too light.</td>', 'Interesting photo, lots of character. Unfortunately I find the face too dark and the background too light.', '2007-10-01 18:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130451, 593688, 43774, '<td valign="top">LOL this is so cute!!! Looks like it was shot through a window, I can see a bit of reflection, not too bad though. It''s very clear and I really like the B&amp;W.</td>', 'LOL this is so cute!!! Looks like it was shot through a window, I can see a bit of reflection, not too bad though. It''s very clear and I really like the B&W.', '2007-10-01 18:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130452, 589702, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice seagull photo, I think on these simpler images using the rule of 3rds will result in a higher score (from personal experience).</td>', 'Nice seagull photo, I think on these simpler images using the rule of 3rds will result in a higher score (from personal experience).', '2007-10-01 18:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130456, 593908, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love all the green here, the textures and composition. Makes me wonder who lived there, but it also seems creepy. Good job.</td>', 'Love all the green here, the textures and composition. Makes me wonder who lived there, but it also seems creepy. Good job.', '2007-10-01 18:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130457, 590290, 71951, '<td valign="top">I like the editing and conversion on this. Nice composition, with leading lines to the boxer.</td>', 'I like the editing and conversion on this. Nice composition, with leading lines to the boxer.', '2007-10-01 18:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130459, 593251, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, wish the hills in the background were more in focus.</td>', 'Nice scene, wish the hills in the background were more in focus.', '2007-10-01 18:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130461, 593569, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, I like that there is a lot to look at, from the shed to the trees to the old fence.</td>', 'Very nice composition, I like that there is a lot to look at, from the shed to the trees to the old fence.', '2007-10-01 18:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130462, 591078, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clear, good photo</td>', 'Very clear, good photo', '2007-10-01 18:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130464, 591716, 43774, '<td valign="top">Neat photo, I would have cloned out that wire in the background, it''s going right through her head.</td>', 'Neat photo, I would have cloned out that wire in the background, it''s going right through her head.', '2007-10-01 18:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130466, 593633, 71951, '<td valign="top">I find these wind blown dunes interesting to look at. I think a more dramatic perspective (i.e. closer to the sand) would work better.</td>', 'I find these wind blown dunes interesting to look at. I think a more dramatic perspective (i.e. closer to the sand) would work better.', '2007-10-01 18:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130468, 589702, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very good composition, could be a bit brighter with a bit more contrast. Good job though.</td>', 'Very good composition, could be a bit brighter with a bit more contrast. Good job though.', '2007-10-01 18:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130471, 592383, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture, love the pose. Seems a bit contrasty and harsh, could be because of the light.</td>', 'Very cool capture, love the pose. Seems a bit contrasty and harsh, could be because of the light.', '2007-10-01 18:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4130473, 592813, 43774, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous fall day! I just love shots with blue skies and those trees are so colourful. Love it!</td>', 'A gorgeous fall day! I just love shots with blue skies and those trees are so colourful. Love it!', '2007-10-01 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
