(4131253, 593725, 3727, '<td valign="top">Voted on low side, the selective coloring draws my attention to the phone booth, but once there does nothing. The backdrop looks dreary and uninteresting (contrary to what its like when viewing it irl). Find it cropped too tightly and maybe coloring would have worked on a wider crop or in a street candid.</td>', 'Voted on low side, the selective coloring draws my attention to the phone booth, but once there does nothing. The backdrop looks dreary and uninteresting (contrary to what its like when viewing it irl). Find it cropped too tightly and maybe coloring would have worked on a wider crop or in a street candid.', '2007-10-01 22:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131254, 593921, 66597, '<td valign="top">What an interesting idea - I like it a lot. I wish the center of the flower were just a touch sharper with more black so the flower "popped" a bit more, but most creative!</td>', 'What an interesting idea - I like it a lot. I wish the center of the flower were just a touch sharper with more black so the flower "popped" a bit more, but most creative!', '2007-10-01 22:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131256, 593807, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the deep orange and the look of the reflections that can'' quite be distinguished from the objects.</td>', 'I like the deep orange and the look of the reflections that can'' quite be distinguished from the objects.', '2007-10-01 22:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131257, 593255, 61012, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and DOF. A very nice portrait!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and DOF. A very nice portrait!', '2007-10-01 22:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131258, 589123, 66597, '<td valign="top">Cute interaction between the mom and child, but the tones look very gray here, which gives it a ''snapshot'' feeling.</td>', 'Cute interaction between the mom and child, but the tones look very gray here, which gives it a ''snapshot'' feeling.', '2007-10-01 22:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131261, 592736, 61012, '<td valign="top">Interesting but a bit too much posterized for me.</td>', 'Interesting but a bit too much posterized for me.', '2007-10-01 22:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131262, 591370, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good composition and a clear night shot.</td>', 'Good composition and a clear night shot.', '2007-10-01 22:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131263, 586664, 66597, '<td valign="top">He looks so docile, and yet that missing horn speaks otherwise :-) A beautiful capture with great processing choices.</td>', 'He looks so docile, and yet that missing horn speaks otherwise :-) A beautiful capture with great processing choices.', '2007-10-01 22:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131266, 591909, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very creative - makes me want to know more about the purpose of the net over his head. The eye is penetrating.</td>', 'Very creative - makes me want to know more about the purpose of the net over his head. The eye is penetrating.', '2007-10-01 22:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131269, 585317, 66597, '<td valign="top">This has much potential but unfortunately is not in focus and is grainy. Nice lines, though.</td>', 'This has much potential but unfortunately is not in focus and is grainy. Nice lines, though.', '2007-10-01 22:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131270, 584617, 53316, '<td valign="top">Thinking maybe a tigher crop would have helped, because this is SO beautiful I just want to see it and not the negative space.  Really amazing image.</td>', 'Thinking maybe a tigher crop would have helped, because this is SO beautiful I just want to see it and not the negative space.  Really amazing image.', '2007-10-01 22:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131271, 590403, 66597, '<td valign="top">Looks like this was taken out of a plane window? Unfortunately has a lot of grain, though the patterns are nice.</td>', 'Looks like this was taken out of a plane window? Unfortunately has a lot of grain, though the patterns are nice.', '2007-10-01 22:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131273, 581010, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the grain (gives it a neat feel) but the yellow cast is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the grain (gives it a neat feel) but the yellow cast is a bit distracting.', '2007-10-01 22:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131274, 593975, 66597, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors, and the drop in the upper right is nice.</td>', 'Pretty colors, and the drop in the upper right is nice.', '2007-10-01 22:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131275, 593924, 53316, '<td valign="top">Love how you captured the spray of water so interestingly!</td>', 'Love how you captured the spray of water so interestingly!', '2007-10-01 22:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131277, 591743, 61012, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.</td>', 'Very dramatic.', '2007-10-01 22:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131278, 589514, 53316, '<td valign="top">More contrast in the face may have helped. Interesting facial expression - very dramatic.</td>', 'More contrast in the face may have helped. Interesting facial expression - very dramatic.', '2007-10-01 22:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131279, 593671, 53316, '<td valign="top">Composition is very interesting!</td>', 'Composition is very interesting!', '2007-10-01 22:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131280, 593669, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the slight fisheye perspective toward the bottom, but otherwise, I love it.  I had to go look up the location. Must be a lot of good photo opportunities there.</td>', 'Not sure I like the slight fisheye perspective toward the bottom, but otherwise, I love it.  I had to go look up the location. Must be a lot of good photo opportunities there.', '2007-10-01 22:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131282, 593321, 53316, '<td valign="top">Color correction would help this a ton, otherwise I like it!!</td>', 'Color correction would help this a ton, otherwise I like it!!', '2007-10-01 22:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131284, 588551, 53316, '<td valign="top">Love the colors!! Pale yellow and bright blue work together nicely here.</td>', 'Love the colors!! Pale yellow and bright blue work together nicely here.', '2007-10-01 22:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131285, 592421, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just a great portrait.</td>', 'Just a great portrait.', '2007-10-01 22:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131287, 589325, 53316, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept - a neat take on the oft-used flower.</td>', 'Interesting concept - a neat take on the oft-used flower.', '2007-10-01 22:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131290, 592383, 53316, '<td valign="top">Grass looks noisy, but that can be difficult. I love how he''s looking right at the camera.</td>', 'Grass looks noisy, but that can be difficult. I love how he''s looking right at the camera.', '2007-10-01 22:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131293, 592706, 3727, '<td valign="top">voted on low side, <br/> <br/>First thing that comes to mind is detail... I can''t see any detail in the roof which i''m sure is stunning to see in person. A greater dof woudl have helped maybe but in the current shot it looks u are trying to capture too much in one picture. When you are looking up at the ceiling at something like this... your eyes (at least in my experience) flow down the arch looking at small chunks at a time. <br/> <br/>The 2nd part is cropping. A tighter cropping at the bottom to hide the half heads that are visible and possible waiting until the person taking the photo in front was done :)</td>', 'voted on low side,  First thing that comes to mind is detail... I can''t see any detail in the roof which i''m sure is stunning to see in person. A greater dof woudl have helped maybe but in the current shot it looks u are trying to capture too much in one picture. When you are looking up at the ceiling at something like this... your eyes (at least in my experience) flow down the arch looking at small chunks at a time.  The 2nd part is cropping. A tighter cropping at the bottom to hide the half heads that are visible and possible waiting until the person taking the photo in front was done :)', '2007-10-01 22:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131294, 592149, 53316, '<td valign="top">A bit oversaturated.  The noisy colorey bits are distracting.  But, this photo makes quite an impact and is really neat :-)</td>', 'A bit oversaturated.  The noisy colorey bits are distracting.  But, this photo makes quite an impact and is really neat :-)', '2007-10-01 22:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131297, 583581, 56061, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2007-10-01 22:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131298, 594089, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the b/w and sepia sky. It works well for this subject.</td>', 'I like the use of the b/w and sepia sky. It works well for this subject.', '2007-10-01 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131299, 593774, 61012, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this shot very much. The highlights in the sky are a bit blown though</td>', 'I like the perspective of this shot very much. The highlights in the sky are a bit blown though', '2007-10-01 22:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131300, 593455, 53316, '<td valign="top">Chaotic yet concrete. I like it! Definitely makes me look twice to figure out what''s going on.</td>', 'Chaotic yet concrete. I like it! Definitely makes me look twice to figure out what''s going on.', '2007-10-01 22:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131310, 591228, 53316, '<td valign="top">WOW! Amazing.  Geez, I really started to hate northern light shots, because they were so overdone. THIS, however, is different.  It''s not just the lights and some landscape. It is the lights, and something humble we can identify with.  The contrast between small churchhouse and large magestic sky is AMAZING and really makes this stand out from all the other northern light shots.  I also love how there is not only green color, as many shots have, but there is blue and orange as well.  The way the sky peeks through the clouds is just fantastic, as well as the perspective... And of course I can''t help noticing the symbolism with the crosses... I don''t know if this is the meaning you intended, but what I get out of it is that God creates really beautiful things.</td>', 'WOW! Amazing.  Geez, I really started to hate northern light shots, because they were so overdone. THIS, however, is different.  It''s not just the lights and some landscape. It is the lights, and something humble we can identify with.  The contrast between small churchhouse and large magestic sky is AMAZING and really makes this stand out from all the other northern light shots.  I also love how there is not only green color, as many shots have, but there is blue and orange as well.  The way the sky peeks through the clouds is just fantastic, as well as the perspective... And of course I can''t help noticing the symbolism with the crosses... I don''t know if this is the meaning you intended, but what I get out of it is that God creates really beautiful things.', '2007-10-01 22:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131312, 592976, 71188, '<td valign="top">Tad too dark.</td>', 'Tad too dark.', '2007-10-01 22:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131314, 589681, 3727, '<td valign="top">Voted on the low side, <br/> <br/>Through no fault of your own, the size limitation doesn''t do this picture justice... normally i can look past that if the scene is interesting enough and i can pick out enough detail. <br/> <br/>In this case i can''t and the detail would only come visible in a larger size. <br/> <br/>2nd part is the soccer field. You have beautiful shade of purple on the horizon , soft lights and then this bright white patch on the right. Its like looking at stars and then having a car turn on its headlights in front of your... eyes flow toward the light.</td>', 'Voted on the low side,  Through no fault of your own, the size limitation doesn''t do this picture justice... normally i can look past that if the scene is interesting enough and i can pick out enough detail.  In this case i can''t and the detail would only come visible in a larger size.  2nd part is the soccer field. You have beautiful shade of purple on the horizon , soft lights and then this bright white patch on the right. Its like looking at stars and then having a car turn on its headlights in front of your... eyes flow toward the light.', '2007-10-01 22:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131315, 593754, 53316, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop to eliminate the people on left may have helped, although I like how they are not in focus, so they are less distracting.  That gaze the subject is giving is really awesome.</td>', 'A tighter crop to eliminate the people on left may have helped, although I like how they are not in focus, so they are less distracting.  That gaze the subject is giving is really awesome.', '2007-10-01 22:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131316, 587211, 53316, '<td valign="top">WOW! Really sums up the fire and passion that music can bring.</td>', 'WOW! Really sums up the fire and passion that music can bring.', '2007-10-01 22:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131319, 592949, 53316, '<td valign="top">Aw, what a cutie! Normally we don''t get to see their undersides! A tighter crop would have helped us see more detail.</td>', 'Aw, what a cutie! Normally we don''t get to see their undersides! A tighter crop would have helped us see more detail.', '2007-10-01 22:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131321, 591886, 56061, '<td valign="top">Great catch...</td>', 'Great catch...', '2007-10-01 22:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131323, 593825, 53316, '<td valign="top">Pose looks forced to me.  Lighting is nice. I like the inclusion of the watch, as if she is a "normal" person and not a model... this counteracts some of the "forced-ness" of the pose, I think.</td>', 'Pose looks forced to me.  Lighting is nice. I like the inclusion of the watch, as if she is a "normal" person and not a model... this counteracts some of the "forced-ness" of the pose, I think.', '2007-10-01 22:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131328, 593734, 53316, '<td valign="top">Colors make this look like a fairy-tale world.  Awesome.</td>', 'Colors make this look like a fairy-tale world.  Awesome.', '2007-10-01 22:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131330, 593103, 53316, '<td valign="top">Tighter crop on left would be good for me as the background is too... well, it''s too darn interesting! The wonderful textures are competing with the subject :-)</td>', 'Tighter crop on left would be good for me as the background is too... well, it''s too darn interesting! The wonderful textures are competing with the subject :-)', '2007-10-01 22:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131333, 592093, 53316, '<td valign="top">I wonder what she''s thinking... <br/>This picture makes me happy. :-)</td>', 'I wonder what she''s thinking... This picture makes me happy. :-)', '2007-10-01 22:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131336, 593487, 53316, '<td valign="top">Cropping the bottom to eliminiate that first part of shadow would have helped bring my eye more towards the stairs area.</td>', 'Cropping the bottom to eliminiate that first part of shadow would have helped bring my eye more towards the stairs area.', '2007-10-01 22:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131337, 593807, 53316, '<td valign="top">Nice.. very simple yet beautiful.</td>', 'Nice.. very simple yet beautiful.', '2007-10-01 22:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131338, 592641, 53316, '<td valign="top">Something seems off about the colors - I think that his hair and eye seem a bit too yellow.  I like his expression!</td>', 'Something seems off about the colors - I think that his hair and eye seem a bit too yellow.  I like his expression!', '2007-10-01 22:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131339, 591726, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing.  Makes me stop to look for sure.  Dark colors contrasted with the light skin is awesome.</td>', 'Very intriguing.  Makes me stop to look for sure.  Dark colors contrasted with the light skin is awesome.', '2007-10-01 22:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131340, 587487, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love that the drop is pretty much perfectly round.  Looks very neat.</td>', 'I love that the drop is pretty much perfectly round.  Looks very neat.', '2007-10-01 22:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131341, 590603, 53316, '<td valign="top">Looks a little too busy, maybe? But it is a very interesting scene.  I love the contrast.</td>', 'Looks a little too busy, maybe? But it is a very interesting scene.  I love the contrast.', '2007-10-01 22:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131342, 593827, 74979, '<td valign="top">beautiful animal, coat is so glossy.<br/> <br/>nicely captured</td>', 'beautiful animal, coat is so glossy. nicely captured', '2007-10-01 22:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131344, 593643, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awww, yay! Quack! They look like they''re part of some sort of conference.. very serious matters beign discussed.  The one in the center has just made a strong point and they are looking at the ducks outside the frame, waiting for a response.</td>', 'Awww, yay! Quack! They look like they''re part of some sort of conference.. very serious matters beign discussed.  The one in the center has just made a strong point and they are looking at the ducks outside the frame, waiting for a response.', '2007-10-01 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131345, 591078, 56061, '<td valign="top">Sharp</td>', 'Sharp', '2007-10-01 22:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131346, 589209, 53316, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Makes me have great hope for the future.</td>', 'Lovely.  Makes me have great hope for the future.', '2007-10-01 22:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131347, 593221, 74979, '<td valign="top">sweet, love the DOF</td>', 'sweet, love the DOF', '2007-10-01 22:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131348, 592846, 53316, '<td valign="top">A bit too saturated for my tastes, but definitely makes an impact! I like the tilt; it makes the figure on the right seem to be walking uphill and emphasizes some sort of struggle... or maybe I''m reading too much into it :-)</td>', 'A bit too saturated for my tastes, but definitely makes an impact! I like the tilt; it makes the figure on the right seem to be walking uphill and emphasizes some sort of struggle... or maybe I''m reading too much into it :-)', '2007-10-01 22:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131351, 592879, 74979, '<td valign="top">excellent!</td>', 'excellent!', '2007-10-01 22:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131353, 592752, 3727, '<td valign="top">Voted low, The dof needs to be greater. Only a tiny part of the feather is clear and the rest is blurred almost to the point of unrecognizable. I find water drops need to be crystal clear. <br/> <br/>2nd part if the bright orange. Very sharp contrast to the softness of the feather.. don''t know if that is what you were going for.</td>', 'Voted low, The dof needs to be greater. Only a tiny part of the feather is clear and the rest is blurred almost to the point of unrecognizable. I find water drops need to be crystal clear.  2nd part if the bright orange. Very sharp contrast to the softness of the feather.. don''t know if that is what you were going for.', '2007-10-01 22:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131354, 589570, 53316, '<td valign="top">NICE! I love this... the well-framed "path" is simple, yet leads to a mountain, and the contrast is awesome.  The curve also emphasizes this as it reminds me of how the world curves.</td>', 'NICE! I love this... the well-framed "path" is simple, yet leads to a mountain, and the contrast is awesome.  The curve also emphasizes this as it reminds me of how the world curves.', '2007-10-01 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131356, 581610, 53316, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  Looks like a shoe advertisement!</td>', 'Stunning.  Looks like a shoe advertisement!', '2007-10-01 23:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131359, 588605, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh... my... goodness.  This... wow.  This takes my breath away.  I''ve never seen this idea before, and it''s just stunning!!! Composed so well... and I love the noise/artifacts as it makes it look like a painting.</td>', 'Oh... my... goodness.  This... wow.  This takes my breath away.  I''ve never seen this idea before, and it''s just stunning!!! Composed so well... and I love the noise/artifacts as it makes it look like a painting.', '2007-10-01 23:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131362, 591641, 53316, '<td valign="top">Maybe would have prefered the main figure to be a bit darker to contrast more with the background.  She looks like she''s walking out of a dream world, and has seen something very sobering that she wants to tell you with her gaze.  Very neat.</td>', 'Maybe would have prefered the main figure to be a bit darker to contrast more with the background.  She looks like she''s walking out of a dream world, and has seen something very sobering that she wants to tell you with her gaze.  Very neat.', '2007-10-01 23:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131371, 593321, 61012, '<td valign="top">Too chaotic for me. Lighting lacks drama and is a bit blown-out in the central image.</td>', 'Too chaotic for me. Lighting lacks drama and is a bit blown-out in the central image.', '2007-10-01 23:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131373, 586480, 61012, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast and clarity. Perhaps a bit over-sharpened</td>', 'Very nice contrast and clarity. Perhaps a bit over-sharpened', '2007-10-01 23:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131375, 593725, 61012, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective desat but I''m not so sure about the crop</td>', 'Nice use of selective desat but I''m not so sure about the crop', '2007-10-01 23:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131378, 593835, 61012, '<td valign="top">Very nice, soft, backlighting.</td>', 'Very nice, soft, backlighting.', '2007-10-01 23:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131402, 581737, 3727, '<td valign="top">Voted on low side, <br/> <br/>The white contrast adds a little but the subject is not unique enough to make him appealing. He is centered on the bench and would have prefered to have him on either end. The crop cuts off just a peice of the bench, would like to see either more of the bench cut off or have it entirely visible. Can barely make out the drink and seems placed unnaturally.</td>', 'Voted on low side,  The white contrast adds a little but the subject is not unique enough to make him appealing. He is centered on the bench and would have prefered to have him on either end. The crop cuts off just a peice of the bench, would like to see either more of the bench cut off or have it entirely visible. Can barely make out the drink and seems placed unnaturally.', '2007-10-01 23:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131413, 589797, 3727, '<td valign="top">Voted low, no interesting detail on the moth that is appealing.... its monochrome color pretty much and doesn''t flow with brightness of the flowers and pastel background.</td>', 'Voted low, no interesting detail on the moth that is appealing.... its monochrome color pretty much and doesn''t flow with brightness of the flowers and pastel background.', '2007-10-01 23:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131424, 592846, 3727, '<td valign="top">Voted low, the sky is interesting and is nice shade. The slanting though adds nothing to the perspective and the picture seems a bit random with no subject to that stands out</td>', 'Voted low, the sky is interesting and is nice shade. The slanting though adds nothing to the perspective and the picture seems a bit random with no subject to that stands out', '2007-10-01 23:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131440, 588551, 3727, '<td valign="top">voted low, not enough flower detail and nothing really stands out. The shade of yellow/green in the bottom right of the picture does not flow nicely with the bright blue.</td>', 'voted low, not enough flower detail and nothing really stands out. The shade of yellow/green in the bottom right of the picture does not flow nicely with the bright blue.', '2007-10-01 23:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131441, 581734, 3727, '<td valign="top">Voted low, lighting is off, a bunch of manicans but what aside from that what shoudl i be looking at, the statue of liberty?</td>', 'Voted low, lighting is off, a bunch of manicans but what aside from that what shoudl i be looking at, the statue of liberty?', '2007-10-01 23:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131447, 589763, 58728, '<td valign="top">Awesome color! Too bad that he was on such a busy background...I kind of wish he stood out more, since he''s so interesting looking!</td>', 'Awesome color! Too bad that he was on such a busy background...I kind of wish he stood out more, since he''s so interesting looking!', '2007-10-01 23:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131450, 593492, 58728, '<td valign="top">Great colors and composition.  I love the softness of the flower and the background.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great colors and composition.  I love the softness of the flower and the background.  Nicely done.', '2007-10-01 23:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131454, 593232, 58728, '<td valign="top">Cute expression! Looks like he''s going to get the plant and the water in the same bite! The background is unfortunately a little busy...which I feel takes the focus away from the pup.  Maybe a bit of a closer crop would have helped?</td>', 'Cute expression! Looks like he''s going to get the plant and the water in the same bite! The background is unfortunately a little busy...which I feel takes the focus away from the pup.  Maybe a bit of a closer crop would have helped?', '2007-10-01 23:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131456, 593924, 58728, '<td valign="top">Great motion!  I Love the repeating pattern here...the bodies, the red lines, the splashing.  Only nitpick is the first swimmer''s head being cut off.  Nice job though.</td>', 'Great motion!  I Love the repeating pattern here...the bodies, the red lines, the splashing.  Only nitpick is the first swimmer''s head being cut off.  Nice job though.', '2007-10-01 23:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131464, 592872, 60495, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, it may helped to crop a little tighter and crop the person on the right out. I kind of like the grainy texture.</td>', 'Interesting subject, it may helped to crop a little tighter and crop the person on the right out. I kind of like the grainy texture.', '2007-10-01 23:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4131475, 593600, 3727, '<td valign="top">Voted low, not sure what is trying to be conveyed... i would be cautious with this type of border on future challenges as it seems to add a shape to the picture that wasn''t there.</td>', 'Voted low, not sure what is trying to be conveyed... i would be cautious with this type of border on future challenges as it seems to add a shape to the picture that wasn''t there.', '2007-10-01 23:38:26.000000', NULL, 1);
