(4132099, 593981, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice sense of freedom - I like the softness and the motion in the wings.</td>', 'Very nice sense of freedom - I like the softness and the motion in the wings.', '2007-10-02 04:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132100, 593670, 54632, '<td valign="top">Nice Bokeh</td>', 'Nice Bokeh', '2007-10-02 04:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132101, 588605, 69368, '<td valign="top">very interesting point of view.</td>', 'very interesting point of view.', '2007-10-02 04:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132120, 592965, 49109, '<td valign="top">not much happening here... technically ok, crop is quite tight, with landscape orientation you could have included the whole bay. overall not very interesting</td>', 'not much happening here... technically ok, crop is quite tight, with landscape orientation you could have included the whole bay. overall not very interesting', '2007-10-02 04:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132121, 588995, 49109, '<td valign="top">pose and looks are very appealing, but the light is very harsh and too bright</td>', 'pose and looks are very appealing, but the light is very harsh and too bright', '2007-10-02 04:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132123, 593569, 49109, '<td valign="top">lacks a bit of contrast because the light was too flat.</td>', 'lacks a bit of contrast because the light was too flat.', '2007-10-02 04:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132124, 594089, 49109, '<td valign="top">interesting scenery. nice color conversion. composition is too centered, might have been better if you had shot from a lower viewpoint to include more of the road. had used a white border to make the image "pop" some more</td>', 'interesting scenery. nice color conversion. composition is too centered, might have been better if you had shot from a lower viewpoint to include more of the road. had used a white border to make the image "pop" some more', '2007-10-02 04:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132125, 593890, 49109, '<td valign="top">lacks of an interesting subject. overall too soft</td>', 'lacks of an interesting subject. overall too soft', '2007-10-02 04:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132128, 592355, 49109, '<td valign="top">good capture, but had cropped off some at the bottom, where the surface is out of focus. that would also help for a more balanced composition. lights are unfortunately blown.</td>', 'good capture, but had cropped off some at the bottom, where the surface is out of focus. that would also help for a more balanced composition. lights are unfortunately blown.', '2007-10-02 04:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132129, 593731, 79955, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but image a little noisy</td>', 'Nice composition, but image a little noisy', '2007-10-02 04:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132131, 593589, 49109, '<td valign="top">contrast is too high and the kid is just too small and too far at right side to make for an interesting subject</td>', 'contrast is too high and the kid is just too small and too far at right side to make for an interesting subject', '2007-10-02 04:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132133, 593478, 49109, '<td valign="top">very interesting capture, though it would IMO have been better to include the whole window in the shot. I like the contrast between the heavily textured wall and the soft, bright curtain. nice complimentary contrast, too.</td>', 'very interesting capture, though it would IMO have been better to include the whole window in the shot. I like the contrast between the heavily textured wall and the soft, bright curtain. nice complimentary contrast, too.', '2007-10-02 04:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132134, 594055, 49109, '<td valign="top">well composed, moody portrait. toning works well. good detail in her face, interesting DOF. light was a bit harsh and blew the lights. might be worth a try to crop right of the left rower for more balance and better focus on the girl.</td>', 'well composed, moody portrait. toning works well. good detail in her face, interesting DOF. light was a bit harsh and blew the lights. might be worth a try to crop right of the left rower for more balance and better focus on the girl.', '2007-10-02 04:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132135, 589702, 49109, '<td valign="top">well composed shot, overall a bit dull</td>', 'well composed shot, overall a bit dull', '2007-10-02 04:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132136, 593885, 49109, '<td valign="top">the road in forground takes away from the very detailed cityscape</td>', 'the road in forground takes away from the very detailed cityscape', '2007-10-02 04:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132138, 592577, 49109, '<td valign="top">interesting outfit, but overall look is of a snapshot. at least you could have cropped off the person in the background and avoided the white line at left.</td>', 'interesting outfit, but overall look is of a snapshot. at least you could have cropped off the person in the background and avoided the white line at left.', '2007-10-02 04:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132139, 594049, 49109, '<td valign="top">crop is much too tight. would have been a much more interesting shot if at least the whole garage sign and the headlight were included.</td>', 'crop is much too tight. would have been a much more interesting shot if at least the whole garage sign and the headlight were included.', '2007-10-02 04:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132140, 593966, 49109, '<td valign="top">light is a bit flat, a push in contrast might have produced a more mysterious atmosphere.</td>', 'light is a bit flat, a push in contrast might have produced a more mysterious atmosphere.', '2007-10-02 04:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132144, 593907, 49109, '<td valign="top">looks a bit like the Gehry-Buildings at the Düsseldorf Media Harbour (if you don''t know them, have a look at my portfolio), but those don''t have the curved lines. I would be interested in the location.<br/> <br/>well composed shot of high graphic quality, good color and contrast. black frame is irregular (bolder at right and bottom). the powerline in foreground distracts a bit.</td>', 'looks a bit like the Gehry-Buildings at the Düsseldorf Media Harbour (if you don''t know them, have a look at my portfolio), but those don''t have the curved lines. I would be interested in the location. well composed shot of high graphic quality, good color and contrast. black frame is irregular (bolder at right and bottom). the powerline in foreground distracts a bit.', '2007-10-02 04:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132150, 592571, 674, '<td valign="top">IMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes<br/> <br/>Composition: good ilike the way the lines lead the eye into the picture<br/>Background :<br/>Subject Placement:good<br/>Cropping:good<br/>Focus: good<br/>Exposure:a bit dark<br/>Editing:good<br/> <br/>Total Averaged Rating :7</td>', 'IMO, Does it meet the Challenge : yes Composition: good ilike the way the lines lead the eye into the pictureBackground :Subject Placement:goodCropping:goodFocus: goodExposure:a bit darkEditing:good Total Averaged Rating :7', '2007-10-02 05:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132157, 584369, 49109, '<td valign="top">chrome parts look greenish, probably from incorrect white balance. brighter areas at left side distract - could have been cropped off; had helped for a more interesting composition, too.</td>', 'chrome parts look greenish, probably from incorrect white balance. brighter areas at left side distract - could have been cropped off; had helped for a more interesting composition, too.', '2007-10-02 05:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132158, 591743, 49109, '<td valign="top">beautiful sky, but poor image quality: grainy, halos around the lighthouse, tree looks too soft</td>', 'beautiful sky, but poor image quality: grainy, halos around the lighthouse, tree looks too soft', '2007-10-02 05:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132160, 593934, 49109, '<td valign="top">blues are oversaturated and crop is too tight IMO</td>', 'blues are oversaturated and crop is too tight IMO', '2007-10-02 05:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132161, 590185, 49109, '<td valign="top">good exposure and composition. the guy is slightly blurred, color balance could be somehow warmer to create a more comfortable feel</td>', 'good exposure and composition. the guy is slightly blurred, color balance could be somehow warmer to create a more comfortable feel', '2007-10-02 05:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132163, 591869, 49109, '<td valign="top">very good crop, but lacking of sharpness. white balance seems to be wrong.</td>', 'very good crop, but lacking of sharpness. white balance seems to be wrong.', '2007-10-02 05:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132165, 591620, 49109, '<td valign="top">a bit odd, but probably that''s how kids are. very well exposed and cropped. the border takes away from the "documentary" look.</td>', 'a bit odd, but probably that''s how kids are. very well exposed and cropped. the border takes away from the "documentary" look.', '2007-10-02 05:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132166, 590221, 49109, '<td valign="top">perfect exposure and color. crop at left is a bit too close to the building.</td>', 'perfect exposure and color. crop at left is a bit too close to the building.', '2007-10-02 05:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132167, 593820, 49109, '<td valign="top">very good study in shapes and colors, well composed. could be much sharper though</td>', 'very good study in shapes and colors, well composed. could be much sharper though', '2007-10-02 06:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132168, 593909, 49109, '<td valign="top">very nice picture, but extremely noisy. can imagine this would look much better in b/w</td>', 'very nice picture, but extremely noisy. can imagine this would look much better in b/w', '2007-10-02 06:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132169, 593159, 49109, '<td valign="top">simple yet effective. would try to boos t contrats a bit to bring out the trees in the background</td>', 'simple yet effective. would try to boos t contrats a bit to bring out the trees in the background', '2007-10-02 06:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132170, 593351, 49109, '<td valign="top">good graphic work. a tad too dark at top</td>', 'good graphic work. a tad too dark at top', '2007-10-02 06:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132171, 588682, 49109, '<td valign="top">very nice macro, good sharpness. looks a bit unbalanced, would rotate it by 90 degrees clockwise</td>', 'very nice macro, good sharpness. looks a bit unbalanced, would rotate it by 90 degrees clockwise', '2007-10-02 06:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132172, 592761, 49109, '<td valign="top">intersting, artsy crop and DOF, great color processing</td>', 'intersting, artsy crop and DOF, great color processing', '2007-10-02 06:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132173, 593862, 49109, '<td valign="top">very well composed shot, good color, clarity and DOF</td>', 'very well composed shot, good color, clarity and DOF', '2007-10-02 06:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132174, 585345, 49109, '<td valign="top">interesting processing, but not really my taste. very good detail</td>', 'interesting processing, but not really my taste. very good detail', '2007-10-02 06:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132185, 593295, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice study of character and life in the real world, just wish so much of the texture on his face and turban wasn''t lost.</td>', 'Nice study of character and life in the real world, just wish so much of the texture on his face and turban wasn''t lost.', '2007-10-02 06:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132186, 591370, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract and good use of leading lines here.</td>', 'Nice abstract and good use of leading lines here.', '2007-10-02 06:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132189, 593141, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice time of day for this and the steam/smoke coming off the tug is great here. Good control of the detail without halos.</td>', 'Nice time of day for this and the steam/smoke coming off the tug is great here. Good control of the detail without halos.', '2007-10-02 06:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132192, 593456, 19708, '<td valign="top">Can''t say the color palette here works for me. Nicely composed.<br/>A tip for the palm in the upper right - use the clone tool in darken mode and sample some of the sky just to the left of the halo, and paste over the halo. That will darken only the pixels darker than sampled and will remove the halo.</td>', 'Can''t say the color palette here works for me. Nicely composed.A tip for the palm in the upper right - use the clone tool in darken mode and sample some of the sky just to the left of the halo, and paste over the halo. That will darken only the pixels darker than sampled and will remove the halo.', '2007-10-02 06:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132193, 587487, 19708, '<td valign="top">Nice timing!</td>', 'Nice timing!', '2007-10-02 06:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132197, 593688, 19708, '<td valign="top">Well seen and the attitude on the cat''s face is great!</td>', 'Well seen and the attitude on the cat''s face is great!', '2007-10-02 06:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132198, 593572, 19708, '<td valign="top">I bet it is! Not your every day cat, at least not around my house.</td>', 'I bet it is! Not your every day cat, at least not around my house.', '2007-10-02 06:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132200, 593203, 19708, '<td valign="top">Unsual and so becoming! hehehe</td>', 'Unsual and so becoming! hehehe', '2007-10-02 06:38:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4132201, 594022, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great placement on the sun here. Nice silhouette too.</td>', 'Great placement on the sun here. Nice silhouette too.', '2007-10-02 06:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132223, 593623, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great light, great poses.  A very endearing portrait indeed.</td>', 'Great light, great poses.  A very endearing portrait indeed.', '2007-10-02 06:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132227, 591744, 30982, '<td valign="top">How incredibly sweet!  Wonderful capture.</td>', 'How incredibly sweet!  Wonderful capture.', '2007-10-02 06:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132246, 593787, 69700, '<td valign="top">I rated this one high because of the emotions and intense look of your subject.  I don''t like the color and hue of the photo, it looks like the white balance was not set correctly.  Was this a candid photo or did she agree to have her photo taken?</td>', 'I rated this one high because of the emotions and intense look of your subject.  I don''t like the color and hue of the photo, it looks like the white balance was not set correctly.  Was this a candid photo or did she agree to have her photo taken?', '2007-10-02 07:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132248, 594056, 58272, '<td valign="top">Nice focus. I think some bokeh, or some grungy editing might give this shot more interest.</td>', 'Nice focus. I think some bokeh, or some grungy editing might give this shot more interest.', '2007-10-02 07:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132252, 592641, 58272, '<td valign="top">The yellow overtone here seems a bit strong. I would like to see how this would look as a b&amp;w. Clearer focus on the eyes would have given this shot more impact IMO.</td>', 'The yellow overtone here seems a bit strong. I would like to see how this would look as a b&w. Clearer focus on the eyes would have given this shot more impact IMO.', '2007-10-02 07:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132256, 593991, 58272, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here. The soft focus is also done well while leaving the eyes as the main drawing point. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the composition here. The soft focus is also done well while leaving the eyes as the main drawing point. Nicely done.', '2007-10-02 07:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132259, 592114, 54228, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and DOF. May have benefitted from a tighter crop I think. 6</td>', 'Nice lighting and DOF. May have benefitted from a tighter crop I think. 6', '2007-10-02 07:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132261, 589081, 58272, '<td valign="top">I wish the focus were on the spider instead of the leaf.</td>', 'I wish the focus were on the spider instead of the leaf.', '2007-10-02 07:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132263, 593924, 54228, '<td valign="top">Nice repetition and a cool moment, pehaps a slightly faster shutter would have given this a bit moe of a ''frozen moment'' feel and a little extra crispness. 6</td>', 'Nice repetition and a cool moment, pehaps a slightly faster shutter would have given this a bit moe of a ''frozen moment'' feel and a little extra crispness. 6', '2007-10-02 07:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132264, 593947, 58272, '<td valign="top">Lovely vibrant colours! Good focus too!</td>', 'Lovely vibrant colours! Good focus too!', '2007-10-02 07:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132265, 593627, 54228, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this was an amazing sight, but I find it hard to rest my eyes anywhere in the picture. A clearer subject to focus on might be needed. 6</td>', 'I''m sure this was an amazing sight, but I find it hard to rest my eyes anywhere in the picture. A clearer subject to focus on might be needed. 6', '2007-10-02 07:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132266, 593354, 58272, '<td valign="top">Wow! The sky reminds me so much of a "choppy" ocean!. I like the choice of b&amp;w here yet there seems to much sky ( however dramatic) to too little land.</td>', 'Wow! The sky reminds me so much of a "choppy" ocean!. I like the choice of b&w here yet there seems to much sky ( however dramatic) to too little land.', '2007-10-02 07:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132267, 592752, 54228, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and focus gradiatation. I would like to see a little more sharpness in all of the drops, though. 7</td>', 'Nice colour and focus gradiatation. I would like to see a little more sharpness in all of the drops, though. 7', '2007-10-02 07:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132271, 593315, 58272, '<td valign="top">Nice tones here, though the composition feels a little strange to me.</td>', 'Nice tones here, though the composition feels a little strange to me.', '2007-10-02 07:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132272, 593002, 54228, '<td valign="top">Nice, desolate feel. It is a little hard to focus on any one of the forklifts though and I find my eyes constantly darting about, perhaps a little PP to bring out the one on the right. 6</td>', 'Nice, desolate feel. It is a little hard to focus on any one of the forklifts though and I find my eyes constantly darting about, perhaps a little PP to bring out the one on the right. 6', '2007-10-02 07:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132273, 589681, 54228, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the canal is a little hard to see, the sports ground is where my eyes gravitate. Nice sky though. 6</td>', 'Unfortunately the canal is a little hard to see, the sports ground is where my eyes gravitate. Nice sky though. 6', '2007-10-02 07:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132278, 587752, 54228, '<td valign="top">Not really enough detail for me, perhaps a little shapening is in order. 5</td>', 'Not really enough detail for me, perhaps a little shapening is in order. 5', '2007-10-02 07:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132280, 592641, 54228, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait. I particularly like the harsh shadows on his face, they bring out a lot of chararacter. Complimetary colours are nice, too. 8</td>', 'Very nice portrait. I particularly like the harsh shadows on his face, they bring out a lot of chararacter. Complimetary colours are nice, too. 8', '2007-10-02 07:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132285, 586480, 58272, '<td valign="top">There seems to be noise around the tower created by the editing process. Not overly sure how much you could get away with cloning out, but to me it is a noticable distraction.</td>', 'There seems to be noise around the tower created by the editing process. Not overly sure how much you could get away with cloning out, but to me it is a noticable distraction.', '2007-10-02 07:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132286, 593884, 54228, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a lower angle here to get more sky. The bottom two thirds of the trunk seem to fade into the background. 6</td>', 'Perhaps a lower angle here to get more sky. The bottom two thirds of the trunk seem to fade into the background. 6', '2007-10-02 07:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132287, 589702, 54228, '<td valign="top">Good, crisp, clear focus. Nice composition. It just lacks the wow. 6</td>', 'Good, crisp, clear focus. Nice composition. It just lacks the wow. 6', '2007-10-02 07:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132288, 583632, 54228, '<td valign="top">Nice, dark, emotive image. 7</td>', 'Nice, dark, emotive image. 7', '2007-10-02 07:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132290, 593984, 54228, '<td valign="top">The background almost feels painted here, B&amp;W works well. 7</td>', 'The background almost feels painted here, B&W works well. 7', '2007-10-02 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132291, 593995, 58272, '<td valign="top">I think this may have been better if the blackberries were uniformly in or out of focus. I might also try a different crop to eliminate the fence post? in the left bottom corner.</td>', 'I think this may have been better if the blackberries were uniformly in or out of focus. I might also try a different crop to eliminate the fence post? in the left bottom corner.', '2007-10-02 07:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132293, 593949, 54228, '<td valign="top">This feels very noisy and disjointed. I''m not really a fan of the desaturation either. 5</td>', 'This feels very noisy and disjointed. I''m not really a fan of the desaturation either. 5', '2007-10-02 07:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132294, 590208, 68797, '<td valign="top">beautiful landscape. how i would love to live there. good composition.</td>', 'beautiful landscape. how i would love to live there. good composition.', '2007-10-02 07:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132295, 589327, 58272, '<td valign="top">This has the feeling of a painting. I like the colours but am not sure about the overall image.</td>', 'This has the feeling of a painting. I like the colours but am not sure about the overall image.', '2007-10-02 07:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132297, 589938, 68797, '<td valign="top">a bit simple. a more shallow dof would''ve isolated the lily more.</td>', 'a bit simple. a more shallow dof would''ve isolated the lily more.', '2007-10-02 07:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132299, 592431, 54228, '<td valign="top">What a cool guy. Nice lighting, too. The processing works really well. 8</td>', 'What a cool guy. Nice lighting, too. The processing works really well. 8', '2007-10-02 07:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
