(4132745, 593110, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely vista.   The sepia treatment gives it a timeless feeling. Nicely composed but I might crop down a bit more at the top and eliminate the touch of white behind the mountain.  7</td>', 'Lovely vista.   The sepia treatment gives it a timeless feeling. Nicely composed but I might crop down a bit more at the top and eliminate the touch of white behind the mountain.  7', '2007-10-02 11:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132747, 593740, 15711, '<td valign="top">The hair over the eye seems a bit forced, but I like the soft focus and the beautiful lighting.</td>', 'The hair over the eye seems a bit forced, but I like the soft focus and the beautiful lighting.', '2007-10-02 11:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132750, 592976, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this but it seems rather dim if that makes sense.  You could do a duplicate layer in screen mode and it would brighten the entire image and then you could adjust the opacity. It works well and doesn''t distort anything.</td>', 'I like the idea of this but it seems rather dim if that makes sense.  You could do a duplicate layer in screen mode and it would brighten the entire image and then you could adjust the opacity. It works well and doesn''t distort anything.', '2007-10-02 11:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132753, 584373, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just love these little guys.  That tooth - LOL.  Nice capture. I could see this on the cover of Nat''l Geographic if the depth of field weren''t so narrow but I like it just the way it is!! 7</td>', 'I just love these little guys.  That tooth - LOL.  Nice capture. I could see this on the cover of Nat''l Geographic if the depth of field weren''t so narrow but I like it just the way it is!! 7', '2007-10-02 11:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132755, 592399, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is pretty but I think it''s lacking some oomph.  I might play with levels and curves adjustments. Or maybe contrast.  Sometimes yellow flowers are so hard to get right.  I''ve run into that time and time again. I love the softness and the composition but I think the overall tones deserve a bit of work. ;~D</td>', 'This is pretty but I think it''s lacking some oomph.  I might play with levels and curves adjustments. Or maybe contrast.  Sometimes yellow flowers are so hard to get right.  I''ve run into that time and time again. I love the softness and the composition but I think the overall tones deserve a bit of work. ;~D', '2007-10-02 11:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132757, 593596, 64795, '<td valign="top">Love it. 10</td>', 'Love it. 10', '2007-10-02 11:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132758, 584360, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  I like how the stems fan out.  Nice softness and narrow DOF The crop at the bottom seems a touch tight. ;~D</td>', 'Pretty.  I like how the stems fan out.  Nice softness and narrow DOF The crop at the bottom seems a touch tight. ;~D', '2007-10-02 11:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132762, 593809, 64795, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. 10</td>', 'Wonderful. 10', '2007-10-02 11:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132764, 585469, 15711, '<td valign="top">So pretty. It popped up after a few that weren''t so good, so what a refreshing change. I hope this does well for you. It is lovely and would make a gorgeous print!</td>', 'So pretty. It popped up after a few that weren''t so good, so what a refreshing change. I hope this does well for you. It is lovely and would make a gorgeous print!', '2007-10-02 11:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132766, 593991, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like her luminous skin.  I would probably remove the earrings, their shape kind of distract a bit.  Her eyes are gorgeous. Love the crop and the tilt of her head. 7</td>', 'I like her luminous skin.  I would probably remove the earrings, their shape kind of distract a bit.  Her eyes are gorgeous. Love the crop and the tilt of her head. 7', '2007-10-02 11:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132767, 592990, 64795, '<td valign="top">Yes! I love this. 8</td>', 'Yes! I love this. 8', '2007-10-02 11:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132769, 592674, 64795, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus. 9</td>', 'Perfect focus. 9', '2007-10-02 11:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132773, 591986, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really wish you''d used the full 640 pixels allowed.  This is a nice study in tones.</td>', 'I really wish you''d used the full 640 pixels allowed.  This is a nice study in tones.', '2007-10-02 11:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
