(4132778, 590303, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sweet face.  I really like the narrow DOF but I think that red carpet really kills the shot. You could even crop tighter to just have her face. The eyes and whiskers are spot on.</td>', 'Sweet face.  I really like the narrow DOF but I think that red carpet really kills the shot. You could even crop tighter to just have her face. The eyes and whiskers are spot on.', '2007-10-02 11:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132779, 592565, 64795, '<td valign="top">Ooo lala.  Thanks for this gorgeous photo. 9</td>', 'Ooo lala.  Thanks for this gorgeous photo. 9', '2007-10-02 11:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132781, 585655, 64795, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  This outdoors shot almost has a studio feel to it. :) 9</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  This outdoors shot almost has a studio feel to it. :) 9', '2007-10-02 11:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132782, 592266, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced with the clouds and silhouettes opposing one another. Very pretty.</td>', 'Nicely balanced with the clouds and silhouettes opposing one another. Very pretty.', '2007-10-02 11:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132784, 591854, 64795, '<td valign="top">Spectacular.  What an awesome trip.  Looking forward to the details on this one. :) 10</td>', 'Spectacular.  What an awesome trip.  Looking forward to the details on this one. :) 10', '2007-10-02 11:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132785, 593351, 39825, '<td valign="top">wow, love the contrast and the texture of the stones. wonderful light.</td>', 'wow, love the contrast and the texture of the stones. wonderful light.', '2007-10-02 11:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132788, 592183, 15711, '<td valign="top">I have a soft spot for drummers and guitar players.  Looks like his set is similar to our Pearls. I like the light but would somehow like the drums themselves to have a bit more illumination.  Either that or crop out the lower one.</td>', 'I have a soft spot for drummers and guitar players.  Looks like his set is similar to our Pearls. I like the light but would somehow like the drums themselves to have a bit more illumination.  Either that or crop out the lower one.', '2007-10-02 11:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132790, 593860, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the composition. The yellow against the blue is a perfect complementary color!! 7</td>', 'Nice.  I like the composition. The yellow against the blue is a perfect complementary color!! 7', '2007-10-02 11:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132792, 593670, 15711, '<td valign="top">oooh - what beautiful bokeh. I like the side lighting on the branches.  This is very delicate.  A tribute to Mother Nature. It would make a lovely print.</td>', 'oooh - what beautiful bokeh. I like the side lighting on the branches.  This is very delicate.  A tribute to Mother Nature. It would make a lovely print.', '2007-10-02 11:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132793, 594001, 64795, '<td valign="top">Didn''t you know.  You''re not allowed to take photos like this.  It''s illegal. 10  (by the way, I''m smitten)  :)</td>', 'Didn''t you know.  You''re not allowed to take photos like this.  It''s illegal. 10  (by the way, I''m smitten)  :)', '2007-10-02 11:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132794, 593809, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colors of the wall behind them.  Nice shot!!</td>', 'I like the bright colors of the wall behind them.  Nice shot!!', '2007-10-02 11:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132796, 590603, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  It seems ever so slightly tilted to the right though. Maybe it''s the angle from which you took it. GREAT tonal range.</td>', 'Very cool.  It seems ever so slightly tilted to the right though. Maybe it''s the angle from which you took it. GREAT tonal range.', '2007-10-02 11:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132798, 594007, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just love those grasses. I see them around here all the time and they are so delicate. Beautiful bokeh.</td>', 'I just love those grasses. I see them around here all the time and they are so delicate. Beautiful bokeh.', '2007-10-02 11:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132800, 593733, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really artful. Love the low key approach.  Stunning actually. The symmetry is perfect and the ring on the left hand is the only thing that alters the exact "sameness" which is kinda cool. 9</td>', 'Really artful. Love the low key approach.  Stunning actually. The symmetry is perfect and the ring on the left hand is the only thing that alters the exact "sameness" which is kinda cool. 9', '2007-10-02 11:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132801, 592520, 15711, '<td valign="top">Although they are at the same table, they are in totally different worlds. Great dichotomy. Old, younger, action, still, eating, looking... the list is endless.<br/> <br/>I like this candid.</td>', 'Although they are at the same table, they are in totally different worlds. Great dichotomy. Old, younger, action, still, eating, looking... the list is endless. I like this candid.', '2007-10-02 11:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132803, 590403, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  This would be a cool study in black and white as well. What a vista!!</td>', 'Very pretty.  This would be a cool study in black and white as well. What a vista!!', '2007-10-02 11:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132804, 589743, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh my.  This is stunning. I love the simplicity of it. Perfect contrasts and the square crop is spot on.  Delicious. 9</td>', 'Oh my.  This is stunning. I love the simplicity of it. Perfect contrasts and the square crop is spot on.  Delicious. 9', '2007-10-02 11:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132805, 593620, 64795, '<td valign="top">Spectacular. I''m completely in awe. 10</td>', 'Spectacular. I''m completely in awe. 10', '2007-10-02 11:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132810, 593351, 64795, '<td valign="top">Oooo.  Where is this place?  This would be perfect for my photo class.  Awesome lighting. 10</td>', 'Oooo.  Where is this place?  This would be perfect for my photo class.  Awesome lighting. 10', '2007-10-02 11:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132811, 592421, 15711, '<td valign="top">I remember that dude!!!  Great shot. I love the reflection in the sunglasses and the DOF. The sepia suits it very well. Good luck. 7</td>', 'I remember that dude!!!  Great shot. I love the reflection in the sunglasses and the DOF. The sepia suits it very well. Good luck. 7', '2007-10-02 11:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132812, 592885, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a wonderful mood. The misty trees are gorgeous and the leading line of the bridge sends our eye right to them.  Very nice.</td>', 'This has a wonderful mood. The misty trees are gorgeous and the leading line of the bridge sends our eye right to them.  Very nice.', '2007-10-02 11:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132816, 591228, 64795, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  WOW! AMAZING!  Spectacular... okay.  Can''t think of any more words to describe this.  10</td>', 'Gorgeous.  WOW! AMAZING!  Spectacular... okay.  Can''t think of any more words to describe this.  10', '2007-10-02 11:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
