(4132830, 592571, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful symmetry. WOW - the tones are perfect. I guess to make it as exactly balanced as it should be, you''d have been a bit to the left so that you are looking straight on. Really nice though.</td>', 'Beautiful symmetry. WOW - the tones are perfect. I guess to make it as exactly balanced as it should be, you''d have been a bit to the left so that you are looking straight on. Really nice though.', '2007-10-02 11:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
