(4132833, 584487, 49954, '<td valign="top">If fourth and two, we should be seeing fourth and two, not some random kid who is out of the play.</td>', 'If fourth and two, we should be seeing fourth and two, not some random kid who is out of the play.', '2007-10-02 11:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4132836, 592782, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus.  What wonderful editing.  I love the crystal clear eyes and then the slight softness around him.  The mole - how cute.  This is a great honest portrait and not cheesy or forced.</td>', 'Nice soft focus.  What wonderful editing.  I love the crystal clear eyes and then the slight softness around him.  The mole - how cute.  This is a great honest portrait and not cheesy or forced.', '2007-10-02 11:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
