(4132838, 593470, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really lovely.  If it were mine, I''d do a selective adjustment of neutrals and white  or maybe levels, to up the lighter tones a smidge. Nice composition and use of neg. space. 7</td>', 'Really lovely.  If it were mine, I''d do a selective adjustment of neutrals and white  or maybe levels, to up the lighter tones a smidge. Nice composition and use of neg. space. 7', '2007-10-02 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
