(4132880, 593949, 49954, '<td valign="top">WAYYYYYYYYYYYYYYY oversharpened.  If I weren''t wearing glasses, I''d have cut my eyes!  Good comp, bad processing.</td>', 'WAYYYYYYYYYYYYYYY oversharpened.  If I weren''t wearing glasses, I''d have cut my eyes!  Good comp, bad processing.', '2007-10-02 11:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
