(4132893, 593478, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is fantastic. So unexpected. Love the movement of the curtain, the geometry of the window and the POW of color from the inside curtain and the brick wall.  This is like a painting.  AWESOME.</td>', 'Oh this is fantastic. So unexpected. Love the movement of the curtain, the geometry of the window and the POW of color from the inside curtain and the brick wall.  This is like a painting.  AWESOME.', '2007-10-02 11:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
