(4133688, 586453, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but I think maybe a bit too soft, maybe a little bit less gausian blur (if that''s what you did) or reduce the opactiy of it.</td>', 'Nice composition but I think maybe a bit too soft, maybe a little bit less gausian blur (if that''s what you did) or reduce the opactiy of it.', '2007-10-02 15:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
