(4133724, 580764, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice macro with good colors and DOF. I like how you capture him/her on the web.</td>', 'Nice macro with good colors and DOF. I like how you capture him/her on the web.', '2007-10-02 15:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
