(4134886, 593487, 46177, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked to see a little more at the top to see the entire tree and perhaps a little less at the bottem so as not to see so much of that shadow across the bottem.  Maybe moving it up a bit would have made it a little more pleasing.  I like the use of black and white here though.  Good luck.</td>', 'I think I would have liked to see a little more at the top to see the entire tree and perhaps a little less at the bottem so as not to see so much of that shadow across the bottem.  Maybe moving it up a bit would have made it a little more pleasing.  I like the use of black and white here though.  Good luck.', '2007-10-02 22:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4134903, 583581, 61012, '<td valign="top">Holy Toledo, Batman nice shot. I like the contrast between her bright blonde hari and the deep blue of the sky. Very cute.</td>', 'Holy Toledo, Batman nice shot. I like the contrast between her bright blonde hari and the deep blue of the sky. Very cute.', '2007-10-02 22:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
