(4135304, 593861, 61012, '<td valign="top">Would have been a nice entry for the silhouette challenge. Nice leading line to the fisherman but I think he may be a bit too deep into the background for me. If he was placed at the 1/3 horizontal position it might have been better. Not just becaue of the rule of thirds but also because he would have stood out as a larger element of the photo. Still very nice as is.</td>', 'Would have been a nice entry for the silhouette challenge. Nice leading line to the fisherman but I think he may be a bit too deep into the background for me. If he was placed at the 1/3 horizontal position it might have been better. Not just becaue of the rule of thirds but also because he would have stood out as a larger element of the photo. Still very nice as is.', '2007-10-02 23:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4135305, 589514, 41337, '<td valign="top">The expression of her face seems to suggest a longing. I like how her hand is there but in the dark. It''s almost like it''s not her hand any more. Maybe it used to hold onto another but doesn''t now. Captivating shot.</td>', 'The expression of her face seems to suggest a longing. I like how her hand is there but in the dark. It''s almost like it''s not her hand any more. Maybe it used to hold onto another but doesn''t now. Captivating shot.', '2007-10-02 23:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
