(4136291, 593740, 23251, '<td valign="top">But it''s Spring hehe.  Lovely photo.  I would have liked to see the DOF increased slightly to bring her ears etc into focus, the background is a little distracting as well.</td>', 'But it''s Spring hehe.  Lovely photo.  I would have liked to see the DOF increased slightly to bring her ears etc into focus, the background is a little distracting as well.', '2007-10-03 06:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
