(4136462, 593907, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is one crazy building.  I love the all lines and patterns.  The contrast here is just perfect.  Very cool.</td>', 'This is one crazy building.  I love the all lines and patterns.  The contrast here is just perfect.  Very cool.', '2007-10-03 08:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
