(4136490, 594037, 55005, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light.  Love those rays.  Your choice of b&amp;w makes it an instant classic.  Amazing photo.</td>', 'Beautiful light.  Love those rays.  Your choice of b&w makes it an instant classic.  Amazing photo.', '2007-10-03 08:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136494, 593351, 55005, '<td valign="top">Love the tones here and the repetitive pattern.  I love how the light creates an inner "frame".  Really cool.</td>', 'Love the tones here and the repetitive pattern.  I love how the light creates an inner "frame".  Really cool.', '2007-10-03 08:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136504, 584617, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is truly stunning.  I have seen something similar just recently and was curious about the setup  This is one of my absolute favorites from this challenge and I really hope to see it ribbon.  Everything here is amazing -- the light, the tones, the composition.  Amazing job.</td>', 'This is truly stunning.  I have seen something similar just recently and was curious about the setup  This is one of my absolute favorites from this challenge and I really hope to see it ribbon.  Everything here is amazing -- the light, the tones, the composition.  Amazing job.', '2007-10-03 08:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136505, 588605, 55005, '<td valign="top">I love the angle.  The first time I saw this, it took me a while to figure out what it is (reading the titles would have helped).  :) Very creative.</td>', 'I love the angle.  The first time I saw this, it took me a while to figure out what it is (reading the titles would have helped).  :) Very creative.', '2007-10-03 08:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136510, 593553, 68035, '<td valign="top">Goodness what a fearsome looking woman!  With a teacher like her I think I may have concentrated a touch more at school.<br/> <br/>I presume this is a reconstructed living-village from the 19th Century.  I do like the composition although the light spots are a little distracting.  Very nice almost muted colours help emphasise the ''age'' of the scene.  I am both glad that you avoided going for sepia (which would have perhaps been a little too obvious) and at the same time intrigues as to what it would look like as a sepia shot<br/> <br/>Good composition and I like the fact that whilst it is centred the fact that Miss Nutterman is sitting to one side and the books are stacked to the other means that it is asymettrical<br/> <br/>Nice shot</td>', 'Goodness what a fearsome looking woman!  With a teacher like her I think I may have concentrated a touch more at school. I presume this is a reconstructed living-village from the 19th Century.  I do like the composition although the light spots are a little distracting.  Very nice almost muted colours help emphasise the ''age'' of the scene.  I am both glad that you avoided going for sepia (which would have perhaps been a little too obvious) and at the same time intrigues as to what it would look like as a sepia shot Good composition and I like the fact that whilst it is centred the fact that Miss Nutterman is sitting to one side and the books are stacked to the other means that it is asymettrical Nice shot', '2007-10-03 08:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136546, 584375, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. The angle is great and I love the color tone.</td>', 'Very nicely done. The angle is great and I love the color tone.', '2007-10-03 09:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136584, 593496, 25728, '<td valign="top">Having recently had the unfortunate experience of shooting a horse-show for the first time (in 100 degree heat) and spending an afternoon attempting to take many photos of horses and riders jumping - I have to applaud your timing. Good shot, nice focus and good contrast. Those black helmets just suck the light off of faces... good show!</td>', 'Having recently had the unfortunate experience of shooting a horse-show for the first time (in 100 degree heat) and spending an afternoon attempting to take many photos of horses and riders jumping - I have to applaud your timing. Good shot, nice focus and good contrast. Those black helmets just suck the light off of faces... good show!', '2007-10-03 09:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136639, 589205, 24913, '<td valign="top">REally interesting view of the delicate arch. Not one you see taken much.</td>', 'REally interesting view of the delicate arch. Not one you see taken much.', '2007-10-03 09:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136736, 587211, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I love allthe colors and the light.  Very moody ad very cool.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I love allthe colors and the light.  Very moody ad very cool.', '2007-10-03 10:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136751, 585552, 55005, '<td valign="top">What a great idea! I wish hands were a bit more in focus though. Really creative.</td>', 'What a great idea! I wish hands were a bit more in focus though. Really creative.', '2007-10-03 10:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136758, 594072, 55005, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot.  The details on the craters are amazing.  Superb job.</td>', 'Amazing shot.  The details on the craters are amazing.  Superb job.', '2007-10-03 10:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136777, 593921, 55005, '<td valign="top">Great details.  I find the background a bit too overpowering.  I also wonder how it would look in a vertical crop.</td>', 'Great details.  I find the background a bit too overpowering.  I also wonder how it would look in a vertical crop.', '2007-10-03 10:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136782, 593490, 55005, '<td valign="top">Perfect reflections, great moody skies.  Really beautiful.</td>', 'Perfect reflections, great moody skies.  Really beautiful.', '2007-10-03 10:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
