(4136792, 593798, 55005, '<td valign="top">Oh, all that texture!  I love the tight crop and b&amp;w treatment.  One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Oh, all that texture!  I love the tight crop and b&w treatment.  One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2007-10-03 10:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
