(4136801, 592752, 66353, '<td valign="top">To make something like this work focus needs to be spot on - and I''m afraid that''s not the case here. Focus here seems to be a tiny bit in front of the drops.</td>', 'To make something like this work focus needs to be spot on - and I''m afraid that''s not the case here. Focus here seems to be a tiny bit in front of the drops.', '2007-10-03 10:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
