(4136818, 593699, 55005, '<td valign="top">The light here is amazing, I love the texture of the flower.  It seems a bit oversharpened on the leaves, though.</td>', 'The light here is amazing, I love the texture of the flower.  It seems a bit oversharpened on the leaves, though.', '2007-10-03 10:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136865, 593631, 82088, '<td valign="top">I love pictures of the city.  I have never been to Manhattan, but your picture makes me want to go there.  Very lovely, very well done.  I really like the colors in this as well.</td>', 'I love pictures of the city.  I have never been to Manhattan, but your picture makes me want to go there.  Very lovely, very well done.  I really like the colors in this as well.', '2007-10-03 10:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136886, 593765, 82088, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tones, but I think I would prefer this in color.  I do love the intertwined hands though, that is what makes the photo for me.  Well done.</td>', 'I like the sepia tones, but I think I would prefer this in color.  I do love the intertwined hands though, that is what makes the photo for me.  Well done.', '2007-10-03 10:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136901, 581734, 82088, '<td valign="top">What a cool photo.  My eyes just keep wandering from one thing to the next, there is so much to look at (not in a bad way).  The one on the left side of the frame looks real.  My only critique is that I would crop out whatever it is that is in the top right hand corner of the picture.</td>', 'What a cool photo.  My eyes just keep wandering from one thing to the next, there is so much to look at (not in a bad way).  The one on the left side of the frame looks real.  My only critique is that I would crop out whatever it is that is in the top right hand corner of the picture.', '2007-10-03 10:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4136914, 587487, 82088, '<td valign="top">Want not.  <br/> <br/>Very interesting photo.  I like the rusted faucett, and the drop is cool too, you caught the picture just before it fell.  Really well captured!</td>', 'Want not.   Very interesting photo.  I like the rusted faucett, and the drop is cool too, you caught the picture just before it fell.  Really well captured!', '2007-10-03 10:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
