(4137934, 592738, 67258, '<td valign="top">It will be another six months before we get the slowly unfurling ferns :¬(<br/>This is a super photo - really crisp, with an excellent choice of depth of field to show the fern off to best advantage.  I parrticularly like the way you have captured the dead, decaying leaves - the colours and textural detail are superb.</td>', 'It will be another six months before we get the slowly unfurling ferns :¬(This is a super photo - really crisp, with an excellent choice of depth of field to show the fern off to best advantage.  I parrticularly like the way you have captured the dead, decaying leaves - the colours and textural detail are superb.', '2007-10-03 15:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137945, 590303, 67258, '<td valign="top">The sharp focus on the eyes is good, but the incredibly shallow depth of field (possibly post-processed?) provides a rather confused  reaction in me, giving an impression of the cat being almost disembodied.  I think this effect is possibly exaggerated by the fact that the black of the cat has merged completely with the shadow.</td>', 'The sharp focus on the eyes is good, but the incredibly shallow depth of field (possibly post-processed?) provides a rather confused  reaction in me, giving an impression of the cat being almost disembodied.  I think this effect is possibly exaggerated by the fact that the black of the cat has merged completely with the shadow.', '2007-10-03 15:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137948, 592813, 32378, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this.  The downward angle in the forground is very strong and tends to pull my attention to the orange trees.  The brightness of the organge trees hold my attention instead of letting the angle pull me more through the picture to the mountains in the background. Hope that all made sense.</td>', 'I like the colors in this.  The downward angle in the forground is very strong and tends to pull my attention to the orange trees.  The brightness of the organge trees hold my attention instead of letting the angle pull me more through the picture to the mountains in the background. Hope that all made sense.', '2007-10-03 15:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137950, 593564, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ver. very pretty - almost painterly.  The bokeh, and the light, are wonderful and really show the flower off to best advantage - the back-lighting on the stem is exquisite.  Super work!</td>', 'Ver. very pretty - almost painterly.  The bokeh, and the light, are wonderful and really show the flower off to best advantage - the back-lighting on the stem is exquisite.  Super work!', '2007-10-03 15:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
