(4138098, 593002, 68586, '<td valign="top">Fascinating shot, and not that dissimilar in theme to a mechanical elephants graveyard as these squat solid things sit here with their two tusks out front, waiting for the poachers to come and strip them of their valuables.<br/> <br/>Nice B&amp;W, perhaps a little grainy. <br/> <br/>Cool shot.</td>', 'Fascinating shot, and not that dissimilar in theme to a mechanical elephants graveyard as these squat solid things sit here with their two tusks out front, waiting for the poachers to come and strip them of their valuables. Nice B&W, perhaps a little grainy.  Cool shot.', '2007-10-03 16:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138100, 593604, 32378, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting perspective.  I like it, well done.</td>', 'This is an interesting perspective.  I like it, well done.', '2007-10-03 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
