(4138507, 591078, 71951, '<td valign="top">Very good macro with nice DOF and good colors. Nice composition.</td>', 'Very good macro with nice DOF and good colors. Nice composition.', '2007-10-03 18:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138508, 592898, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice angles and bokeh.</td>', 'Nice angles and bokeh.', '2007-10-03 18:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138510, 593626, 67258, '<td valign="top">I feel that this is one of those photographs that holds enormous appeal to the parents, but less for unconnected viewers.  The pose is reminiscent of some little porcelein figures that were popular a while back - not really to my taste, but a perfectly valid artistic expression, and one that I am sure will appeal to many.  The uncluttered composition, and the stage style spotlight on the sleeping child certainly focus the viewers'' attention in a way that is really quite soothing to the eye - you can feel the quiet and calm of the scene.  The skin seems a little too smooth and polished, although it is good to see the detail in the dress.  The boots seem a little incongruous with the summer dress, and my eye is drawn to the splodge on the bottom of the lower one, and I find myself wondering if the little girl has stepped on some chewing gum, which rather spoild the over-all effect ;¬)</td>', 'I feel that this is one of those photographs that holds enormous appeal to the parents, but less for unconnected viewers.  The pose is reminiscent of some little porcelein figures that were popular a while back - not really to my taste, but a perfectly valid artistic expression, and one that I am sure will appeal to many.  The uncluttered composition, and the stage style spotlight on the sleeping child certainly focus the viewers'' attention in a way that is really quite soothing to the eye - you can feel the quiet and calm of the scene.  The skin seems a little too smooth and polished, although it is good to see the detail in the dress.  The boots seem a little incongruous with the summer dress, and my eye is drawn to the splodge on the bottom of the lower one, and I find myself wondering if the little girl has stepped on some chewing gum, which rather spoild the over-all effect ;¬)', '2007-10-03 18:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138514, 593888, 71951, '<td valign="top">Photo looks familiar. Nice colors and view. Need to bring the brightness down a bit with hightlights/shadows. A levels adjust would help as well.</td>', 'Photo looks familiar. Nice colors and view. Need to bring the brightness down a bit with hightlights/shadows. A levels adjust would help as well.', '2007-10-03 18:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138516, 593999, 71951, '<td valign="top">Nice macro with good DOF. I like how the wingspan is fully in focus.</td>', 'Nice macro with good DOF. I like how the wingspan is fully in focus.', '2007-10-03 18:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138523, 593803, 68586, '<td valign="top">There''s areally nice surreal element to this shot that makes me smile.<br/> <br/>The red exit sign sadly pulls the eye away from the action, as does the fire alarm.<br/> <br/>Darn those bright red colours  :-  )</td>', 'There''s areally nice surreal element to this shot that makes me smile. The red exit sign sadly pulls the eye away from the action, as does the fire alarm. Darn those bright red colours  :-  )', '2007-10-03 18:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138530, 593226, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - very peaceful, great colours.<br/> <br/>Personally I might have chosen less foreground and more sky, but it looks a delightful place to be at sunset  :-  )</td>', 'Lovely shot - very peaceful, great colours. Personally I might have chosen less foreground and more sky, but it looks a delightful place to be at sunset  :-  )', '2007-10-03 18:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138531, 593002, 44628, '<td valign="top">I love the subject matter! Great idea and a beautiful photo</td>', 'I love the subject matter! Great idea and a beautiful photo', '2007-10-03 18:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138533, 592383, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh, nicely captured!  Which acting school did thid deer go to? - he certainly knows how to pose.  Wildlife photography is often characterised by shallow depths of field to isolate the subject from its surroundings, but your choice of a small aperture giving the widest possible dof was, I am sure, the right one.  The even texture of the grass as a backdrop is spot on, my only tiny, tiny nag is a very small patch between the nose and the left hand edge of the frame which my eye seems to have a fascination with!</td>', 'Oh, nicely captured!  Which acting school did thid deer go to? - he certainly knows how to pose.  Wildlife photography is often characterised by shallow depths of field to isolate the subject from its surroundings, but your choice of a small aperture giving the widest possible dof was, I am sure, the right one.  The even texture of the grass as a backdrop is spot on, my only tiny, tiny nag is a very small patch between the nose and the left hand edge of the frame which my eye seems to have a fascination with!', '2007-10-03 18:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138535, 593284, 68586, '<td valign="top">I''m not normally a fan of these shots, but this looks really nice. <br/> <br/>I like the autumnal colours and the double motion off the waterfall and the eddy in the river.</td>', 'I''m not normally a fan of these shots, but this looks really nice.  I like the autumnal colours and the double motion off the waterfall and the eddy in the river.', '2007-10-03 18:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138537, 593920, 44628, '<td valign="top">Way cool shot.</td>', 'Way cool shot.', '2007-10-03 18:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138538, 593549, 44628, '<td valign="top">Way cool shot!</td>', 'Way cool shot!', '2007-10-03 18:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138540, 593559, 44628, '<td valign="top">NICE!!</td>', 'NICE!!', '2007-10-03 18:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138556, 586998, 67258, '<td valign="top">That must have been an impressive sight to witness - hope you didn''t get too wet!  It is a shame that the cloud and light from the the lightning bolt has obscured the rest of the hills in the distance - the small glimpse we get at the left edge leaves me wishing for more, but here you were clearly at the mercy of nature!</td>', 'That must have been an impressive sight to witness - hope you didn''t get too wet!  It is a shame that the cloud and light from the the lightning bolt has obscured the rest of the hills in the distance - the small glimpse we get at the left edge leaves me wishing for more, but here you were clearly at the mercy of nature!', '2007-10-03 18:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138568, 590340, 67258, '<td valign="top">Getting the exposure right when shooting up to the sky like this must be quite challenging, but you have got it right.  The yellows against the blue make for a bold and attractive colour scheme, and it is pleasing to see that there isn''t any fringing around the edges.  It is a bit of a shame that none of the trees are truly vertical - I would have liked one to be fully perpendicular, to act as an anchor for my eyes.  As it is, I find myself dizzily tilting to one side.</td>', 'Getting the exposure right when shooting up to the sky like this must be quite challenging, but you have got it right.  The yellows against the blue make for a bold and attractive colour scheme, and it is pleasing to see that there isn''t any fringing around the edges.  It is a bit of a shame that none of the trees are truly vertical - I would have liked one to be fully perpendicular, to act as an anchor for my eyes.  As it is, I find myself dizzily tilting to one side.', '2007-10-03 18:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138580, 593637, 80691, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2007-10-03 18:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4138604, 593123, 53147, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture. The bokeh spider in the background seems gigantic in comparison. I guess he could be in the foreground. Has a bit of a messy feel to it but still a cool shot.</td>', 'Interesting capture. The bokeh spider in the background seems gigantic in comparison. I guess he could be in the foreground. Has a bit of a messy feel to it but still a cool shot.', '2007-10-03 18:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
