(4139512, 594089, 15511, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''ve seen this place in many locations. The duotone is interestingly effective. Did you try it in the other half, with a gray sky?</td>', 'I''m sure I''ve seen this place in many locations. The duotone is interestingly effective. Did you try it in the other half, with a gray sky?', '2007-10-03 23:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
