(4139542, 592400, 72782, '<td valign="top">Arn''t dog great!  I would like to have the shot shifted right just a bit, less out of focus body and a little more of what is being tase tested.</td>', 'Arn''t dog great!  I would like to have the shot shifted right just a bit, less out of focus body and a little more of what is being tase tested.', '2007-10-03 23:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139545, 592813, 72782, '<td valign="top">Wow and that is all I have to say about that.</td>', 'Wow and that is all I have to say about that.', '2007-10-03 23:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139547, 593452, 52336, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait.  Your control of light is very good and your model is beautiful.  Frame/crop is nic, and the vignette is a nice touch. 8</td>', 'This is a great portrait.  Your control of light is very good and your model is beautiful.  Frame/crop is nic, and the vignette is a nice touch. 8', '2007-10-03 23:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139549, 593656, 72782, '<td valign="top">Interesting Subject, Perfect Angle, and composition.  Really nice work</td>', 'Interesting Subject, Perfect Angle, and composition.  Really nice work', '2007-10-03 23:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139552, 591962, 15511, '<td valign="top">Freezing the propellers makes this look like a model. I love aircraft, especially historic ones like this...</td>', 'Freezing the propellers makes this look like a model. I love aircraft, especially historic ones like this...', '2007-10-03 23:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139554, 589205, 72782, '<td valign="top">I like the wide angle effect.  Would be interesting to see this from some different angles.</td>', 'I like the wide angle effect.  Would be interesting to see this from some different angles.', '2007-10-03 23:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139555, 593958, 52336, '<td valign="top">Not the best stage shot for me, because of the cymbal casting a shadow in front, the cut-off hand, the noisiness (which arguably also adds a bit of relevant edginess to the image), and the large area of negative space at the top. 5</td>', 'Not the best stage shot for me, because of the cymbal casting a shadow in front, the cut-off hand, the noisiness (which arguably also adds a bit of relevant edginess to the image), and the large area of negative space at the top. 5', '2007-10-03 23:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139557, 593855, 52336, '<td valign="top">Quite a lovely image, nice tones, nice black and white. 7</td>', 'Quite a lovely image, nice tones, nice black and white. 7', '2007-10-03 23:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139558, 592641, 52336, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrait, though a bit oversaturated for me.  If going for high contrast, black and white might have worked well in my opinion. 6</td>', 'Interesting portrait, though a bit oversaturated for me.  If going for high contrast, black and white might have worked well in my opinion. 6', '2007-10-03 23:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139564, 592965, 61012, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is a decent shot. I''ve been staring at it for several minutes to try to decide what would make it a better one. Perhaps a landscape orientation instead of portrait? Maybe some sharpening? A bit less vignetting in the sky? It''s a beautiful location so I don''t think it''s your subject. Actually I think what might improve it the most is just a better light (time of day). For me the watm horizontal light of the morning or afternoon just brings-out more drama.</td>', 'Ok, this is a decent shot. I''ve been staring at it for several minutes to try to decide what would make it a better one. Perhaps a landscape orientation instead of portrait? Maybe some sharpening? A bit less vignetting in the sky? It''s a beautiful location so I don''t think it''s your subject. Actually I think what might improve it the most is just a better light (time of day). For me the watm horizontal light of the morning or afternoon just brings-out more drama.', '2007-10-03 23:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139565, 585837, 72782, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2007-10-03 23:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139570, 592355, 51597, '<td valign="top">FABULOUS!!</td>', 'FABULOUS!!', '2007-10-03 23:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139577, 593385, 51597, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and editing..</td>', 'Excellent capture and editing..', '2007-10-03 23:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4139578, 593232, 72782, '<td valign="top">Who wants a camara with a billion frames a second.  I''d love to see the water splash.</td>', 'Who wants a camara with a billion frames a second.  I''d love to see the water splash.', '2007-10-03 23:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
