(4139588, 594074, 61012, '<td valign="top">I like the dark mood and leading lines of this shot. Unfortunately my eye is drawn to the extreme highlight (window and reflection)in the center which ultimately distracts from the nice textures of the walls and ceiling. I would like to see it with the highlight toned-down. Maybe this would even be an HDR candidate.</td>', 'I like the dark mood and leading lines of this shot. Unfortunately my eye is drawn to the extreme highlight (window and reflection)in the center which ultimately distracts from the nice textures of the walls and ceiling. I would like to see it with the highlight toned-down. Maybe this would even be an HDR candidate.', '2007-10-03 23:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
