(4140013, 591740, 61318, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had good color to work with this year, although it does look like you pushed the colors too far.  <br/> <br/>The Bells can be very tricky to shoot, especially this time of year.  Unfortunately, because of that light you''ve left a huge area much too dark.  <br/> <br/>I hope you get another opportunity to shoot there.</td>', 'Looks like you had good color to work with this year, although it does look like you pushed the colors too far.   The Bells can be very tricky to shoot, especially this time of year.  Unfortunately, because of that light you''ve left a huge area much too dark.   I hope you get another opportunity to shoot there.', '2007-10-04 02:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
