(4140020, 593762, 61318, '<td valign="top">Beautiful location as always, and you nailed the foreground...however, the hazy light takes away from the best feature of this location.</td>', 'Beautiful location as always, and you nailed the foreground...however, the hazy light takes away from the best feature of this location.', '2007-10-04 02:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4140024, 591740, 3727, '<td valign="top">avg vote,  a little too much color sat, or the grass is really a wierd color during this time of year... looks a little un natural (i''ve done lots of hiking and never seen that type of tint but doesn''t mean thats not what its like irl... just looks odd to me). The left of the picture is too dark and could have been cropped out. Not sure why the person is wearing a rain coat lol</td>', 'avg vote,  a little too much color sat, or the grass is really a wierd color during this time of year... looks a little un natural (i''ve done lots of hiking and never seen that type of tint but doesn''t mean thats not what its like irl... just looks odd to me). The left of the picture is too dark and could have been cropped out. Not sure why the person is wearing a rain coat lol', '2007-10-04 02:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4140027, 593472, 3727, '<td valign="top">avg vote, need a more interesting subject to make this work then someone in blue jeans and base ball cap. blur works just not subject for me.</td>', 'avg vote, need a more interesting subject to make this work then someone in blue jeans and base ball cap. blur works just not subject for me.', '2007-10-04 02:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
