(4140168, 593604, 53316, '<td valign="top">The perspective and sense of motion are awesome!! Your title really fits :-D  And the contrast is very nice as well.</td>', 'The perspective and sense of motion are awesome!! Your title really fits :-D  And the contrast is very nice as well.', '2007-10-04 05:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4140172, 594037, 53316, '<td valign="top">Border detracts in my opinion, because the lines on the road just... stop.  It works at the top, just not at the bottom. However, the image itself is stunning.  The contrast is lovely and I adore the composition.  Sun-rays like this always grab my interest.</td>', 'Border detracts in my opinion, because the lines on the road just... stop.  It works at the top, just not at the bottom. However, the image itself is stunning.  The contrast is lovely and I adore the composition.  Sun-rays like this always grab my interest.', '2007-10-04 05:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4140173, 593564, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think the border is excessive. The image itself is SO LOVELY.  I really adore the colors and style.</td>', 'I think the border is excessive. The image itself is SO LOVELY.  I really adore the colors and style.', '2007-10-04 05:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4140174, 593315, 53316, '<td valign="top">I like the overall idea - the perspective is nice and I like how you didn''t take the shot down the center of the hall  - but it feels like something is tilting.  I don''t think it is, it just feels that way to me.</td>', 'I like the overall idea - the perspective is nice and I like how you didn''t take the shot down the center of the hall  - but it feels like something is tilting.  I don''t think it is, it just feels that way to me.', '2007-10-04 05:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4140176, 593574, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors - maybe a bit darker of a background would have brought them out a bit more, but a good image nonetheless!!</td>', 'Wonderful colors - maybe a bit darker of a background would have brought them out a bit more, but a good image nonetheless!!', '2007-10-04 05:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4140177, 592879, 53316, '<td valign="top">Seems like a bit too much noise reduction was used. I really like the energy in the photo though!</td>', 'Seems like a bit too much noise reduction was used. I really like the energy in the photo though!', '2007-10-04 05:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
