(4141312, 593233, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice full frame composition! I''m hoping he really didn''t land on the water??</td>', 'Nice full frame composition! I''m hoping he really didn''t land on the water??', '2007-10-04 15:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141314, 593764, 35994, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is incredible! What is it?? A dried up lake or something? Colors are fantastic, adding to the favs.</td>', 'Wow, that is incredible! What is it?? A dried up lake or something? Colors are fantastic, adding to the favs.', '2007-10-04 15:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141315, 591622, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yep.</td>', 'Yep.', '2007-10-04 15:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141317, 592400, 35994, '<td valign="top">lol, how cute! Is he licking an icicle? It looks a tiny bit soft in his face but I think it works with the cute subject :)</td>', 'lol, how cute! Is he licking an icicle? It looks a tiny bit soft in his face but I think it works with the cute subject :)', '2007-10-04 15:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141319, 593224, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice flower good focus.  The bright green leaf at the top though is a little distracting and my attention is drawn to it.</td>', 'Nice flower good focus.  The bright green leaf at the top though is a little distracting and my attention is drawn to it.', '2007-10-04 15:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141328, 586659, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice setting.  Would like to see this at a different time of day, when the lighting on the rocks wasn''t so harsh.</td>', 'Nice setting.  Would like to see this at a different time of day, when the lighting on the rocks wasn''t so harsh.', '2007-10-04 15:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141334, 582881, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Not a big fan of all the border but that is a personal thing.  A little fill light on the dogs face may help a little.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Not a big fan of all the border but that is a personal thing.  A little fill light on the dogs face may help a little.', '2007-10-04 15:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141358, 593775, 32378, '<td valign="top">The shot is executed okay, but it just isn''t a very interesting subject for me.</td>', 'The shot is executed okay, but it just isn''t a very interesting subject for me.', '2007-10-04 15:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141367, 593974, 68586, '<td valign="top">I like the strong diagonals here and the sheer solidity and size of the structure fighting for your attention against the organic fraility of the person walking on it (and presumably going to jump into a river).<br/> <br/>I would be really interested to see a different crop on this, I wonder whether you should have lowered the picture to get the angle exiting the picture top left and lost the sky underneath the bridge ? This would have also have prevented the walkway being so central in the picture.<br/> <br/>Good shot though.</td>', 'I like the strong diagonals here and the sheer solidity and size of the structure fighting for your attention against the organic fraility of the person walking on it (and presumably going to jump into a river). I would be really interested to see a different crop on this, I wonder whether you should have lowered the picture to get the angle exiting the picture top left and lost the sky underneath the bridge ? This would have also have prevented the walkway being so central in the picture. Good shot though.', '2007-10-04 15:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141369, 593050, 32378, '<td valign="top">Lovely model and nice pose. It may be the focal length of the lens you used but her hand seems a little out of proportion.  Maybe its just me.</td>', 'Lovely model and nice pose. It may be the focal length of the lens you used but her hand seems a little out of proportion.  Maybe its just me.', '2007-10-04 15:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141375, 593840, 30982, '<td valign="top">Loved the show, not so fond of the movies.  Like the chrome and glass.</td>', 'Loved the show, not so fond of the movies.  Like the chrome and glass.', '2007-10-04 15:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141376, 589735, 32378, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this seems very harsh, looks like there was something done in editing to the right of the spider where the blue seems to have a dark streak from something.</td>', 'The lighting on this seems very harsh, looks like there was something done in editing to the right of the spider where the blue seems to have a dark streak from something.', '2007-10-04 15:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141378, 592965, 35994, '<td valign="top">Looks like the lake gets deep pretty quick! Nice place to kick your feet up &amp; relax.</td>', 'Looks like the lake gets deep pretty quick! Nice place to kick your feet up & relax.', '2007-10-04 15:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141380, 592641, 35994, '<td valign="top">He looks like a hardened man, I really like the textures &amp; detail you got in his face. He really looks like he''s concentrating on something (the game maybe?)</td>', 'He looks like a hardened man, I really like the textures & detail you got in his face. He really looks like he''s concentrating on something (the game maybe?)', '2007-10-04 15:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141381, 593024, 68586, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the red eyes and the green of the body and leaf. A gretaer depth of field may have helped here to bring more of the great texture of the leaf into sight (love the hairs around the edge), and it would obviously benefit from toning down the burnt out area through the centre of the leaf.<br/> <br/>Very good try on a tough subject though. well done.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the red eyes and the green of the body and leaf. A gretaer depth of field may have helped here to bring more of the great texture of the leaf into sight (love the hairs around the edge), and it would obviously benefit from toning down the burnt out area through the centre of the leaf. Very good try on a tough subject though. well done.', '2007-10-04 15:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141382, 593637, 35994, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!! Her blue dress matches those pretty blue eyes, an adorable shot.</td>', 'What a cutie!! Her blue dress matches those pretty blue eyes, an adorable shot.', '2007-10-04 15:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141383, 593924, 35994, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot!</td>', 'Nice action shot!', '2007-10-04 15:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141386, 593995, 30982, '<td valign="top">What amazing detail in the bird - posed so very well for you, too!  A classic, beautiful shot - I love the stages of the berries.</td>', 'What amazing detail in the bird - posed so very well for you, too!  A classic, beautiful shot - I love the stages of the berries.', '2007-10-04 15:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141387, 593496, 32378, '<td valign="top">Good action in this. Seems to overprocessed or something there appears to be some type of coloring around the riders pants.</td>', 'Good action in this. Seems to overprocessed or something there appears to be some type of coloring around the riders pants.', '2007-10-04 15:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141390, 593233, 68586, '<td valign="top">What an amamzing shot ! Did it really land in the lake ? I shall have to look this up afterwards and see what the story is  :- )<br/> <br/>Wonderful colours on the balloon and just about enough in the sky.<br/> <br/>I can''t quite decided whether the crop is too tight though . . ? I wonder whether it would have been good to see a bit more of the scenary to enjoy quite how surreal this looks  :-  )</td>', 'What an amamzing shot ! Did it really land in the lake ? I shall have to look this up afterwards and see what the story is  :- ) Wonderful colours on the balloon and just about enough in the sky. I can''t quite decided whether the crop is too tight though . . ? I wonder whether it would have been good to see a bit more of the scenary to enjoy quite how surreal this looks  :-  )', '2007-10-04 15:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141395, 593496, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great timing, and perfect freeze frame. <br/> <br/>I really like the way both the rider and the horse have stooped their heads slightly to see where they are going to land.<br/> <br/>The only thing I would change here (if possible) would be to give the rider more headroom.</td>', 'Great timing, and perfect freeze frame.  I really like the way both the rider and the horse have stooped their heads slightly to see where they are going to land. The only thing I would change here (if possible) would be to give the rider more headroom.', '2007-10-04 15:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
