(4141462, 591620, 68586, '<td valign="top">Do you know I was in that same hotel room last week . .  lol<br/> <br/>I really really like the portrait aspect of this shot, and would probably like it better if there was nothing else inside the box apart from this delightful looking child in a wonderful pose. The title does well to explain whats going on, but the stuff on the bottom of the box looks a little cluttered to me (even if it was real life :- )). <br/> <br/>I would really like to see this shot done again, exactly the same, but with little or nothing else in the box, maybe just a favourite blanket. So you have the four converging lines drawing you into the picture, a nothing to draw your eye away or distract you from focusing in on the upturned face.<br/> <br/>Really nice.</td>', 'Do you know I was in that same hotel room last week . .  lol I really really like the portrait aspect of this shot, and would probably like it better if there was nothing else inside the box apart from this delightful looking child in a wonderful pose. The title does well to explain whats going on, but the stuff on the bottom of the box looks a little cluttered to me (even if it was real life :- )).  I would really like to see this shot done again, exactly the same, but with little or nothing else in the box, maybe just a favourite blanket. So you have the four converging lines drawing you into the picture, a nothing to draw your eye away or distract you from focusing in on the upturned face. Really nice.', '2007-10-04 16:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141465, 593123, 68586, '<td valign="top">Good shot, and I like the way there is a highlighted section of the web that leads the eye into the spider.<br/> <br/>The only thing I find slightly confusing is the apparent large OOF spider top right. It appear to be a giant version of the one you have captured ?</td>', 'Good shot, and I like the way there is a highlighted section of the web that leads the eye into the spider. The only thing I find slightly confusing is the apparent large OOF spider top right. It appear to be a giant version of the one you have captured ?', '2007-10-04 16:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141467, 593568, 43073, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, well exposed with good use of depth of field. I''m not real fond of the thick border (but don''t mark it lower for that, I just try to ignore it). I might have tried the droplet off center, probably sliding it down and to the right a tad.</td>', 'Interesting image, well exposed with good use of depth of field. I''m not real fond of the thick border (but don''t mark it lower for that, I just try to ignore it). I might have tried the droplet off center, probably sliding it down and to the right a tad.', '2007-10-04 16:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141469, 593550, 43073, '<td valign="top">Intriguing image, with great textures and tones throughout.</td>', 'Intriguing image, with great textures and tones throughout.', '2007-10-04 16:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
