(4141487, 593942, 68586, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous bird.<br/> <br/>It could perhaps have taken a little more saturation as these normally have very rich colours up close, but it''s a crisp clear shot, and nicely composed.<br/> <br/>While you''re waiting for the challenge to finish you can look up the website of the Zoo or Hawk centre and find out exactly what particular Bird of Prey it is  :-  )</td>', 'Gorgeous bird. It could perhaps have taken a little more saturation as these normally have very rich colours up close, but it''s a crisp clear shot, and nicely composed. While you''re waiting for the challenge to finish you can look up the website of the Zoo or Hawk centre and find out exactly what particular Bird of Prey it is  :-  )', '2007-10-04 16:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
