(4141527, 593977, 68586, '<td valign="top">There are lots of visual treats in this shot. <br/> <br/>I really like the B&amp;W conversion, ground, the shack, the tree, and most of the sky. The only problem for me is the sky directly  above the shack. <br/> <br/>The sunbeams appear to be drawn on, above a burnt out cloud ?<br/> <br/>To be honest these are relatively minor points and it is still a very pleasing picture - the real issue is that the whiteness of the burnt out cloud lifts the eye up and away from where the focal point should be - the shack.<br/> <br/>Tone down the cloud, lose the sunbeams and this would be even better</td>', 'There are lots of visual treats in this shot.  I really like the B&W conversion, ground, the shack, the tree, and most of the sky. The only problem for me is the sky directly  above the shack.  The sunbeams appear to be drawn on, above a burnt out cloud ? To be honest these are relatively minor points and it is still a very pleasing picture - the real issue is that the whiteness of the burnt out cloud lifts the eye up and away from where the focal point should be - the shack. Tone down the cloud, lose the sunbeams and this would be even better', '2007-10-04 16:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141529, 593656, 66597, '<td valign="top">Lovely lines and textures here. Doesn''t look like the full tonal range is quite represented - maybe try some other methods of b/w conversion?</td>', 'Lovely lines and textures here. Doesn''t look like the full tonal range is quite represented - maybe try some other methods of b/w conversion?', '2007-10-04 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
