(4141533, 592571, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is really gorgeous. My only nit is the blown out area in the boat''s front area, but it''s minor compared with the movement, lines and patterns in this photo. 9.</td>', 'This is really gorgeous. My only nit is the blown out area in the boat''s front area, but it''s minor compared with the movement, lines and patterns in this photo. 9.', '2007-10-04 16:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141534, 593678, 43073, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of full silhouettes, but this is a good one, with nice flow taking you down to the hand. I might have tried a lower angle, so as to get the hand a bit more and to get rid of the distant scenery (which is distracting to me).</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of full silhouettes, but this is a good one, with nice flow taking you down to the hand. I might have tried a lower angle, so as to get the hand a bit more and to get rid of the distant scenery (which is distracting to me).', '2007-10-04 16:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
