(4141601, 592201, 82693, '<td valign="top">We have one of those as a pet! But this is such a nice picture. His color is so bright and lively, the way his tail is curved adds so much to this, I like the blurred background so you focus on him and the branch hes on, and his mouth being open is prime. He looks hungry haha.</td>', 'We have one of those as a pet! But this is such a nice picture. His color is so bright and lively, the way his tail is curved adds so much to this, I like the blurred background so you focus on him and the branch hes on, and his mouth being open is prime. He looks hungry haha.', '2007-10-04 16:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141604, 590358, 82693, '<td valign="top">Its almost as if it was posing for you! But I think the background was blurred a little too much, the back end of the pray mantise should be a little more clear. And maybe with a little more editing you could of made his color a little brighter.</td>', 'Its almost as if it was posing for you! But I think the background was blurred a little too much, the back end of the pray mantise should be a little more clear. And maybe with a little more editing you could of made his color a little brighter.', '2007-10-04 16:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
