(4141668, 591744, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, with a bit stronger/contrasted reflection this would be even better. I like the lighting in the upper right corner. One of those that make you say, "Awww". :-)</td>', 'For me, with a bit stronger/contrasted reflection this would be even better. I like the lighting in the upper right corner. One of those that make you say, "Awww". :-)', '2007-10-04 17:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
