(4141678, 587211, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a differnt type of entry. The bright area in the lower left distracts me a bit. I covered it with my finger and liked the photo even more. The smoke/fog effect works well with the title. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice to see a differnt type of entry. The bright area in the lower left distracts me a bit. I covered it with my finger and liked the photo even more. The smoke/fog effect works well with the title. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-04 17:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
