(4141761, 589797, 63398, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture! Terrific image......VERY nice work!</td>', 'Awesome capture! Terrific image......VERY nice work!', '2007-10-04 17:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141766, 593958, 63398, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture of a performer! Great lighting effects.</td>', 'Terrific capture of a performer! Great lighting effects.', '2007-10-04 17:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141772, 593443, 68586, '<td valign="top">Certainly a different idea. Colourwise you  have the strongest colour inthe middle which is a good idea, and also appears to be the focal point. This prevents the eye being drawn away to some corner.<br/> <br/>Will this have the special something to capture votes here ? I suspect not. Does this mean it''s a bad photo ? Certainly not.<br/> <br/>You have captured an every day scene, creatively used DoF, and got a good range of colours. This could be a good ''stock shot''.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Certainly a different idea. Colourwise you  have the strongest colour inthe middle which is a good idea, and also appears to be the focal point. This prevents the eye being drawn away to some corner. Will this have the special something to capture votes here ? I suspect not. Does this mean it''s a bad photo ? Certainly not. You have captured an every day scene, creatively used DoF, and got a good range of colours. This could be a good ''stock shot''. Well done.', '2007-10-04 17:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141773, 592565, 68586, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.</td>', 'Quite beautiful.', '2007-10-04 17:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141774, 594037, 63398, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sun rays. I don''t care much for the letterbox border, but a beautiful image nonetheless.</td>', 'Beautiful sun rays. I don''t care much for the letterbox border, but a beautiful image nonetheless.', '2007-10-04 17:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141781, 593321, 68586, '<td valign="top">Maybe the title should read ''3 Crosses'' ?<br/> <br/>Very interesting effect but the black line on the rear wall is too distracting for me. crop that out and this would be a different picture.</td>', 'Maybe the title should read ''3 Crosses'' ? Very interesting effect but the black line on the rear wall is too distracting for me. crop that out and this would be a different picture.', '2007-10-04 17:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141784, 594068, 63398, '<td valign="top">Oh, what a wonderful expression!!! Great capture!Great detail and nice bokeh, too! 7</td>', 'Oh, what a wonderful expression!!! Great capture!Great detail and nice bokeh, too! 7', '2007-10-04 17:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141787, 593715, 68586, '<td valign="top">What a sweet kitten . .<br/> <br/>The only thing to improve this for me would be to include his paw and the top of his ear.<br/> <br/>Otherwise great focus and lovely catch lights.</td>', 'What a sweet kitten . . The only thing to improve this for me would be to include his paw and the top of his ear. Otherwise great focus and lovely catch lights.', '2007-10-04 17:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141790, 593814, 63398, '<td valign="top">Cool idea! It''s good in B&amp;W, though I do have to wonder how all those different plates in color may have looked. Good image, though.</td>', 'Cool idea! It''s good in B&W, though I do have to wonder how all those different plates in color may have looked. Good image, though.', '2007-10-04 17:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141792, 587211, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very atmospheric and moody. Really nice.<br/> <br/>The only suggestion would be to lose the black thing to the left middle which spoils the outline of the trombone.<br/> <br/>Otherwise a great shot.</td>', 'Very atmospheric and moody. Really nice. The only suggestion would be to lose the black thing to the left middle which spoils the outline of the trombone. Otherwise a great shot.', '2007-10-04 17:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141795, 587281, 68586, '<td valign="top">Ah - is that a Hummingbird Hawk Moth ? Good capture and I think the motion blur on the wings adds to this. Perhaps the focus could have been a tiny bit crisper on the moth ?</td>', 'Ah - is that a Hummingbird Hawk Moth ? Good capture and I think the motion blur on the wings adds to this. Perhaps the focus could have been a tiny bit crisper on the moth ?', '2007-10-04 17:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141796, 592138, 63398, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is just the most awesome shot!!!! My vote for the Blue!!!! 10++ An instant Fav!</td>', 'Oh, this is just the most awesome shot!!!! My vote for the Blue!!!! 10++ An instant Fav!', '2007-10-04 17:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141804, 594044, 68586, '<td valign="top">Flamingo''s are such photogenic animals - lovely colours and very graceful.<br/> <br/>You have a nice colourful flamingo here enjoying the sunshine and a quick paddle which is nice and relaxed. For me, this shot would be stronger if the background was less cluttered. This obviously isn''t always easy to achieve, but it does help through the viewer back to the bird and away from stray logs and cement walls.<br/> <br/>If it was just the bird, the water, and the plant this would have been even better.</td>', 'Flamingo''s are such photogenic animals - lovely colours and very graceful. You have a nice colourful flamingo here enjoying the sunshine and a quick paddle which is nice and relaxed. For me, this shot would be stronger if the background was less cluttered. This obviously isn''t always easy to achieve, but it does help through the viewer back to the bird and away from stray logs and cement walls. If it was just the bird, the water, and the plant this would have been even better.', '2007-10-04 18:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141805, 593725, 63398, '<td valign="top">I love this selective desat! What a terrific image! Love the dual attention grabbers.</td>', 'I love this selective desat! What a terrific image! Love the dual attention grabbers.', '2007-10-04 18:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141812, 594074, 68586, '<td valign="top">I like the deep rich colours and tones in this.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately (on my monitor at least) the windows seem to have a cyan tint to them. Otherwise very nice.</td>', 'I like the deep rich colours and tones in this. Unfortunately (on my monitor at least) the windows seem to have a cyan tint to them. Otherwise very nice.', '2007-10-04 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141817, 593373, 63398, '<td valign="top">A truly gorgeous portrait! PLEASE rework this ''til you get the hotspots from the cheeks......this will be a world-class image cleaned up. Beautiful expression, crop, the softness level is perfect.....</td>', 'A truly gorgeous portrait! PLEASE rework this ''til you get the hotspots from the cheeks......this will be a world-class image cleaned up. Beautiful expression, crop, the softness level is perfect.....', '2007-10-04 18:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141821, 591985, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot of a very pretty girl (even if she does appear to be frowning a little)  :-  )</td>', 'Lovely shot of a very pretty girl (even if she does appear to be frowning a little)  :-  )', '2007-10-04 18:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141826, 592832, 63398, '<td valign="top">Really, really nice clean capture. 7</td>', 'Really, really nice clean capture. 7', '2007-10-04 18:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141828, 592879, 11854, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2007-10-04 18:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141830, 593909, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!</td>', 'Beautiful image!', '2007-10-04 18:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
