(4141934, 593255, 74979, '<td valign="top">what a pretty girl! Very nice portrait;  I like the landscape orientation here; fits well with the trees &amp; boke in bg</td>', 'what a pretty girl! Very nice portrait;  I like the landscape orientation here; fits well with the trees & boke in bg', '2007-10-04 18:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141936, 590758, 63398, '<td valign="top">Interesting......I like the light and shadows.</td>', 'Interesting......I like the light and shadows.', '2007-10-04 18:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141940, 590290, 23251, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot.  To be nit picky I would like to have seen the crop slightly different, include the full knee and crop out that hose? on the left hand side.  Well Done.</td>', 'An interesting shot.  To be nit picky I would like to have seen the crop slightly different, include the full knee and crop out that hose? on the left hand side.  Well Done.', '2007-10-04 18:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141942, 592520, 63398, '<td valign="top">What a cool time warp kind of shot. I like it very much.</td>', 'What a cool time warp kind of shot. I like it very much.', '2007-10-04 18:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141950, 593974, 64446, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is (bridge?, building in construction?), but I can see you took the care to crop and level the image properly, with a consciousness of its lines and design. Color saturation is good and got nice skies to contrast with the structure. (the title doesn''t help me understand what excaclty you are trying to convey - pardon my ignorance).</td>', 'Not sure what it is (bridge?, building in construction?), but I can see you took the care to crop and level the image properly, with a consciousness of its lines and design. Color saturation is good and got nice skies to contrast with the structure. (the title doesn''t help me understand what excaclty you are trying to convey - pardon my ignorance).', '2007-10-04 18:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141952, 593795, 23251, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, the shadow causes the loss of some detail but still nice.</td>', 'Interesting photo, the shadow causes the loss of some detail but still nice.', '2007-10-04 18:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141955, 590946, 23251, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, some blown out parts in the white uniforms but not bad.</td>', 'Nice action shot, some blown out parts in the white uniforms but not bad.', '2007-10-04 18:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141957, 593775, 64446, '<td valign="top">Good leading lines and the hands showing out go well with the title. Garbage cans normally don''t do well at DPC. Particularly here, they are distractions along with the people in the bg. Tighting the crop (by eliminating the post and those folks could help...)</td>', 'Good leading lines and the hands showing out go well with the title. Garbage cans normally don''t do well at DPC. Particularly here, they are distractions along with the people in the bg. Tighting the crop (by eliminating the post and those folks could help...)', '2007-10-04 18:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141959, 593862, 23251, '<td valign="top">And he''s looking right at you! Excellent work!</td>', 'And he''s looking right at you! Excellent work!', '2007-10-04 18:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141960, 593600, 63398, '<td valign="top">Umm....I don''t have any idea what this is, or what the title means.....sorry. 3</td>', 'Umm....I don''t have any idea what this is, or what the title means.....sorry. 3', '2007-10-04 18:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141967, 593610, 23251, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the centred composition and the Post Processing seems a little overdone IMHO.</td>', 'Not sure I like the centred composition and the Post Processing seems a little overdone IMHO.', '2007-10-04 18:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141969, 593786, 64446, '<td valign="top">Love the sharpness and the contrast with blue sky. Even those shades (which some might say are distracting) contribute to give some movement in this image.</td>', 'Love the sharpness and the contrast with blue sky. Even those shades (which some might say are distracting) contribute to give some movement in this image.', '2007-10-04 18:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141971, 589090, 63398, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.....a tad busy though, and the subject seems more to be the young woman than the tree.</td>', 'Very pretty.....a tad busy though, and the subject seems more to be the young woman than the tree.', '2007-10-04 18:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141972, 593244, 64670, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, LOVE the moment it portrays.  Think the processing is PERFECT as is the frame - YUMMY!</td>', 'Wonderful image, LOVE the moment it portrays.  Think the processing is PERFECT as is the frame - YUMMY!', '2007-10-04 18:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141975, 593604, 64670, '<td valign="top">This image is SO STUNNINGLY beautiful.  The angle is delicious, the hair on the main is unbelieveably light, whispy and etheric.  I really adore the processing - just SUBLIME!</td>', 'This image is SO STUNNINGLY beautiful.  The angle is delicious, the hair on the main is unbelieveably light, whispy and etheric.  I really adore the processing - just SUBLIME!', '2007-10-04 18:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141977, 592869, 64670, '<td valign="top">Amazing array of colours.</td>', 'Amazing array of colours.', '2007-10-04 18:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141978, 583581, 23251, '<td valign="top">The centred composition and the hair blowing in front of the face take a bit away from this photo, I know the glasses are there for a reason but being able to see her eye''s dosen''t help either IMHO.</td>', 'The centred composition and the hair blowing in front of the face take a bit away from this photo, I know the glasses are there for a reason but being able to see her eye''s dosen''t help either IMHO.', '2007-10-04 18:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141982, 593936, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, skin tone and lighting on her face. The sun is too harsh on the hair though, with some blown spots. A lovely portrait overall...</td>', 'Nice focus, skin tone and lighting on her face. The sun is too harsh on the hair though, with some blown spots. A lovely portrait overall...', '2007-10-04 18:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141984, 594028, 64670, '<td valign="top">The processing for this treatment is spot on.  I just LOVE the yellow hydrant in the front.  My only beef and you probably couldn''t control it, is the two cares,  without them it would have been a bit more ''retro'' in feel, the cars are just a bit too ''modern'' for me.  Good luck.</td>', 'The processing for this treatment is spot on.  I just LOVE the yellow hydrant in the front.  My only beef and you probably couldn''t control it, is the two cares,  without them it would have been a bit more ''retro'' in feel, the cars are just a bit too ''modern'' for me.  Good luck.', '2007-10-04 18:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141988, 585018, 23251, '<td valign="top">A piture of concentration nice! The eye seems a little soft.</td>', 'A piture of concentration nice! The eye seems a little soft.', '2007-10-04 18:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141989, 592355, 64670, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you had in the background but I would have sacrificed some of the foreground for the background.</td>', 'Not sure what you had in the background but I would have sacrificed some of the foreground for the background.', '2007-10-04 18:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141994, 592111, 64670, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment to work out where the bees head is - GRIN!  For more drama maybe play with the image and see what it would look like if you only had the top right corner, I think it too would have made a good image.</td>', 'Took me a moment to work out where the bees head is - GRIN!  For more drama maybe play with the image and see what it would look like if you only had the top right corner, I think it too would have made a good image.', '2007-10-04 19:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4141999, 592492, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lovely gentle image. I''m looking at it with the top cropped off as I write this and think it may have worked well without the detail and sky above.</td>', 'Lovely gentle image. I''m looking at it with the top cropped off as I write this and think it may have worked well without the detail and sky above.', '2007-10-04 19:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142003, 593670, 23251, '<td valign="top">Its anice photo but I find the DOF a little shallow and the blured upper branch is a little distracting.</td>', 'Its anice photo but I find the DOF a little shallow and the blured upper branch is a little distracting.', '2007-10-04 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142004, 594086, 64670, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moment, lovely looking couple and great B&amp;W.  A tip for future portraits - see the brides neck has creases, if you get her to slightly put her chin out and forward, not extremely and it may feel weird to her, but it would remove those lines which I find distracting in such an otherwise clean image.</td>', 'Beautiful moment, lovely looking couple and great B&W.  A tip for future portraits - see the brides neck has creases, if you get her to slightly put her chin out and forward, not extremely and it may feel weird to her, but it would remove those lines which I find distracting in such an otherwise clean image.', '2007-10-04 19:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142007, 591364, 64670, '<td valign="top">Way cool image - what a truly happy looking human being.  I like the processing you''ve chosen, looks particularly good on the jeans, but seems to loose some detail in the face, disappointingly particularly around the eyes - which look like they want to sparkle.</td>', 'Way cool image - what a truly happy looking human being.  I like the processing you''ve chosen, looks particularly good on the jeans, but seems to loose some detail in the face, disappointingly particularly around the eyes - which look like they want to sparkle.', '2007-10-04 19:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142015, 593827, 64670, '<td valign="top">Gentle image, not sure if it''s intentional to create softness or you didn''t use a tripod.<br/> <br/>The horse looks a little 2D - would like to see it ''pop'' from the background more.</td>', 'Gentle image, not sure if it''s intentional to create softness or you didn''t use a tripod. The horse looks a little 2D - would like to see it ''pop'' from the background more.', '2007-10-04 19:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142019, 593688, 64670, '<td valign="top">Wow - that is FUNNY!  What a fierce glare that cat''s giving - glade I''m not in his firing line.<br/> <br/>Think the image could have used some selective colour (white) to POP!</td>', 'Wow - that is FUNNY!  What a fierce glare that cat''s giving - glade I''m not in his firing line. Think the image could have used some selective colour (white) to POP!', '2007-10-04 19:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142027, 593627, 64670, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this scene and surrounding areas is beautiful, but this image doesn''t convey the full force of it.<br/> <br/>The grey sky is flat and ''nothing'' without clouds, which you couldn''t control.  I think I''d have walked closer to the edge of the green and shot through the large foreground stone and the one on it''s right.</td>', 'I''m sure this scene and surrounding areas is beautiful, but this image doesn''t convey the full force of it. The grey sky is flat and ''nothing'' without clouds, which you couldn''t control.  I think I''d have walked closer to the edge of the green and shot through the large foreground stone and the one on it''s right.', '2007-10-04 19:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142033, 590946, 64670, '<td valign="top">Such a shiny image.  I think some of the detail is not due to the lighting which you could clearly not control.  Would hate to be the guy in the middle on the ground - GRIN!</td>', 'Such a shiny image.  I think some of the detail is not due to the lighting which you could clearly not control.  Would hate to be the guy in the middle on the ground - GRIN!', '2007-10-04 19:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142034, 593320, 64670, '<td valign="top">Cute subject, but it''s a bit lost in translation.  I think the image is too ''soft'', needed a more steady hand or tripod.  The slant of the fence is distracting.</td>', 'Cute subject, but it''s a bit lost in translation.  I think the image is too ''soft'', needed a more steady hand or tripod.  The slant of the fence is distracting.', '2007-10-04 19:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142037, 593795, 64670, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but the lighting is too harse to get the full impact of details.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but the lighting is too harse to get the full impact of details.', '2007-10-04 19:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142038, 591653, 63398, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m giving you too high a vote, but it''s ''cause I like old decrepit cars so much. Strictly subjective and visceral, a 9 and a fav! LOVE everything about this image!</td>', 'Well, I''m giving you too high a vote, but it''s ''cause I like old decrepit cars so much. Strictly subjective and visceral, a 9 and a fav! LOVE everything about this image!', '2007-10-04 19:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142040, 593898, 64670, '<td valign="top">I am in awe of such clear shots.  Great colours too.</td>', 'I am in awe of such clear shots.  Great colours too.', '2007-10-04 19:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142042, 593140, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lovely location and idea, but it''s all a bit flat, which is a shame.   I would like to have seen more contrast - and I do think if you''d done that and maybe played with selective colours and/or B&amp;W conversion this image would have worked better.</td>', 'Lovely location and idea, but it''s all a bit flat, which is a shame.   I would like to have seen more contrast - and I do think if you''d done that and maybe played with selective colours and/or B&W conversion this image would have worked better.', '2007-10-04 19:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142044, 592885, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done! Love the (assumed) HDR. The image is painting like, yet photographic at the same time. Excellent work. 10</td>', 'Beautifully done! Love the (assumed) HDR. The image is painting like, yet photographic at the same time. Excellent work. 10', '2007-10-04 19:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142046, 589512, 63398, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Fabulous lighting and detail. 8</td>', 'Great shot! Fabulous lighting and detail. 8', '2007-10-04 19:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142049, 592985, 64670, '<td valign="top">Wow - how incredibly close.  The image doesn''t appeal to me though, can''t quite grasp why.  I do like the sharpness, just lacks something.</td>', 'Wow - how incredibly close.  The image doesn''t appeal to me though, can''t quite grasp why.  I do like the sharpness, just lacks something.', '2007-10-04 19:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142055, 583581, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great image.  LOVE the sky it''s AWESOME!  Not sure if you have Lucisart or similar, but I''d have liked to see what it does to Batman - he ROCKS!</td>', 'Great image.  LOVE the sky it''s AWESOME!  Not sure if you have Lucisart or similar, but I''d have liked to see what it does to Batman - he ROCKS!', '2007-10-04 19:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142057, 593355, 64670, '<td valign="top">This image suffers from lack of clear point of focus.  The viewer has no real idea which part of the image you want our eyes to settle on first, no clear ''point'' of focus.<br/> <br/>It also lacks sharpness and clarity.<br/> <br/>Next time use a tripod or other way to steady the camera, perhaps get a little lower down and concentrate on one are to focus on.</td>', 'This image suffers from lack of clear point of focus.  The viewer has no real idea which part of the image you want our eyes to settle on first, no clear ''point'' of focus. It also lacks sharpness and clarity. Next time use a tripod or other way to steady the camera, perhaps get a little lower down and concentrate on one are to focus on.', '2007-10-04 19:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142059, 594045, 64670, '<td valign="top">Just BEAUTIFUL, I do feel like I''ve seen this image before though, maybe in the B&amp;W side challenge?</td>', 'Just BEAUTIFUL, I do feel like I''ve seen this image before though, maybe in the B&W side challenge?', '2007-10-04 19:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142064, 593977, 64670, '<td valign="top">Super location, love a good wreck.  I think you might have been trying to portray more than you did.  With two clear subjects in the image, the house and the tree, I think is distracting.  The tree strands out more than the house, which I think should have been the bigger focus.  <br/> <br/>I''m wondering how you''d feel about the image if you cropped about 1/4 of the left and right - the tree would still be in the image, but not all of it and we could concentrate our eyes on the buidling and the light coming through the clouds.</td>', 'Super location, love a good wreck.  I think you might have been trying to portray more than you did.  With two clear subjects in the image, the house and the tree, I think is distracting.  The tree strands out more than the house, which I think should have been the bigger focus.   I''m wondering how you''d feel about the image if you cropped about 1/4 of the left and right - the tree would still be in the image, but not all of it and we could concentrate our eyes on the buidling and the light coming through the clouds.', '2007-10-04 19:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142065, 593861, 64670, '<td valign="top">The imgae is a bit flat, you may have missed the best of the light.</td>', 'The imgae is a bit flat, you may have missed the best of the light.', '2007-10-04 19:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142069, 593623, 64670, '<td valign="top">WOW - this is wonderful, the closeness and protective arm and just AMAZING - the shade is a little (and I mean ''little'') offputting, but EXCEPTIONAL moment that deserved such a clear capture.</td>', 'WOW - this is wonderful, the closeness and protective arm and just AMAZING - the shade is a little (and I mean ''little'') offputting, but EXCEPTIONAL moment that deserved such a clear capture.', '2007-10-04 19:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142071, 593942, 64670, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clear which is good, but the frame is too large and makes the bird look ''caged in''.</td>', 'Crisp and clear which is good, but the frame is too large and makes the bird look ''caged in''.', '2007-10-04 19:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142073, 590340, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours.  this image lacks crispness which is a shame.</td>', 'Lovely colours.  this image lacks crispness which is a shame.', '2007-10-04 19:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142076, 589364, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great locations.  Of course the lighting can''t be helped, but stronger contrast may have bumped the detail in the image.  Not sure what your photoprocessing skills and availability are, but if you have photoshop then I''d have worked at dodging and burning to reduce some highlights and bring out some details lost in the shadows.</td>', 'Great locations.  Of course the lighting can''t be helped, but stronger contrast may have bumped the detail in the image.  Not sure what your photoprocessing skills and availability are, but if you have photoshop then I''d have worked at dodging and burning to reduce some highlights and bring out some details lost in the shadows.', '2007-10-04 19:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142077, 592571, 64670, '<td valign="top">This looks metallic - amazing.  Beautiful swirls indeed.<br/> <br/>I am distracted by the lack of ability to see the faces.</td>', 'This looks metallic - amazing.  Beautiful swirls indeed. I am distracted by the lack of ability to see the faces.', '2007-10-04 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142079, 592392, 64670, '<td valign="top">Lovely animal, the colours are beatiful.  I would have been tempted to ''pimp those eyes'' which I think would have strengtened the image.</td>', 'Lovely animal, the colours are beatiful.  I would have been tempted to ''pimp those eyes'' which I think would have strengtened the image.', '2007-10-04 19:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142083, 593569, 64670, '<td valign="top">Cool location, love the grasses etc.  Unfortunately the building is dwarfed by the perspective you''ve chosen.  a lower point of view and cropping the backgroun horizontally at least would have been beneificial.  Also a bit of dodging on the front of the building would have shown us the detail.</td>', 'Cool location, love the grasses etc.  Unfortunately the building is dwarfed by the perspective you''ve chosen.  a lower point of view and cropping the backgroun horizontally at least would have been beneificial.  Also a bit of dodging on the front of the building would have shown us the detail.', '2007-10-04 19:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
