(4142090, 593606, 64670, '<td valign="top">Pretty location.  The position of the sun means this image is tough to make work well.<br/> <br/>In addition a tripod or some firm rest for your camera was needed for clarity.   Too much sky, even though pretty blue, just lacks interest for no clouds or contrast.  <br/> <br/>Compositionally there is no real point of focus to draw out eyes too.</td>', 'Pretty location.  The position of the sun means this image is tough to make work well. In addition a tripod or some firm rest for your camera was needed for clarity.   Too much sky, even though pretty blue, just lacks interest for no clouds or contrast.   Compositionally there is no real point of focus to draw out eyes too.', '2007-10-04 19:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
