(4142095, 593733, 64670, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W is great.  The image lack the WOW factor.  The models hands have the most light and they look strained and uncomfortable.</td>', 'The B&W is great.  The image lack the WOW factor.  The models hands have the most light and they look strained and uncomfortable.', '2007-10-04 19:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
