(4142102, 586679, 64670, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking the plastic wrap is a processing treatment, I''ve not seen it before and don''t enjoy what it''s done to this flower.</td>', 'I''m thinking the plastic wrap is a processing treatment, I''ve not seen it before and don''t enjoy what it''s done to this flower.', '2007-10-04 19:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142113, 590480, 64670, '<td valign="top">I feel you''ve used the excessive framing to try and detract from the clarity of the bird.<br/> <br/>Clearly you''ve done very well to get this image, but it lacks in post processing to ''bring it off'' the page.  The frames really are ''too much'' and have dwarfed your subject.<br/> <br/>Contrast, maybe Shadow/Highlights and then a REALLY GOOD go at High Pass sharpening.<br/>I would have concentrated on the bird, worked levels, burned the eye and around the body (thinly) to make it POP.</td>', 'I feel you''ve used the excessive framing to try and detract from the clarity of the bird. Clearly you''ve done very well to get this image, but it lacks in post processing to ''bring it off'' the page.  The frames really are ''too much'' and have dwarfed your subject. Contrast, maybe Shadow/Highlights and then a REALLY GOOD go at High Pass sharpening.I would have concentrated on the bird, worked levels, burned the eye and around the body (thinly) to make it POP.', '2007-10-04 19:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142118, 593762, 64670, '<td valign="top">Beautiful location.  the image is very flat.  I''d have played with post processing, perhaps selective colours to bring out details, dodged the tree-top on the right and used High Pass sharpening (or other) to created more depth.</td>', 'Beautiful location.  the image is very flat.  I''d have played with post processing, perhaps selective colours to bring out details, dodged the tree-top on the right and used High Pass sharpening (or other) to created more depth.', '2007-10-04 19:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
