(4142305, 592885, 57882, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I like the muted colors, and the leading lines, and the foggy background, and the ...<br/> <br/>Nice work.</td>', 'Great shot.  I like the muted colors, and the leading lines, and the foggy background, and the ... Nice work.', '2007-10-04 20:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
