(4142316, 593518, 57882, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Great lighting.  Great color. Great composition.  Love the layering effect. One of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Great lighting.  Great color. Great composition.  Love the layering effect. One of my favorites in the challenge.', '2007-10-04 20:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
