(4142365, 593255, 82503, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot, but the hands look weird. At first sight it seemed like there were too many fingers. Maybe a different position would distract less from the face.</td>', 'I like this one a lot, but the hands look weird. At first sight it seemed like there were too many fingers. Maybe a different position would distract less from the face.', '2007-10-04 20:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142368, 592729, 57882, '<td valign="top">Very artistic.  Great command of light.</td>', 'Very artistic.  Great command of light.', '2007-10-04 20:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142371, 593947, 82503, '<td valign="top">Sweet! I like the colors and the pose. Shallow DOF is also great.</td>', 'Sweet! I like the colors and the pose. Shallow DOF is also great.', '2007-10-04 20:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142372, 591886, 63398, '<td valign="top">Oh, what a HOOT!!! Excellent capture, title, and just an all ''round great shot! 8</td>', 'Oh, what a HOOT!!! Excellent capture, title, and just an all ''round great shot! 8', '2007-10-04 20:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142374, 594004, 57882, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I like the symmetry.</td>', 'Nice capture.  I like the symmetry.', '2007-10-04 20:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142375, 591157, 41675, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this was intentional on your part, but I get a spiritual sense from your image as well as family. The sail makes a good cross. The people balance it out and keep it from being overbearing. I like it.</td>', 'I don''t know if this was intentional on your part, but I get a spiritual sense from your image as well as family. The sail makes a good cross. The people balance it out and keep it from being overbearing. I like it.', '2007-10-04 20:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142377, 593731, 57882, '<td valign="top">A little too much noise, but nicely composed.</td>', 'A little too much noise, but nicely composed.', '2007-10-04 20:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142378, 593889, 63398, '<td valign="top">Awesome perspective and I like the B&amp;W for the stark contrast......works well with this old bridge.</td>', 'Awesome perspective and I like the B&W for the stark contrast......works well with this old bridge.', '2007-10-04 20:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142380, 585552, 82503, '<td valign="top">Hehe, fun idea! Like it a lot.</td>', 'Hehe, fun idea! Like it a lot.', '2007-10-04 20:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142383, 594042, 41675, '<td valign="top">Maybe because I''m female, but I''m just not a fan of nudes. Trying to keep that out of my voting... I like the white negative space. The arch of the back is nice. I wonder how this would look if her right arm didn''t "blend in" with the lowerr back.</td>', 'Maybe because I''m female, but I''m just not a fan of nudes. Trying to keep that out of my voting... I like the white negative space. The arch of the back is nice. I wonder how this would look if her right arm didn''t "blend in" with the lowerr back.', '2007-10-04 20:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142386, 594055, 82503, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I like the mood.</td>', 'Great composition. I like the mood.', '2007-10-04 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142387, 592860, 41675, '<td valign="top">Aside from seeing the bottom of the frame (?) in the upper right as being a distracting element, I like the left hand side of your image. Good lighting. I like her downward gaze.</td>', 'Aside from seeing the bottom of the frame (?) in the upper right as being a distracting element, I like the left hand side of your image. Good lighting. I like her downward gaze.', '2007-10-04 20:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142388, 593110, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like the antique flavor that the conversion gives. Very nice image.</td>', 'I like the antique flavor that the conversion gives. Very nice image.', '2007-10-04 20:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142390, 593203, 82503, '<td valign="top">The title made me laugh. I don''t quite get it, but it''s fun!</td>', 'The title made me laugh. I don''t quite get it, but it''s fun!', '2007-10-04 20:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142393, 588551, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very pretty blue colors. For me, I wish it wasn''t quite so close. The flower almost looks... "squished" to me. I do like the contrasting colors at the bottom though - they provide a good balance.</td>', 'Very pretty blue colors. For me, I wish it wasn''t quite so close. The flower almost looks... "squished" to me. I do like the contrasting colors at the bottom though - they provide a good balance.', '2007-10-04 20:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142394, 592759, 57882, '<td valign="top">Unique colors here.   Definite feeling of solitude.</td>', 'Unique colors here.   Definite feeling of solitude.', '2007-10-04 20:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142398, 593435, 41675, '<td valign="top">Overall, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest for long, but I do like the point in your image where the stalks meet the water and the reflections begin.</td>', 'Overall, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest for long, but I do like the point in your image where the stalks meet the water and the reflections begin.', '2007-10-04 20:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142399, 590376, 74821, '<td valign="top">Love the right 2/3.  Not so crazy about the left 1/3.</td>', 'Love the right 2/3.  Not so crazy about the left 1/3.', '2007-10-04 20:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142400, 587634, 57882, '<td valign="top">Crisp shot.  Well exposed.</td>', 'Crisp shot.  Well exposed.', '2007-10-04 20:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142401, 593807, 63398, '<td valign="top">I love the contrat of the beautiful light and colors against the remnants of the dead trees.</td>', 'I love the contrat of the beautiful light and colors against the remnants of the dead trees.', '2007-10-04 21:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142405, 593282, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your image. Tthe white space, the composition, the lighting and the t-shirt graphic adds a point of interest too.</td>', 'I like your image. Tthe white space, the composition, the lighting and the t-shirt graphic adds a point of interest too.', '2007-10-04 21:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142406, 582840, 57882, '<td valign="top">Great look captured here.  Nice lighting and mix of detail and softness.</td>', 'Great look captured here.  Nice lighting and mix of detail and softness.', '2007-10-04 21:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142411, 593714, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very nice flower shot. I really like the color contrast between the flowers and the sky. In some ways, that foreground flower looks so crisp it seems surreal.</td>', 'Very nice flower shot. I really like the color contrast between the flowers and the sky. In some ways, that foreground flower looks so crisp it seems surreal.', '2007-10-04 21:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142413, 593487, 63398, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W was a good choice for this scene. The soft focus adds to it nicely as well.</td>', 'B&W was a good choice for this scene. The soft focus adds to it nicely as well.', '2007-10-04 21:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142414, 592138, 57882, '<td valign="top">The water drops really make this shot interesting.  I think a closup of the walrus would be an interesting alternate shot.</td>', 'The water drops really make this shot interesting.  I think a closup of the walrus would be an interesting alternate shot.', '2007-10-04 21:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142417, 592301, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful, beautiful face to photograph. For me, had there been a bit more light or maybe a bit more color contrast/saturation, I would have scored this another point higher.</td>', 'What a wonderful, beautiful face to photograph. For me, had there been a bit more light or maybe a bit more color contrast/saturation, I would have scored this another point higher.', '2007-10-04 21:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142419, 593456, 63398, '<td valign="top">Glorious colors and breathtaking view!</td>', 'Glorious colors and breathtaking view!', '2007-10-04 21:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142421, 593971, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish there was another element in your image to add interest: be it a person, some kind of farming equipment, or an old tractor or car. I do like the color of the sky though.</td>', 'For me, I wish there was another element in your image to add interest: be it a person, some kind of farming equipment, or an old tractor or car. I do like the color of the sky though.', '2007-10-04 21:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142422, 593627, 41675, '<td valign="top">To me, this is a good, solid landscape. Nice composition, the fog is kind of cool. I do wonder what this shot looks like at other times during the day.</td>', 'To me, this is a good, solid landscape. Nice composition, the fog is kind of cool. I do wonder what this shot looks like at other times during the day.', '2007-10-04 21:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142423, 593389, 63398, '<td valign="top">I''m having a little trouble sorting this in my mind, but it is an interesting image.</td>', 'I''m having a little trouble sorting this in my mind, but it is an interesting image.', '2007-10-04 21:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142426, 593976, 63398, '<td valign="top">Terrific macro! Love the detail and colors in this. Ugly little thing!</td>', 'Terrific macro! Love the detail and colors in this. Ugly little thing!', '2007-10-04 21:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142429, 593909, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how you did this - it will be interesting to find out. I like it alot. The clouds on the right blending into the darker ones on the left. In some ways, the light on the lighthouse itself almost appears artificial to me. Also, if I look at it in a certain way, it makes me think the structures are actually plastic miniatures because of the lighting.</td>', 'I''m not sure how you did this - it will be interesting to find out. I like it alot. The clouds on the right blending into the darker ones on the left. In some ways, the light on the lighthouse itself almost appears artificial to me. Also, if I look at it in a certain way, it makes me think the structures are actually plastic miniatures because of the lighting.', '2007-10-04 21:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142433, 591620, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and idea. I like her and the light in the box. All her treasures are a bit distracting. I wonder how the same would look if she just had a teddy bear or some other stuffed animal. Just one objectt so as not to distract the viewer.</td>', 'I like the angle and idea. I like her and the light in the box. All her treasures are a bit distracting. I wonder how the same would look if she just had a teddy bear or some other stuffed animal. Just one objectt so as not to distract the viewer.', '2007-10-04 21:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142435, 593468, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice, professional looking hummingbird photo. The detail on the feathers is great. Very well done.</td>', 'Nice, professional looking hummingbird photo. The detail on the feathers is great. Very well done.', '2007-10-04 21:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142436, 593633, 63398, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot capturing the vastness and desolation. 7</td>', 'Awesome shot capturing the vastness and desolation. 7', '2007-10-04 21:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142437, 589371, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting structure. I find the bit of red building and tree/bush on the left detracts from the building for me.</td>', 'Interesting structure. I find the bit of red building and tree/bush on the left detracts from the building for me.', '2007-10-04 21:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142439, 593899, 63398, '<td valign="top">Lovely......great processing.</td>', 'Lovely......great processing.', '2007-10-04 21:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142440, 593809, 41675, '<td valign="top">A great image of daily life. I like the vibrant colors and composition.</td>', 'A great image of daily life. I like the vibrant colors and composition.', '2007-10-04 21:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142442, 592674, 63398, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!!! Great visual assault! 8</td>', 'Outstanding!!! Great visual assault! 8', '2007-10-04 21:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
