(4142500, 593580, 61012, '<td valign="top">Quite nice. Perhaps the highlights could be darkened a bit but that could be my monitor.</td>', 'Quite nice. Perhaps the highlights could be darkened a bit but that could be my monitor.', '2007-10-04 21:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
