(4144404, 593184, 68586, '<td valign="top">I do like Nuthatches - such lovely colours on them.<br/> <br/>I like the composition here, but there is obviously an issue with the picture being ''burnt out'' just below his chin. Hard to tell how recoverable it is in post processing, but without that issue thsi would have been even better.</td>', 'I do like Nuthatches - such lovely colours on them. I like the composition here, but there is obviously an issue with the picture being ''burnt out'' just below his chin. Hard to tell how recoverable it is in post processing, but without that issue thsi would have been even better.', '2007-10-05 14:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144407, 592318, 68586, '<td valign="top">Attractive girl and nice lighting - but she just looks too crammed in to me, and the sliver of black on the left is a distraction.<br/> <br/>I''m sure you could get many other very nice shots with her though - and probably already have.  :-  )</td>', 'Attractive girl and nice lighting - but she just looks too crammed in to me, and the sliver of black on the left is a distraction. I''m sure you could get many other very nice shots with her though - and probably already have.  :-  )', '2007-10-05 14:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
