(4144613, 585397, 2612, '<td valign="top">I like this portrait, it grabbed my attention immediately. One constructive comment, and it''s just my opinion, but may a little more contrast within the tonal range across her face. There is great depth to her hair and eyes and a little more shadow in her face would support that depth even better.<br/> <br/>Thanks for sharing!</td>', 'I like this portrait, it grabbed my attention immediately. One constructive comment, and it''s just my opinion, but may a little more contrast within the tonal range across her face. There is great depth to her hair and eyes and a little more shadow in her face would support that depth even better. Thanks for sharing!', '2007-10-05 14:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
