(4144669, 591886, 82088, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is such a cool capture!  I love your title too.  The colors are amazing here, I especially love the softness of the water.  10 and a fave.</td>', 'Wow, this is such a cool capture!  I love your title too.  The colors are amazing here, I especially love the softness of the water.  10 and a fave.', '2007-10-05 15:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144671, 593050, 82088, '<td valign="top">She looks nervous, which is to be expected since she is probably due really soon.  I wished the background were a different color, but overall, I really like this.</td>', 'She looks nervous, which is to be expected since she is probably due really soon.  I wished the background were a different color, but overall, I really like this.', '2007-10-05 15:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144673, 591901, 82088, '<td valign="top">This photo looks like it came straight out of a horror movie.  I love it!</td>', 'This photo looks like it came straight out of a horror movie.  I love it!', '2007-10-05 15:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144675, 591620, 82088, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective here, but I wished the box ink cartridge box and warppers were not in the photo.</td>', 'I really like the perspective here, but I wished the box ink cartridge box and warppers were not in the photo.', '2007-10-05 15:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144677, 592266, 62318, '<td valign="top">Nice colors tones. The cloud in the top left balances out the figures in the right. The actual sun in the sunset is quite minor, but nice nonetheless.</td>', 'Nice colors tones. The cloud in the top left balances out the figures in the right. The actual sun in the sunset is quite minor, but nice nonetheless.', '2007-10-05 15:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144680, 581734, 62318, '<td valign="top">Funny shot. Love the expression of the little kid in the front and the guy on the left.</td>', 'Funny shot. Love the expression of the little kid in the front and the guy on the left.', '2007-10-05 15:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144684, 593894, 62318, '<td valign="top">Cute walking picture. The couple would love this shot.</td>', 'Cute walking picture. The couple would love this shot.', '2007-10-05 15:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144688, 593177, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very nicely poised portrait. The texture of the bark is incredible and I like the use of the fisheye.</td>', 'Very nicely poised portrait. The texture of the bark is incredible and I like the use of the fisheye.', '2007-10-05 15:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144694, 585397, 82088, '<td valign="top">I don''t know much about portraits, so take all of my critiques as personal preference and nothing more than that.  The reflection in her eyes (the ring of light) is distracting to me, and her shoulders seem awkward to me.  I really like the lighting, and the background, and the intense look on her face.</td>', 'I don''t know much about portraits, so take all of my critiques as personal preference and nothing more than that.  The reflection in her eyes (the ring of light) is distracting to me, and her shoulders seem awkward to me.  I really like the lighting, and the background, and the intense look on her face.', '2007-10-05 15:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144697, 587890, 73250, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, this is not flattering for this beautiful woman. The light is really harsh..it shows every pore in her skin. And a woman, I can tell you I try my best to hide those! The reflection on her teeth does nothing for her either.</td>', 'I''m sorry, this is not flattering for this beautiful woman. The light is really harsh..it shows every pore in her skin. And a woman, I can tell you I try my best to hide those! The reflection on her teeth does nothing for her either.', '2007-10-05 15:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144698, 584617, 73250, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and very unique pose. I like it.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and very unique pose. I like it.', '2007-10-05 15:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144699, 594022, 82088, '<td valign="top">This is really pretty.  I love the sunbursts on the rock, it makes it look as though the sun is in front of the rock, instead of behind it.  Beautiful colors and tranquility in this photo.</td>', 'This is really pretty.  I love the sunbursts on the rock, it makes it look as though the sun is in front of the rock, instead of behind it.  Beautiful colors and tranquility in this photo.', '2007-10-05 15:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144702, 592111, 82088, '<td valign="top">Ahh..covered in pollen, it took me a second to figure that out.  I like how you caught him flying away from the flower, and I really like the blue background, it really makes the yellows in this "pop".</td>', 'Ahh..covered in pollen, it took me a second to figure that out.  I like how you caught him flying away from the flower, and I really like the blue background, it really makes the yellows in this "pop".', '2007-10-05 15:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144705, 591925, 81852, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition, but the colors just don''t grab me and it also doesn''t appear very sharp.</td>', 'I really like the composition, but the colors just don''t grab me and it also doesn''t appear very sharp.', '2007-10-05 15:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144710, 594060, 82088, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool earthy kind of picture.  I wished the front of the board could not be seen, but other than that, great job.</td>', 'This is a really cool earthy kind of picture.  I wished the front of the board could not be seen, but other than that, great job.', '2007-10-05 15:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144711, 593610, 81852, '<td valign="top">I like what you arer doing with the composition. The color are what really threw me off. I think maybe less saturation.</td>', 'I like what you arer doing with the composition. The color are what really threw me off. I think maybe less saturation.', '2007-10-05 15:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144715, 587890, 82088, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of this photo.  I wished that there wasnt so much shine on her face, and also on her tooth, but otherwise, really nice portrait.</td>', 'I like the softness of this photo.  I wished that there wasnt so much shine on her face, and also on her tooth, but otherwise, really nice portrait.', '2007-10-05 15:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144720, 593974, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very nice lines and composition. Tough exposure and I see you tried to fix in post.</td>', 'Very nice lines and composition. Tough exposure and I see you tried to fix in post.', '2007-10-05 15:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144723, 588995, 81852, '<td valign="top">This just looks overexposed. I don''t know if you did it on purpose or not. I do like the way her eye grabs my attention.</td>', 'This just looks overexposed. I don''t know if you did it on purpose or not. I do like the way her eye grabs my attention.', '2007-10-05 15:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144730, 593456, 81852, '<td valign="top">Just too red. I would have enjoyed it much more without all the red.</td>', 'Just too red. I would have enjoyed it much more without all the red.', '2007-10-05 15:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144733, 594022, 62318, '<td valign="top">Wonderful moment you have caught with the sun in the crack. Some slight dithering in the sky, but pretty minor. Love picture.</td>', 'Wonderful moment you have caught with the sun in the crack. Some slight dithering in the sky, but pretty minor. Love picture.', '2007-10-05 15:33:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4144750, 592748, 81852, '<td valign="top">This isn''t focused and I wouldn''t knowwhat this was about if not for the title.</td>', 'This isn''t focused and I wouldn''t knowwhat this was about if not for the title.', '2007-10-05 15:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144751, 593472, 81852, '<td valign="top">Why so much blur?</td>', 'Why so much blur?', '2007-10-05 15:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144755, 593703, 81852, '<td valign="top">The sky is blue. Too blue. I can''t really enjoy the balloons because of it.</td>', 'The sky is blue. Too blue. I can''t really enjoy the balloons because of it.', '2007-10-05 15:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144759, 583708, 81852, '<td valign="top">Maybe croping in closer on the three cows and making the colors brighter would be helpfull here.</td>', 'Maybe croping in closer on the three cows and making the colors brighter would be helpfull here.', '2007-10-05 15:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144765, 590758, 81852, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t tell if this was a mist in the pathway or if it was an effect in editing. Nothing really grabbed me about this one.</td>', 'I couldn''t tell if this was a mist in the pathway or if it was an effect in editing. Nothing really grabbed me about this one.', '2007-10-05 15:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144771, 589938, 81852, '<td valign="top">I get what you were doing, but the detail just isn''t there and the background is kind of a distraction.</td>', 'I get what you were doing, but the detail just isn''t there and the background is kind of a distraction.', '2007-10-05 15:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144776, 593888, 81852, '<td valign="top">There really was nothing in the photo as a main focal point. Just felt flat to me.</td>', 'There really was nothing in the photo as a main focal point. Just felt flat to me.', '2007-10-05 15:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144778, 593461, 81852, '<td valign="top">I just din''t find anything in this that made me want to keep looking at it. The one positive is that it looks like the family had a lot of fun.</td>', 'I just din''t find anything in this that made me want to keep looking at it. The one positive is that it looks like the family had a lot of fun.', '2007-10-05 15:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144782, 591869, 81852, '<td valign="top">The colors are flat and it looks out of focus. Would have been much more dramatic if the lion had been looking at the camera. But I know animals are not always cooperative.</td>', 'The colors are flat and it looks out of focus. Would have been much more dramatic if the lion had been looking at the camera. But I know animals are not always cooperative.', '2007-10-05 15:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144784, 593972, 81852, '<td valign="top">This just confused me. Can''t tell what I''m looking at.</td>', 'This just confused me. Can''t tell what I''m looking at.', '2007-10-05 15:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144792, 587458, 81852, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the colors. I just didn''t care for the effect.</td>', 'Not sure about the colors. I just didn''t care for the effect.', '2007-10-05 15:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144798, 589684, 81852, '<td valign="top">The shadow behind her makes it look like she is in front of a flat backdrop.I didn''t find it very appealing in general.</td>', 'The shadow behind her makes it look like she is in front of a flat backdrop.I didn''t find it very appealing in general.', '2007-10-05 15:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144804, 593949, 81852, '<td valign="top">What happened to the colors here? I think it would work if the tree was the only thing with visible color. But I see little patches of color all over and it is very distracting.</td>', 'What happened to the colors here? I think it would work if the tree was the only thing with visible color. But I see little patches of color all over and it is very distracting.', '2007-10-05 15:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144810, 587199, 37392, '<td valign="top">i like it, but i think would be better in golden tones</td>', 'i like it, but i think would be better in golden tones', '2007-10-05 15:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144816, 585317, 81852, '<td valign="top">This could be very beautiful. It is so grainy and the colors aren''t great. I didn''t find it appealing.</td>', 'This could be very beautiful. It is so grainy and the colors aren''t great. I didn''t find it appealing.', '2007-10-05 15:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144819, 592846, 81852, '<td valign="top">Wow! The red is really overwhelming. If not for the red, however, there isn''t really anything special going on here.</td>', 'Wow! The red is really overwhelming. If not for the red, however, there isn''t really anything special going on here.', '2007-10-05 15:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144824, 592813, 83313, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.</td>', 'Gorgeous.', '2007-10-05 15:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144825, 589570, 81852, '<td valign="top">Just didn''t really jump out at me.</td>', 'Just didn''t really jump out at me.', '2007-10-05 15:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144828, 593484, 81852, '<td valign="top">It''s so dark that I can''t enjoy the view.</td>', 'It''s so dark that I can''t enjoy the view.', '2007-10-05 15:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144834, 585345, 81852, '<td valign="top">This just made my eyes buggy. The background is really fighting with the texture of the animals coat. Maybe a little blur would help here.</td>', 'This just made my eyes buggy. The background is really fighting with the texture of the animals coat. Maybe a little blur would help here.', '2007-10-05 16:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144835, 592023, 81852, '<td valign="top">This just isn''t as sharp or colorful as it could be. I think maybe it is over exposed.</td>', 'This just isn''t as sharp or colorful as it could be. I think maybe it is over exposed.', '2007-10-05 16:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144836, 593083, 83313, '<td valign="top">The caption makes this humorous. A little more color adjustment might make it standout nicely.</td>', 'The caption makes this humorous. A little more color adjustment might make it standout nicely.', '2007-10-05 16:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144838, 581737, 81852, '<td valign="top">Did not care for the effect here. I was left wanting to see more details on the subject.</td>', 'Did not care for the effect here. I was left wanting to see more details on the subject.', '2007-10-05 16:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144839, 589327, 81852, '<td valign="top">Not in focus.</td>', 'Not in focus.', '2007-10-05 16:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144842, 593461, 83313, '<td valign="top">The subjects of this photo just don''t seem to take up enough of the frame. there is a wide expanse of nothing between  the man and the kite.</td>', 'The subjects of this photo just don''t seem to take up enough of the frame. there is a wide expanse of nothing between  the man and the kite.', '2007-10-05 16:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144845, 594068, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good color, detail and this gal (it IS a female, right?) has some character. Sort of looks like she''s smirking.</td>', 'Very nice. Good color, detail and this gal (it IS a female, right?) has some character. Sort of looks like she''s smirking.', '2007-10-05 16:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144846, 593979, 81852, '<td valign="top">Not quite in focus and a little too bright for my taste.</td>', 'Not quite in focus and a little too bright for my taste.', '2007-10-05 16:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144855, 594044, 81852, '<td valign="top">Two things here that distracted me. The shadow on the birds back and the background is very busy. Maybe some blur of adjust depth of field to make the background less distracting.</td>', 'Two things here that distracted me. The shadow on the birds back and the background is very busy. Maybe some blur of adjust depth of field to make the background less distracting.', '2007-10-05 16:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144858, 586453, 81852, '<td valign="top">Just wasn''t anyting special about this. I like the blur you did, but the subjects look uncomfortable.</td>', 'Just wasn''t anyting special about this. I like the blur you did, but the subjects look uncomfortable.', '2007-10-05 16:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144860, 593321, 81852, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get it. Sorry.</td>', 'I didn''t get it. Sorry.', '2007-10-05 16:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144864, 592070, 81852, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot here! It appears grainy on my screen though and that is what is distracting to me.</td>', 'Nice action shot here! It appears grainy on my screen though and that is what is distracting to me.', '2007-10-05 16:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144870, 586480, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice bold night shot. The compression down to 640 pixels gives it a badly stair-stepped look, though. Perhaps resizing with a different sampling method may have smoothed it out a bit.</td>', 'A nice bold night shot. The compression down to 640 pixels gives it a badly stair-stepped look, though. Perhaps resizing with a different sampling method may have smoothed it out a bit.', '2007-10-05 16:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144875, 593083, 81852, '<td valign="top">This just didn''t really get my attention. The title was cute, the photo just didn''t stand out to me.</td>', 'This just didn''t really get my attention. The title was cute, the photo just didn''t stand out to me.', '2007-10-05 16:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144880, 593355, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, juicy color. Could be a little sharper, but it''s very nicely done.</td>', 'Nice, juicy color. Could be a little sharper, but it''s very nicely done.', '2007-10-05 16:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144884, 592142, 83313, '<td valign="top">An odd angle. Seems distorted, though that may have been the intended effect.</td>', 'An odd angle. Seems distorted, though that may have been the intended effect.', '2007-10-05 16:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144885, 592577, 81852, '<td valign="top">Just didn''t care for it.</td>', 'Just didn''t care for it.', '2007-10-05 16:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144888, 594030, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice look on his face. Ball would have been nice a little closer in from the edge.</td>', 'Nice look on his face. Ball would have been nice a little closer in from the edge.', '2007-10-05 16:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144889, 593924, 81852, '<td valign="top">The focus wasn''t great and there doesn''t seem to be a main focal point.</td>', 'The focus wasn''t great and there doesn''t seem to be a main focal point.', '2007-10-05 16:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144892, 590403, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice view, but the mountain that appears to be the central subject does not stand out well. Too far away, perhaps...</td>', 'Nice view, but the mountain that appears to be the central subject does not stand out well. Too far away, perhaps...', '2007-10-05 16:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144894, 585630, 81852, '<td valign="top">There wasn''t anything contrasting the waterfall to make it really stand out. It just seems to fade into the background.</td>', 'There wasn''t anything contrasting the waterfall to make it really stand out. It just seems to fade into the background.', '2007-10-05 16:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144895, 591641, 81852, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel intensity, I feel dizzy.</td>', 'I don''t feel intensity, I feel dizzy.', '2007-10-05 16:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144917, 593660, 68586, '<td valign="top">I''ll swap places with him if it helps  :-  )<br/> <br/>Very nice lighting and composition.</td>', 'I''ll swap places with him if it helps  :-  ) Very nice lighting and composition.', '2007-10-05 16:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144919, 594049, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and shadows. Perhaps some sharpening may have given it a little more kick, but perhaps not. I''d have to see it both ways.</td>', 'Wonderful color and shadows. Perhaps some sharpening may have given it a little more kick, but perhaps not. I''d have to see it both ways.', '2007-10-05 16:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144923, 592399, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I don''t see much detail in the flowers themselves.</td>', 'Nice, but I don''t see much detail in the flowers themselves.', '2007-10-05 16:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144931, 593869, 83313, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous scenery. The trees peeking up at the bottom draw my eye away from the glacier. Those could probably be legally cloned out as incindental items.</td>', 'Gorgeous scenery. The trees peeking up at the bottom draw my eye away from the glacier. Those could probably be legally cloned out as incindental items.', '2007-10-05 16:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144944, 593385, 81852, '<td valign="top">This wasn''t bad, it just didn''t really stand out to me.</td>', 'This wasn''t bad, it just didn''t really stand out to me.', '2007-10-05 16:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144950, 592976, 81852, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and subject. It just looks very dark. I would like to see it brighter and more vibrant.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and subject. It just looks very dark. I would like to see it brighter and more vibrant.', '2007-10-05 16:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144954, 593856, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot of the Starfighter. I didn''t know these were still in active service. At least it looks like it is in flight, rather than a museum. Any chance of getting a hi res copy of this from you after the challenge?</td>', 'Lovely shot of the Starfighter. I didn''t know these were still in active service. At least it looks like it is in flight, rather than a museum. Any chance of getting a hi res copy of this from you after the challenge?', '2007-10-05 16:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144957, 587189, 81852, '<td valign="top">Not very sharp focus.</td>', 'Not very sharp focus.', '2007-10-05 16:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144960, 593627, 81852, '<td valign="top">It was not an attention grabber to me.</td>', 'It was not an attention grabber to me.', '2007-10-05 16:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144961, 593566, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little busy and dark. my eye does not home in on anything as the main subject.</td>', 'A little busy and dark. my eye does not home in on anything as the main subject.', '2007-10-05 16:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144967, 588551, 83313, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color. I would have liked to see it a little more focused., but this does work.</td>', 'Fantastic color. I would have liked to see it a little more focused., but this does work.', '2007-10-05 16:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144974, 593899, 81852, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, just not the blur. Didn''t stand out to me. Tough category though.</td>', 'I like the photo, just not the blur. Didn''t stand out to me. Tough category though.', '2007-10-05 16:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144977, 593553, 81852, '<td valign="top">The patches of lilght everywhere are distracting as well as the color effect. Otherwise a good photo.</td>', 'The patches of lilght everywhere are distracting as well as the color effect. Otherwise a good photo.', '2007-10-05 16:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144980, 591743, 81852, '<td valign="top">Very dark and not very sharp.</td>', 'Very dark and not very sharp.', '2007-10-05 16:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144985, 590480, 81852, '<td valign="top">The color fell flat. The blue border only makes the color appear more dull.</td>', 'The color fell flat. The blue border only makes the color appear more dull.', '2007-10-05 16:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144988, 593103, 81852, '<td valign="top">Not a sharp focus and terribly interesting.</td>', 'Not a sharp focus and terribly interesting.', '2007-10-05 16:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144990, 593478, 81852, '<td valign="top">I would have enjoyed this more if you had cropped it tighter to eliminate the white wall on the left. Didn''t care for the effect on the photo either.</td>', 'I would have enjoyed this more if you had cropped it tighter to eliminate the white wall on the left. Didn''t care for the effect on the photo either.', '2007-10-05 16:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
