(4145454, 593921, 46177, '<td valign="top">Nice colour yellow, I wish there was a little less of a green tone to the background however.  Good placement of the flower.</td>', 'Nice colour yellow, I wish there was a little less of a green tone to the background however.  Good placement of the flower.', '2007-10-05 19:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145456, 593966, 46177, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition but not enough tones to really stand out, the lighting makes it a little flat.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition but not enough tones to really stand out, the lighting makes it a little flat.', '2007-10-05 19:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145457, 593888, 46177, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene. I wish the colours were a touch more vibrant but thats just a matter of taste.</td>', 'Pretty scene. I wish the colours were a touch more vibrant but thats just a matter of taste.', '2007-10-05 19:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145462, 591567, 29011, '<td valign="top">A good closeup with nice color. The shadows look too dark and there''s a hot spot near the top right.  Working with layers, would tweak the contrast selectivly, by creating a copy of the original , doing the contrast settings there and then erasing away the too dark and too bright spots, then merging the layers and doing some more tweaking. Keep shooting :)</td>', 'A good closeup with nice color. The shadows look too dark and there''s a hot spot near the top right.  Working with layers, would tweak the contrast selectivly, by creating a copy of the original , doing the contrast settings there and then erasing away the too dark and too bright spots, then merging the layers and doing some more tweaking. Keep shooting :)', '2007-10-05 19:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145467, 593612, 29011, '<td valign="top">Cool portrait of this slimey ole chap. Nicely exposed shot with good DOF. I like the centered composition and the details of his eye.</td>', 'Cool portrait of this slimey ole chap. Nicely exposed shot with good DOF. I like the centered composition and the details of his eye.', '2007-10-05 19:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145475, 592074, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great emotion in the face - you can feel his passion.</td>', 'Great emotion in the face - you can feel his passion.', '2007-10-05 19:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145477, 593991, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice softness, but the eyes don''t really connect with the viewer.</td>', 'Nice softness, but the eyes don''t really connect with the viewer.', '2007-10-05 19:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145482, 593492, 66597, '<td valign="top">With just a little more DOF this would be stunning. Unfortunately, the OOF petals on top are a distraction.</td>', 'With just a little more DOF this would be stunning. Unfortunately, the OOF petals on top are a distraction.', '2007-10-05 19:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145484, 590358, 66597, '<td valign="top">Normally I would advocate a closer crop on this, but I like the lines in the rocks and think they enhance the image.</td>', 'Normally I would advocate a closer crop on this, but I like the lines in the rocks and think they enhance the image.', '2007-10-05 19:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145488, 593675, 66597, '<td valign="top">The sky is fabulous - it looks like something taken through a telescope, but the intensity of the stars doesn''t match the amount of light in the foreground.</td>', 'The sky is fabulous - it looks like something taken through a telescope, but the intensity of the stars doesn''t match the amount of light in the foreground.', '2007-10-05 19:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145489, 592860, 58691, '<td valign="top">I do like the tones in this shot, but the bottle tip is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I do like the tones in this shot, but the bottle tip is a bit distracting.', '2007-10-05 19:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145494, 591740, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very interesting side lighting. I''m not sure what to think of the guy in the yellow slicker. He''s an interesting addition, but his slicker is so saturated I think it detracts from the beautiful foliage.</td>', 'Very interesting side lighting. I''m not sure what to think of the guy in the yellow slicker. He''s an interesting addition, but his slicker is so saturated I think it detracts from the beautiful foliage.', '2007-10-05 19:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145495, 593947, 66597, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, rich colors and structure in this.</td>', 'Gorgeous, rich colors and structure in this.', '2007-10-05 20:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145496, 594001, 58691, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shot. Well done.</td>', 'Very dramatic shot. Well done.', '2007-10-05 20:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145498, 593177, 66597, '<td valign="top">Ah, absolutely stunning. Where were you when I got married and ended up with boring and predictable photos? 10 all the way.</td>', 'Ah, absolutely stunning. Where were you when I got married and ended up with boring and predictable photos? 10 all the way.', '2007-10-05 20:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145499, 592392, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice connection in the eyes but something seems slightly off in the color balance here.</td>', 'Nice connection in the eyes but something seems slightly off in the color balance here.', '2007-10-05 20:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145500, 592399, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and simple with nice DOF.</td>', 'Very pretty and simple with nice DOF.', '2007-10-05 20:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145501, 593550, 58691, '<td valign="top">Wow! Nicely done. The crop really gives it a scary feeling.</td>', 'Wow! Nicely done. The crop really gives it a scary feeling.', '2007-10-05 20:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145502, 592114, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the DOF here but not so much the lighting - it feels a little flat with harsh shadows.</td>', 'I really like the DOF here but not so much the lighting - it feels a little flat with harsh shadows.', '2007-10-05 20:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145503, 592306, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great baby photo! Great DOF and connection to the camera.</td>', 'Great baby photo! Great DOF and connection to the camera.', '2007-10-05 20:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145504, 594029, 66597, '<td valign="top">I''m always impressed when people catch dragonflies mid-capture. Wish the background weren''t quite so dark so there was more context to his flight, however.</td>', 'I''m always impressed when people catch dragonflies mid-capture. Wish the background weren''t quite so dark so there was more context to his flight, however.', '2007-10-05 20:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145512, 593703, 58691, '<td valign="top">Was the sky really that bad in the original? Your blue fill doesn''t match the rest of the image and the mask lin is very clear on top of the mountains. It is such a good capture of the ballons, too bad you chose a fill methon instead of a different filter for the sky.</td>', 'Was the sky really that bad in the original? Your blue fill doesn''t match the rest of the image and the mask lin is very clear on top of the mountains. It is such a good capture of the ballons, too bad you chose a fill methon instead of a different filter for the sky.', '2007-10-05 20:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145513, 589743, 57882, '<td valign="top">These birds make great subjects.  You''ve captured a unique look here with the dark background.</td>', 'These birds make great subjects.  You''ve captured a unique look here with the dark background.', '2007-10-05 20:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145516, 592742, 57882, '<td valign="top">I like the warmth of this shot.  Makes me thirsty.</td>', 'I like the warmth of this shot.  Makes me thirsty.', '2007-10-05 20:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145518, 590559, 57882, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, but would have liked it a little closer (tighter).</td>', 'Nicely composed, but would have liked it a little closer (tighter).', '2007-10-05 20:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145519, 593411, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is a well composed (and focused) shot. The heavy background color saturation and the softness of the colors in the foreground (and the smile) are a great contrast. The sunburst is placed nicely as not to interfere with the subject. I hope this scores well.</td>', 'This is a well composed (and focused) shot. The heavy background color saturation and the softness of the colors in the foreground (and the smile) are a great contrast. The sunburst is placed nicely as not to interfere with the subject. I hope this scores well.', '2007-10-05 20:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145521, 590208, 57882, '<td valign="top">Awesome scene, especially the background.  The bushes in the foreground is slightly distracting, but overall the shot is very good.</td>', 'Awesome scene, especially the background.  The bushes in the foreground is slightly distracting, but overall the shot is very good.', '2007-10-05 20:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145524, 593825, 57882, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting.  Looks natural.</td>', 'Fantastic lighting.  Looks natural.', '2007-10-05 20:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145525, 593468, 57882, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in an action shot.</td>', 'Nice detail in an action shot.', '2007-10-05 20:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145527, 591620, 57882, '<td valign="top">Love the POV.  This shot is sooo cool!</td>', 'Love the POV.  This shot is sooo cool!', '2007-10-05 20:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145528, 593703, 57882, '<td valign="top">A bit too much saturation.</td>', 'A bit too much saturation.', '2007-10-05 20:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145532, 584139, 57882, '<td valign="top">Love the detail on the lizard.  Nicely composed as well.  The green in the background takes away a little of the pop of the lizard, though.</td>', 'Love the detail on the lizard.  Nicely composed as well.  The green in the background takes away a little of the pop of the lizard, though.', '2007-10-05 20:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145533, 594084, 57882, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Unique and dramatic.</td>', 'Nicely done. Unique and dramatic.', '2007-10-05 20:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145552, 583587, 23251, '<td valign="top">That''s very nice, I wish the people were either brighter or blackened out.  Nice composition and colours.</td>', 'That''s very nice, I wish the people were either brighter or blackened out.  Nice composition and colours.', '2007-10-05 20:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145558, 593600, 23251, '<td valign="top">No offence but yucky border, not sure I like the reflection I presume of you either.</td>', 'No offence but yucky border, not sure I like the reflection I presume of you either.', '2007-10-05 20:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145561, 593487, 23251, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene but I think the harsh lighting has removed alot of detail that would have been there otherwise.</td>', 'Lovely scene but I think the harsh lighting has removed alot of detail that would have been there otherwise.', '2007-10-05 20:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4145566, 591157, 23251, '<td valign="top">Its a nice scene without any real impact.  Maybe if it showed what they were looking at on the beach in front of them or without the child in the photo.</td>', 'Its a nice scene without any real impact.  Maybe if it showed what they were looking at on the beach in front of them or without the child in the photo.', '2007-10-05 20:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
