(4145573, 591335, 23251, '<td valign="top">Its a nice photo, maybe if you moved around a little bit the real building and the reflected same would have blended.</td>', 'Its a nice photo, maybe if you moved around a little bit the real building and the reflected same would have blended.', '2007-10-05 20:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
