(4145690, 592860, 714, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like the yellow tones here.  Looks like you had a hard time with lighting.  Not quite sure why she is looking down but would have liked maybe a look towards the camera with her head still down.  Would have giving more of a mystery to her.  The bottle is a bother for me too..either the whole bottle or none at all.</td>', 'I really don''t like the yellow tones here.  Looks like you had a hard time with lighting.  Not quite sure why she is looking down but would have liked maybe a look towards the camera with her head still down.  Would have giving more of a mystery to her.  The bottle is a bother for me too..either the whole bottle or none at all.', '2007-10-05 21:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
