(4146018, 593600, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I like the blue and purple colors. Your choice of border doesn''t do much for me visually. the yellow key(?) adds a nice color contrast</td>', 'Interesting image. I like the blue and purple colors. Your choice of border doesn''t do much for me visually. the yellow key(?) adds a nice color contrast', '2007-10-05 22:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146023, 580889, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the color contrasts. Nice, creative entry.</td>', 'I like the color contrasts. Nice, creative entry.', '2007-10-05 22:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146028, 592149, 41675, '<td valign="top">The light through the window causes such a hot spot, my eyes are consistently being drawn to that other, when I really prefer the right hand side of your image. tthe light burst colors are interesting though. Glad it was validated for you.</td>', 'The light through the window causes such a hot spot, my eyes are consistently being drawn to that other, when I really prefer the right hand side of your image. tthe light burst colors are interesting though. Glad it was validated for you.', '2007-10-05 23:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146031, 593936, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, she looks either pissed or annoyed. Lol. The sunlight seems a little harsh on her hair, but I like the color and composition.</td>', 'Hmmm, she looks either pissed or annoyed. Lol. The sunlight seems a little harsh on her hair, but I like the color and composition.', '2007-10-05 23:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146034, 591962, 41675, '<td valign="top">If it hadn''t been for the dark, shadowy area in the lower right I would have scored this a point higher. I really like the composition and colors otherwise.</td>', 'If it hadn''t been for the dark, shadowy area in the lower right I would have scored this a point higher. I really like the composition and colors otherwise.', '2007-10-05 23:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146040, 581737, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this is way too washed out. It looks more like an illustration rather than a photograph. I do wonder what the original looks like.</td>', 'For me, this is way too washed out. It looks more like an illustration rather than a photograph. I do wonder what the original looks like.', '2007-10-05 23:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146042, 593819, 74979, '<td valign="top">strikes me as very emotive, the image with the title well done!</td>', 'strikes me as very emotive, the image with the title well done!', '2007-10-05 23:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146043, 593731, 74979, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2007-10-05 23:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146055, 594082, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice b&amp;W landscape. I like the misty/fog.</td>', 'Nice b&W landscape. I like the misty/fog.', '2007-10-05 23:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146058, 593934, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting. Good color contrast as well. If there was just a bit more sharpness, I would have scored this a point higher.</td>', 'I like the lighting. Good color contrast as well. If there was just a bit more sharpness, I would have scored this a point higher.', '2007-10-05 23:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146062, 592496, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfully appealing still life. Great colors and composition. I like the shadows on the wall as well. One of my top ten favorites so far. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What a wonderfully appealing still life. Great colors and composition. I like the shadows on the wall as well. One of my top ten favorites so far. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-05 23:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146066, 589205, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the fish eye with this landscape...at least I think you used a fish eye lens (?). Good color contrast between rocks and sky.</td>', 'I like the fish eye with this landscape...at least I think you used a fish eye lens (?). Good color contrast between rocks and sky.', '2007-10-05 23:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146069, 590480, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, you have chosen such a busy, multi-layered border it really takes away from the image itself :( With such a border I feel like you''ve taken a photo of a photo on a wall.</td>', 'For me, you have chosen such a busy, multi-layered border it really takes away from the image itself :( With such a border I feel like you''ve taken a photo of a photo on a wall.', '2007-10-05 23:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146071, 580764, 41675, '<td valign="top">Though I don''t have arachnaphobia, I''m not a big spider fan. That aside however, this is a good closeup shot. I like the lighting.</td>', 'Though I don''t have arachnaphobia, I''m not a big spider fan. That aside however, this is a good closeup shot. I like the lighting.', '2007-10-05 23:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146074, 594084, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your treatment of this image is intriguing. With the clouds over the moon, I keep thinking there should be a werewolf lurking somewhere down below. Lol. Good composition. the more I look at your image, the more I like it. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your treatment of this image is intriguing. With the clouds over the moon, I keep thinking there should be a werewolf lurking somewhere down below. Lol. Good composition. the more I look at your image, the more I like it. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-05 23:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
