(4146177, 593203, 75034, '<td valign="top">If you were looking for comments then this is a way to get them. This image is disturbing in so many ways not to mention a total slap in the face to women and men who find these types of photos not fit for print. <br/>I will hazard a guess that I''m not the first to be offended by your photo and I''m sure that I will not be the last.<br/>Some people may applaud you for being brave enough to post something so controversial I however find it sick and twisted.</td>', 'If you were looking for comments then this is a way to get them. This image is disturbing in so many ways not to mention a total slap in the face to women and men who find these types of photos not fit for print. I will hazard a guess that I''m not the first to be offended by your photo and I''m sure that I will not be the last.Some people may applaud you for being brave enough to post something so controversial I however find it sick and twisted.', '2007-10-05 23:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146273, 590603, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is just great. Very intricate patterns of gridwork, and they play nice with the b/w.</td>', 'This is just great. Very intricate patterns of gridwork, and they play nice with the b/w.', '2007-10-06 00:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
