(4146862, 593988, 75034, '<td valign="top">Is that an Australian shepherd? They are so loyal and a wonderful dog to have. Our Ausi lived to be nearly 17 and it broke our hearts to put him down.<br/> <br/>I like the composition and the silhouetted rocks and the range of levels from flat to the hill tops hold ones attention. The mist of the morning works well here it gives the shot a warm feel.<br/> <br/>Nice photo.</td>', 'Is that an Australian shepherd? They are so loyal and a wonderful dog to have. Our Ausi lived to be nearly 17 and it broke our hearts to put him down. I like the composition and the silhouetted rocks and the range of levels from flat to the hill tops hold ones attention. The mist of the morning works well here it gives the shot a warm feel. Nice photo.', '2007-10-06 10:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
