(4147727, 591653, 41675, '<td valign="top">Poor car looks like its been through a lot. The color seems a little on the blue side to me, but there''s lots to look at in your image: lights, writing, grill, etc. It definitely keeps the eyes busy.</td>', 'Poor car looks like its been through a lot. The color seems a little on the blue side to me, but there''s lots to look at in your image: lights, writing, grill, etc. It definitely keeps the eyes busy.', '2007-10-06 19:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4147728, 584862, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a neat shot! I like all the vivid primary colors. One of those images where you can easily make a story from it. Best of luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'What a neat shot! I like all the vivid primary colors. One of those images where you can easily make a story from it. Best of luck in the challenge. 10', '2007-10-06 19:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4147730, 593496, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good action shot! I like the contrast of horse &amp; foliage. The surrounding green keeps my eyes nicely focused on your subjects.</td>', 'Good action shot! I like the contrast of horse & foliage. The surrounding green keeps my eyes nicely focused on your subjects.', '2007-10-06 19:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4147733, 593203, 41675, '<td valign="top">Weird and creepy, yet creative. I''m not sure I like it from the creepy factor, but the lighting is good as well as the tonal values. He needs a different shirt though - that went out in the 70''s. Lol</td>', 'Weird and creepy, yet creative. I''m not sure I like it from the creepy factor, but the lighting is good as well as the tonal values. He needs a different shirt though - that went out in the 70''s. Lol', '2007-10-06 19:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4147734, 590358, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. The soft background keeps my eyes focused on the bug.</td>', 'Nice macro. The soft background keeps my eyes focused on the bug.', '2007-10-06 19:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4147738, 593351, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Its somewhat of an optical illustion - at least to me. I feel I''m looking down, then I don''t. Fun photo to look at. I like the black &amp; white. I think its effective with your image.</td>', 'Very cool. Its somewhat of an optical illustion - at least to me. I feel I''m looking down, then I don''t. Fun photo to look at. I like the black & white. I think its effective with your image.', '2007-10-06 19:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4147739, 591459, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me this is heavily over sharpened. I wish there was less contrast too. I really like their expressions and your composition though.</td>', 'For me this is heavily over sharpened. I wish there was less contrast too. I really like their expressions and your composition though.', '2007-10-06 19:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4147741, 593762, 41675, '<td valign="top">Pretty landscape. This would make a nice postcard. I like the colors, composition and lighting. Good shot!</td>', 'Pretty landscape. This would make a nice postcard. I like the colors, composition and lighting. Good shot!', '2007-10-06 19:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4147742, 593679, 41675, '<td valign="top">Oh how I wish the other woman didn''t have her head turned away. I like the composition and lighting.</td>', 'Oh how I wish the other woman didn''t have her head turned away. I like the composition and lighting.', '2007-10-06 19:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4147743, 593317, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice cityscape. I like the sky and the angle of your image - how the buildings "lead" my eyes into your photo. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice cityscape. I like the sky and the angle of your image - how the buildings "lead" my eyes into your photo. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-06 19:57:41.000000', NULL, 1);
