(4148042, 593452, 10867, '<td valign="top">The portrait is pleasing, but the wide, white border with the thin brown border around it is very distracting.  Also, the merger of the model''s sleeve with the frame on our left should really have been avoided.</td>', 'The portrait is pleasing, but the wide, white border with the thin brown border around it is very distracting.  Also, the merger of the model''s sleeve with the frame on our left should really have been avoided.', '2007-10-06 22:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
