(4148071, 583581, 80904, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, but I feel that it would have been stronger if the subject wasnt in the middle. Great contrast and sky.</td>', 'I love this shot, but I feel that it would have been stronger if the subject wasnt in the middle. Great contrast and sky.', '2007-10-06 23:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
