(4148217, 592400, 67697, '<td valign="top">Sweet photo.  I wish his or her face were a little sharper.  That would help me see the expression stand out more in the photo.</td>', 'Sweet photo.  I wish his or her face were a little sharper.  That would help me see the expression stand out more in the photo.', '2007-10-07 00:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
