(4148227, 593979, 79021, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, I just would have liked to see the subject sunflower to be sharper and maybe some processing to make it stand out more (maybe add some contrast)</td>', 'I like the idea, I just would have liked to see the subject sunflower to be sharper and maybe some processing to make it stand out more (maybe add some contrast)', '2007-10-07 00:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
