(4148236, 583581, 79021, '<td valign="top">I remember this shot after spending some time on the "dave hill" thread on strobist.  Odd but captivating shot.  I like the one of the guy with the sunglasses better though...7</td>', 'I remember this shot after spending some time on the "dave hill" thread on strobist.  Odd but captivating shot.  I like the one of the guy with the sunglasses better though...7', '2007-10-07 00:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
