(4148301, 592093, 41675, '<td valign="top">The expression you captured makes me smile. The light is a little strong, but otherwise I like the composition and the black &amp; white is effective.</td>', 'The expression you captured makes me smile. The light is a little strong, but otherwise I like the composition and the black & white is effective.', '2007-10-07 00:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148302, 591962, 79021, '<td valign="top">Nice shot although another boarder or no boarder at all would add to the effect.  The whiteness of the boarder takes away from the clouds.</td>', 'Nice shot although another boarder or no boarder at all would add to the effect.  The whiteness of the boarder takes away from the clouds.', '2007-10-07 00:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148304, 593295, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I do wish all of the gentleman''s head was in the photo. I like your use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'For me, I do wish all of the gentleman''s head was in the photo. I like your use of the rule of thirds.', '2007-10-07 00:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148305, 589327, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, your triple border almost makes it look like you took a photo of a photo on a wall. The outer thick black border detracts to em. Your image itself seems a little out of focus. Too bad you couldn''t have gotten closer.</td>', 'For me, your triple border almost makes it look like you took a photo of a photo on a wall. The outer thick black border detracts to em. Your image itself seems a little out of focus. Too bad you couldn''t have gotten closer.', '2007-10-07 01:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148309, 593999, 41675, '<td valign="top">Umm..yup, that''s a dragonfly :-) Good closeup, nice detail</td>', 'Umm..yup, that''s a dragonfly :-) Good closeup, nice detail', '2007-10-07 01:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148310, 582840, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Good composition and lighting. Her face and hair seem soft, then the black lace seems a harsh contrast to me.</td>', 'Nice portrait. Good composition and lighting. Her face and hair seem soft, then the black lace seems a harsh contrast to me.', '2007-10-07 01:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148311, 593898, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. I really like the lighting - it''s perfect. The blurred background helps keep my focus on the Egret. Well done and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. I really like the lighting - it''s perfect. The blurred background helps keep my focus on the Egret. Well done and good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-07 01:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148314, 591371, 41675, '<td valign="top">First reacti0n: EWWW!<br/> <br/>Photo reaction: Good detail on the ugly critter and I''m curious what it''s landed on. Good lighting as well. 8<br/> <br/>Second reaction: Still...ewww!!!</td>', 'First reacti0n: EWWW! Photo reaction: Good detail on the ugly critter and I''m curious what it''s landed on. Good lighting as well. 8 Second reaction: Still...ewww!!!', '2007-10-07 01:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148319, 592183, 79021, '<td valign="top">Either the drum set is blurry or the lighting is falling weird on it</td>', 'Either the drum set is blurry or the lighting is falling weird on it', '2007-10-07 01:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148322, 593675, 41675, '<td valign="top">The strong lighting on the building detracts from the image - to me. I really like the starfield though - very cool to look at.</td>', 'The strong lighting on the building detracts from the image - to me. I really like the starfield though - very cool to look at.', '2007-10-07 01:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148325, 593942, 79021, '<td valign="top">The boarder is a bit excessive but I like the crop</td>', 'The boarder is a bit excessive but I like the crop', '2007-10-07 01:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148326, 588773, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and colors. The lighting on the left is maybe just a wee bit too bright for my personal tastes, but otherwise a nice change of pace from all the birds, insects and landscapes.</td>', 'I like the angle and colors. The lighting on the left is maybe just a wee bit too bright for my personal tastes, but otherwise a nice change of pace from all the birds, insects and landscapes.', '2007-10-07 01:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148330, 591901, 79021, '<td valign="top">The blue tones are very well done</td>', 'The blue tones are very well done', '2007-10-07 01:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148336, 592761, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - every woman can sympathize. I like your shot. Nice to see something diffferent from head shots, animals and landscapes.</td>', 'Lol - every woman can sympathize. I like your shot. Nice to see something diffferent from head shots, animals and landscapes.', '2007-10-07 01:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148340, 592520, 79021, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the bartender but I would have liked the patron to be more in focus (shorter shutter)</td>', 'Great expression on the bartender but I would have liked the patron to be more in focus (shorter shutter)', '2007-10-07 01:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148341, 593283, 41675, '<td valign="top">I love the intense look you captured in its eyes. Good off centered composition and lighting. Hope little red riding hood wasn''t nearby. ;-)</td>', 'I love the intense look you captured in its eyes. Good off centered composition and lighting. Hope little red riding hood wasn''t nearby. ;-)', '2007-10-07 01:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148347, 592134, 79021, '<td valign="top">The concept is a bit odd...</td>', 'The concept is a bit odd...', '2007-10-07 01:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148348, 593889, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice angle of the bridge. I like the use of black &amp; white for your image. Good architectural photo.</td>', 'Nice angle of the bridge. I like the use of black & white for your image. Good architectural photo.', '2007-10-07 01:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148350, 593354, 79021, '<td valign="top">Excellent landscape.  The sky almost looks like breaking waves</td>', 'Excellent landscape.  The sky almost looks like breaking waves', '2007-10-07 01:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148351, 593470, 42495, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the B&amp;W conversion.  I like the solo figure by the lighthouse.</td>', 'Nice job on the B&W conversion.  I like the solo figure by the lighthouse.', '2007-10-07 01:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148353, 591150, 41675, '<td valign="top">Actually, if I put my hand over the woman, cropping her out, I like your image better. The woman''s pose seems kind of...stiff to me. In some ways, my eyes see it as three images: bottom w/woman, boats, then sky. I do like the light and colors though.</td>', 'Actually, if I put my hand over the woman, cropping her out, I like your image better. The woman''s pose seems kind of...stiff to me. In some ways, my eyes see it as three images: bottom w/woman, boats, then sky. I do like the light and colors though.', '2007-10-07 01:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148354, 593351, 79021, '<td valign="top">This is definitely one to frame...</td>', 'This is definitely one to frame...', '2007-10-07 01:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148356, 592304, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good fall colors. They''re so crisp that in some ways they kind of look fake. After covering up the green on the right, I find I like your image better. The green detracts a bit to me.</td>', 'Good fall colors. They''re so crisp that in some ways they kind of look fake. After covering up the green on the right, I find I like your image better. The green detracts a bit to me.', '2007-10-07 01:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148364, 593566, 41675, '<td valign="top">Tough lighting situation. The musicians seem to be "swallowed up" by the room - if that makes sense. Kind of lost. My favorite part of your image is the far right - the drummer and the lights on the cymbols.</td>', 'Tough lighting situation. The musicians seem to be "swallowed up" by the room - if that makes sense. Kind of lost. My favorite part of your image is the far right - the drummer and the lights on the cymbols.', '2007-10-07 01:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148366, 592674, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, dragonflies seem very popular in this challenge. Incredible macro though - I have lens envy. Lol Good color and lighting too.</td>', 'Hmmm, dragonflies seem very popular in this challenge. Incredible macro though - I have lens envy. Lol Good color and lighting too.', '2007-10-07 01:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148369, 593976, 41675, '<td valign="top">Icky little thing to look at. I like the area around its head though. TThe lighting is a little bright, but good closeup all in all.</td>', 'Icky little thing to look at. I like the area around its head though. TThe lighting is a little bright, but good closeup all in all.', '2007-10-07 01:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148373, 592187, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish that one branch hanging down hadn''t been there. I like the water coming off the wheel.</td>', 'For me, I wish that one branch hanging down hadn''t been there. I like the water coming off the wheel.', '2007-10-07 01:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148376, 589702, 41675, '<td valign="top">It looks like he''s pondering. Good use of the rule of thirds. I like the natural lighting as well.</td>', 'It looks like he''s pondering. Good use of the rule of thirds. I like the natural lighting as well.', '2007-10-07 01:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148380, 593733, 79021, '<td valign="top">The glow is uneven around the person, which takes away from the purpose of the shot (atleast according to the title)</td>', 'The glow is uneven around the person, which takes away from the purpose of the shot (atleast according to the title)', '2007-10-07 01:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148381, 593973, 41675, '<td valign="top">Very nice refraction. This would make a nice notecard. Good vibrant colors.</td>', 'Very nice refraction. This would make a nice notecard. Good vibrant colors.', '2007-10-07 01:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148383, 594029, 79021, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2007-10-07 01:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148387, 584369, 41675, '<td valign="top">In general I''m not a fan of guitar shots - they just don''t hold my personal interest. That aside, I like how the guitar grain matches the background. I also like the contrasting white.</td>', 'In general I''m not a fan of guitar shots - they just don''t hold my personal interest. That aside, I like how the guitar grain matches the background. I also like the contrasting white.', '2007-10-07 01:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148390, 592392, 41675, '<td valign="top">Yup - you get an "aww" point (or two). the hair makes me laugh and smile. Great capture on the expression. Very sweet. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Yup - you get an "aww" point (or two). the hair makes me laugh and smile. Great capture on the expression. Very sweet. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-07 01:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148393, 583581, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - funny. Since she''s standing and the bat ears are long on the mask, I wonder how this would work if cropped into a vertical image? That way, the focus would stay on her and not divert to the sides - at least to me.</td>', 'Lol - funny. Since she''s standing and the bat ears are long on the mask, I wonder how this would work if cropped into a vertical image? That way, the focus would stay on her and not divert to the sides - at least to me.', '2007-10-07 01:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148396, 589570, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. Good, vibrant colors. I like how he "Puddle Path" leads me into your image to the cloud shrouded mountains.</td>', 'Nice landscape. Good, vibrant colors. I like how he "Puddle Path" leads me into your image to the cloud shrouded mountains.', '2007-10-07 01:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148397, 587569, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow! I''ve never seen a shot of an owl like this. Truly spectacular. Great composition and I love the backlighting. The blue sky against the white of owl is terrific. One of my choices for top ten. Good luck! 10</td>', 'Wow! I''ve never seen a shot of an owl like this. Truly spectacular. Great composition and I love the backlighting. The blue sky against the white of owl is terrific. One of my choices for top ten. Good luck! 10', '2007-10-07 01:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148400, 593678, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good silhouette. My favorite part is actually the negative space created by the arm and leg.</td>', 'Good silhouette. My favorite part is actually the negative space created by the arm and leg.', '2007-10-07 01:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
