(4149104, 593656, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, if there was a bit more contrast to make the shadows darker, your photo would be more dramatic. I do like the angle you chose and the use of black &amp; white is effective.</td>', 'For me, if there was a bit more contrast to make the shadows darker, your photo would be more dramatic. I do like the angle you chose and the use of black & white is effective.', '2007-10-07 13:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149105, 593083, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - how cute! I like the title. The colors seem a little flat to me. Your photo does make me smile though.</td>', 'Lol - how cute! I like the title. The colors seem a little flat to me. Your photo does make me smile though.', '2007-10-07 13:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149110, 592201, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors (although maybe a wee bit overhsarpened). Good use of natural lighting. I like it.</td>', 'Wonderful colors (although maybe a wee bit overhsarpened). Good use of natural lighting. I like it.', '2007-10-07 13:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149125, 593177, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea and concept. I do wish it were cropped in closer to her. to me, in some ways she''s...lost...or being swallowed up by the tree.</td>', 'I like your idea and concept. I do wish it were cropped in closer to her. to me, in some ways she''s...lost...or being swallowed up by the tree.', '2007-10-07 13:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149132, 593478, 55956, '<td valign="top">I like the right side of this image, the left side with the big white strip is unhelpful in the image. a better composition was possible if the curtain was entire. the crop is distracting and the image lose energy. probably you have only this image, but a second shot with the window on the left and the curtain that fly should be great. the colours and the tones are beautiful. 6 but this is one of that images that I love</td>', 'I like the right side of this image, the left side with the big white strip is unhelpful in the image. a better composition was possible if the curtain was entire. the crop is distracting and the image lose energy. probably you have only this image, but a second shot with the window on the left and the curtain that fly should be great. the colours and the tones are beautiful. 6 but this is one of that images that I love', '2007-10-07 13:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149139, 591925, 66616, '<td valign="top">Nice to see South Australia being represented!</td>', 'Nice to see South Australia being represented!', '2007-10-07 13:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149145, 584492, 55956, '<td valign="top">great landscape,I like the sun in that position and the rays near the bridge. the human presence add something to this image. 10</td>', 'great landscape,I like the sun in that position and the rays near the bridge. the human presence add something to this image. 10', '2007-10-07 13:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149147, 593603, 55956, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2007-10-07 13:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
