(4149199, 587211, 30791, '<td valign="top">very dreamy and mystical effect, the ambiance of the fog makes the photo<br/>is that a feather???<br/>10</td>', 'very dreamy and mystical effect, the ambiance of the fog makes the photois that a feather???10', '2007-10-07 14:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149232, 593665, 28719, '<td valign="top">I think it might be improved by bringing out some of the detail in the feathers.</td>', 'I think it might be improved by bringing out some of the detail in the feathers.', '2007-10-07 14:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149237, 592870, 28719, '<td valign="top">Technically good close-up but doesn''t hold the attention for very long.  Lines take one out of the picture too quickly.</td>', 'Technically good close-up but doesn''t hold the attention for very long.  Lines take one out of the picture too quickly.', '2007-10-07 14:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149239, 586480, 28719, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white.  Interesting design.  I would have moved it just a little bit more to the right but still keep it off center.</td>', 'Nice black and white.  Interesting design.  I would have moved it just a little bit more to the right but still keep it off center.', '2007-10-07 14:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149242, 583280, 28719, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Good drama, good positioning of subject.  Good cropping,</td>', 'I like this.  Good drama, good positioning of subject.  Good cropping,', '2007-10-07 14:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149245, 593594, 28719, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t keep my attention for long.  Good saturation of blue sky. I might have cloned out whatever that is at the foot of the cross which is distracting for me.</td>', 'It doesn''t keep my attention for long.  Good saturation of blue sky. I might have cloned out whatever that is at the foot of the cross which is distracting for me.', '2007-10-07 14:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149248, 591716, 28719, '<td valign="top">OK, nice compossition; maybe just on the verge of too much sharpening but OK.  I don''t know but maybe the horizontal wire could have been cloned out.</td>', 'OK, nice compossition; maybe just on the verge of too much sharpening but OK.  I don''t know but maybe the horizontal wire could have been cloned out.', '2007-10-07 14:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149251, 592674, 28719, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup:great color.</td>', 'Nice closeup:great color.', '2007-10-07 14:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149260, 593269, 67258, '<td valign="top">The intense blues are sumptuous.</td>', 'The intense blues are sumptuous.', '2007-10-07 14:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149262, 591228, 84328, '<td valign="top">amazing photo</td>', 'amazing photo', '2007-10-07 14:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149264, 591228, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome Northern Lights photo - the church and cross in the foreground are the perfect accompaniement.  Excellent work.</td>', 'This is an awesome Northern Lights photo - the church and cross in the foreground are the perfect accompaniement.  Excellent work.', '2007-10-07 14:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149265, 593861, 28719, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, but I think that the white spot in the sky is distracting; It really doesn''t look like a moon.  I also think that there is too much uninteresting material on the left and left bottom.  A little closer cropping would have helped.</td>', 'I don''t know, but I think that the white spot in the sky is distracting; It really doesn''t look like a moon.  I also think that there is too much uninteresting material on the left and left bottom.  A little closer cropping would have helped.', '2007-10-07 14:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149268, 592879, 28719, '<td valign="top">Good.  I like the blue color background.  Good subject intensity.  Overall good capture.</td>', 'Good.  I like the blue color background.  Good subject intensity.  Overall good capture.', '2007-10-07 14:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149270, 592535, 67258, '<td valign="top">A cute and lively looking baby, but hr does have a rather startled look here.  he also looks as though he could have done with a quick wipe over with a flannel before the photo was taken...  Nonetheless, a nice one for the family album.</td>', 'A cute and lively looking baby, but hr does have a rather startled look here.  he also looks as though he could have done with a quick wipe over with a flannel before the photo was taken...  Nonetheless, a nice one for the family album.', '2007-10-07 14:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149271, 591909, 28719, '<td valign="top">Well, I don''t understand the title.  What is this picture trying to say?  Good detail but why?</td>', 'Well, I don''t understand the title.  What is this picture trying to say?  Good detail but why?', '2007-10-07 14:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149273, 592905, 28719, '<td valign="top">Cute. OK snapshot</td>', 'Cute. OK snapshot', '2007-10-07 14:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149277, 593714, 28719, '<td valign="top">Nice angle of shot.  Interesting composition and color combination.  I like it!</td>', 'Nice angle of shot.  Interesting composition and color combination.  I like it!', '2007-10-07 14:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149278, 593492, 28719, '<td valign="top">Good close up.  Maybe a little too much space on the right.</td>', 'Good close up.  Maybe a little too much space on the right.', '2007-10-07 14:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149280, 593492, 67258, '<td valign="top">The muted soft background greens are lovely, and a good foil for your subject.  This is a good macro, and one that i would have been delighted to have taken, but in terms of DPC it perhaps lacks the sharpness and level of detail that the very best of the insect macros display.  A very good base from which to move forward though.</td>', 'The muted soft background greens are lovely, and a good foil for your subject.  This is a good macro, and one that i would have been delighted to have taken, but in terms of DPC it perhaps lacks the sharpness and level of detail that the very best of the insect macros display.  A very good base from which to move forward though.', '2007-10-07 14:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149282, 593373, 67258, '<td valign="top">The soft focus effect really suits the delightful facial expression of the child.</td>', 'The soft focus effect really suits the delightful facial expression of the child.', '2007-10-07 14:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149285, 591639, 67258, '<td valign="top">The floor level perspective is good, but for me the photo is let down by the distracting background.</td>', 'The floor level perspective is good, but for me the photo is let down by the distracting background.', '2007-10-07 14:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149286, 593600, 28719, '<td valign="top">I don''t know.  Doesn''t work for me.   The yellow is a little bit too saturated.  the reflection of the photographer is inticing but it doesn''t really help the composition much.  My eye just keeps bouncing up the the yellow whatever.</td>', 'I don''t know.  Doesn''t work for me.   The yellow is a little bit too saturated.  the reflection of the photographer is inticing but it doesn''t really help the composition much.  My eye just keeps bouncing up the the yellow whatever.', '2007-10-07 14:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149290, 592137, 28719, '<td valign="top">Good focus.</td>', 'Good focus.', '2007-10-07 14:40:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4149291, 593574, 67258, '<td valign="top">I really like the graphic simplicity of this - excellent work.</td>', 'I really like the graphic simplicity of this - excellent work.', '2007-10-07 14:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149296, 589081, 28719, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color. Perhaps the spider could have been highlighted a little with some dodging to bring out more detail; same with the web.</td>', 'Nice composition and color. Perhaps the spider could have been highlighted a little with some dodging to bring out more detail; same with the web.', '2007-10-07 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149297, 589512, 67258, '<td valign="top">Wow, this looks stunning on my new laptop - the level of detail in the fur is incredible. A really stunning portrait.</td>', 'Wow, this looks stunning on my new laptop - the level of detail in the fur is incredible. A really stunning portrait.', '2007-10-07 14:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149299, 593496, 28719, '<td valign="top">Why the square crop?  I would have liked to see a little bit more above the head.  Nice focus and capture though.</td>', 'Why the square crop?  I would have liked to see a little bit more above the head.  Nice focus and capture though.', '2007-10-07 14:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149301, 592134, 55956, '<td valign="top">amusing photograph, if you clone out the points on the skin is better 7</td>', 'amusing photograph, if you clone out the points on the skin is better 7', '2007-10-07 14:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149302, 586998, 28719, '<td valign="top">I like the lavender color but somewhat lacking in interest. It''s too bad that those interesting small whitish greenish clouds were so far to the left.</td>', 'I like the lavender color but somewhat lacking in interest. It''s too bad that those interesting small whitish greenish clouds were so far to the left.', '2007-10-07 14:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149304, 591537, 67258, '<td valign="top">A wonderful portrait - you have captured bags of character in the animated facial expression, the orange of the headscarf provides just the right amount of colour and looks good against the greys and blacks of the background, and the simple uniform pattern of the softly focussed wrought iron bacground provides a good foil for your subject.  Impressive.</td>', 'A wonderful portrait - you have captured bags of character in the animated facial expression, the orange of the headscarf provides just the right amount of colour and looks good against the greys and blacks of the background, and the simple uniform pattern of the softly focussed wrought iron bacground provides a good foil for your subject.  Impressive.', '2007-10-07 14:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149305, 593002, 28719, '<td valign="top">This is too small to really appreciate I think.  The darks are lacking in detail in this small version.  The range of darks and lights is too limited</td>', 'This is too small to really appreciate I think.  The darks are lacking in detail in this small version.  The range of darks and lights is too limited', '2007-10-07 14:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149306, 593385, 67258, '<td valign="top">The silky water is appealling, but for me lack of any detail in the grey uniform sky reduces the impact the photograph might otherwise have.</td>', 'The silky water is appealling, but for me lack of any detail in the grey uniform sky reduces the impact the photograph might otherwise have.', '2007-10-07 14:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149308, 586659, 28719, '<td valign="top">Nice water and reflections.  Perhaps a little too much color saturation, especially of the reds which becomes distracting and keeps pulling one''s view back to the red spots.  The red roof(?)in the background is just too much.</td>', 'Nice water and reflections.  Perhaps a little too much color saturation, especially of the reds which becomes distracting and keeps pulling one''s view back to the red spots.  The red roof(?)in the background is just too much.', '2007-10-07 14:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149312, 593379, 28719, '<td valign="top">Interesting but not much else.  Yes, I see the smile, it looks like a happy face.</td>', 'Interesting but not much else.  Yes, I see the smile, it looks like a happy face.', '2007-10-07 14:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149317, 591459, 55956, '<td valign="top">beautiful image!!!!!! very strong. 10</td>', 'beautiful image!!!!!! very strong. 10', '2007-10-07 14:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149319, 593909, 28719, '<td valign="top">The darks lack detail in this version, especially in the forground.  And, I find the wispy out-of-focus clouds somewhat jarring in an otherwise tranquil night scene.</td>', 'The darks lack detail in this version, especially in the forground.  And, I find the wispy out-of-focus clouds somewhat jarring in an otherwise tranquil night scene.', '2007-10-07 14:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149321, 590340, 28719, '<td valign="top">OK. Not a lot of interest here, only the color.</td>', 'OK. Not a lot of interest here, only the color.', '2007-10-07 14:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149325, 592387, 55956, '<td valign="top">the answer could be :"what do you have for me?" perhaps the image isn''t perfect under technical point of view, perhaps isn''t a really sexy image, but is clean and ironic. beautiful model.</td>', 'the answer could be :"what do you have for me?" perhaps the image isn''t perfect under technical point of view, perhaps isn''t a really sexy image, but is clean and ironic. beautiful model.', '2007-10-07 15:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149326, 584358, 28719, '<td valign="top">Nice movement capture of the waterfall.  I like the light at the top of the falls.  I think that the overlighted ferns take away from the dramatic shot of the falls.  I like the color of the water though with the greens of the ferns and other vegetation. I would take the saturation of those greens down just a hair.</td>', 'Nice movement capture of the waterfall.  I like the light at the top of the falls.  I think that the overlighted ferns take away from the dramatic shot of the falls.  I like the color of the water though with the greens of the ferns and other vegetation. I would take the saturation of those greens down just a hair.', '2007-10-07 15:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149329, 585837, 28719, '<td valign="top">Interesting.</td>', 'Interesting.', '2007-10-07 15:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149331, 587211, 5112, '<td valign="top">10 - love it!</td>', '10 - love it!', '2007-10-07 15:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149332, 591854, 5112, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this image!  ~10</td>', 'Absolutely love this image!  ~10', '2007-10-07 15:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149334, 592520, 55956, '<td valign="top">this is interesting. this is an image outside of the time and of the space, could be everywhere could be in every moment. very good the black and white, I like the composition with the two men both single ones with their thoughts. great photo. I hope for a good final position. 10</td>', 'this is interesting. this is an image outside of the time and of the space, could be everywhere could be in every moment. very good the black and white, I like the composition with the two men both single ones with their thoughts. great photo. I hope for a good final position. 10', '2007-10-07 15:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149335, 593754, 5112, '<td valign="top">Great expression, beautiful image, good treatment.  ~9</td>', 'Great expression, beautiful image, good treatment.  ~9', '2007-10-07 15:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149338, 593762, 28719, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good balance and color.  Good cropping.  I don''t know but maybe if the camara position had been moved some to the right so that more of the middle far shore could have been seen it would have helped.  The two evergreen trees in the foreground obsure what I think would have been a very interesting middleground.  Expecially the smaller tree closer to the middle .  I wish it wasn''t there.  Nice shot though.  My eyes stay within the frame and there is a lot of interesting things to see. Nice refloection.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good balance and color.  Good cropping.  I don''t know but maybe if the camara position had been moved some to the right so that more of the middle far shore could have been seen it would have helped.  The two evergreen trees in the foreground obsure what I think would have been a very interesting middleground.  Expecially the smaller tree closer to the middle .  I wish it wasn''t there.  Nice shot though.  My eyes stay within the frame and there is a lot of interesting things to see. Nice refloection.', '2007-10-07 15:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149341, 592736, 5112, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t work for me at all, I don''t see much of interest in the picture, and the treatment doesn''t help.</td>', 'Doesn''t work for me at all, I don''t see much of interest in the picture, and the treatment doesn''t help.', '2007-10-07 15:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149346, 593958, 28719, '<td valign="top">I think that I would have selected a shot with a little bit more of the face.  The hair is not that interesting nor is the tatoo.  I am taken out of the picture too quickly by the bright arm extenting to the right. There is not much the keeps me in the picture.</td>', 'I think that I would have selected a shot with a little bit more of the face.  The hair is not that interesting nor is the tatoo.  I am taken out of the picture too quickly by the bright arm extenting to the right. There is not much the keeps me in the picture.', '2007-10-07 15:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149348, 594040, 5112, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t work for me at all, I don''t know why it''s blurry, I don''t see much of interest, it looks overprocessed, and the added border doesn''t help.</td>', 'Doesn''t work for me at all, I don''t know why it''s blurry, I don''t see much of interest, it looks overprocessed, and the added border doesn''t help.', '2007-10-07 15:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149349, 583581, 73601, '<td valign="top">classic, great processing, the expression makes the shot for me, back to LOL again at this photo, I love it</td>', 'classic, great processing, the expression makes the shot for me, back to LOL again at this photo, I love it', '2007-10-07 15:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149350, 585345, 5112, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful picture actually, but to my eyes it''s way overprocessed.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful picture actually, but to my eyes it''s way overprocessed.', '2007-10-07 15:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149355, 590403, 73601, '<td valign="top">love this, great shot</td>', 'love this, great shot', '2007-10-07 15:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149356, 586664, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, gentle shot, title goes really well with it.  Love the flowers in the foreground.  Love the mood.  ~9</td>', 'Beautiful, gentle shot, title goes really well with it.  Love the flowers in the foreground.  Love the mood.  ~9', '2007-10-07 15:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149358, 592520, 73601, '<td valign="top">what a great couple of guys, kind of a tight crop but I enjoy this</td>', 'what a great couple of guys, kind of a tight crop but I enjoy this', '2007-10-07 15:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149360, 593478, 73601, '<td valign="top">great textures captured on the wall, really enjoy this, don''t know about the white on the right...</td>', 'great textures captured on the wall, really enjoy this, don''t know about the white on the right...', '2007-10-07 15:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149362, 593744, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, beautiful eyes :)  I wish the butterfly''s wings were not cut off.</td>', 'Nice shot, beautiful eyes :)  I wish the butterfly''s wings were not cut off.', '2007-10-07 15:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149363, 585655, 73601, '<td valign="top">this is wonderful, glad the bush is there, very moody</td>', 'this is wonderful, glad the bush is there, very moody', '2007-10-07 15:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149364, 593282, 28719, '<td valign="top">OK, I get the title.  Not much here to critique.  What''s the dark smudge in the lower left corner.  I would have cloned it out. The bright spot at the elbow is too burned out with no good reason. I think it would have been helped by cropping a lot off of the left side and maybe a little off of the top.  I don''t think that all of this blank space helps the overall composition.</td>', 'OK, I get the title.  Not much here to critique.  What''s the dark smudge in the lower left corner.  I would have cloned it out. The bright spot at the elbow is too burned out with no good reason. I think it would have been helped by cropping a lot off of the left side and maybe a little off of the top.  I don''t think that all of this blank space helps the overall composition.', '2007-10-07 15:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149366, 590657, 73601, '<td valign="top">nice square crop, the focus is great, nice dof</td>', 'nice square crop, the focus is great, nice dof', '2007-10-07 15:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149367, 593820, 73601, '<td valign="top">wonderful reflection on the water, great color</td>', 'wonderful reflection on the water, great color', '2007-10-07 15:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149368, 593284, 73601, '<td valign="top">nice colors, composition, crisp where it needs to be</td>', 'nice colors, composition, crisp where it needs to be', '2007-10-07 15:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149370, 593140, 73601, '<td valign="top">great subject, lighting seems a bit flat</td>', 'great subject, lighting seems a bit flat', '2007-10-07 15:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149371, 586490, 73601, '<td valign="top">well composed, would like to see a shallower DOF so the spider and web pops more</td>', 'well composed, would like to see a shallower DOF so the spider and web pops more', '2007-10-07 15:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149374, 594030, 73601, '<td valign="top">nice capture, colors and lighting seems a bit flat</td>', 'nice capture, colors and lighting seems a bit flat', '2007-10-07 15:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149377, 593878, 28719, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Good capture.  Good composition but maybe a little too much saturation of the reds/magentas of the snake''s mouth.  A little more sharpening of that area with more definition of the internal mouth structure by dodging and burning carefully to bring out more of the mouth detail.</td>', 'Wow!  Good capture.  Good composition but maybe a little too much saturation of the reds/magentas of the snake''s mouth.  A little more sharpening of that area with more definition of the internal mouth structure by dodging and burning carefully to bring out more of the mouth detail.', '2007-10-07 15:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149378, 592734, 73601, '<td valign="top">nice macro with nice bokeh, the wings of this thing are very cool</td>', 'nice macro with nice bokeh, the wings of this thing are very cool', '2007-10-07 15:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149379, 593612, 73601, '<td valign="top">great title, well shot, very crisp</td>', 'great title, well shot, very crisp', '2007-10-07 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
