(4149415, 593990, 64446, '<td valign="top">Sharp, well saturated colors, pleasant image to watch. I''d suggest having the rigth eye brither. Nice composition overall...</td>', 'Sharp, well saturated colors, pleasant image to watch. I''d suggest having the rigth eye brither. Nice composition overall...', '2007-10-07 15:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149420, 593725, 28719, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I don''t know but the darks seem a little too dark.  Not enough detail in the darks.  Perhaps it is cropped to close.  Overall the photograph doesn''t work for me.  It depends on the use for this photo.  In an ad for (something) I guess it might work.  I can see it with copy text on the upper right and middle right side.</td>', 'Interesting.  I don''t know but the darks seem a little too dark.  Not enough detail in the darks.  Perhaps it is cropped to close.  Overall the photograph doesn''t work for me.  It depends on the use for this photo.  In an ad for (something) I guess it might work.  I can see it with copy text on the upper right and middle right side.', '2007-10-07 15:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149431, 592304, 28719, '<td valign="top">OK.  I like these even though they are a bit over saturated and oversharpened. Maybe not! Maybe it would have been better with the green leaves cropped off of the right side.  The black hole on the right side is begging to be filled with something.  Yes, I think that it could be helped by cropping right about at the middle of the black hole on the right--- maybe even a little bit more, perhaps up to the red leaves</td>', 'OK.  I like these even though they are a bit over saturated and oversharpened. Maybe not! Maybe it would have been better with the green leaves cropped off of the right side.  The black hole on the right side is begging to be filled with something.  Yes, I think that it could be helped by cropping right about at the middle of the black hole on the right--- maybe even a little bit more, perhaps up to the red leaves', '2007-10-07 15:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149434, 591639, 28719, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Not enough detail in the darks.  Composition OK.</td>', 'Cute.  Not enough detail in the darks.  Composition OK.', '2007-10-07 15:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149453, 593825, 28719, '<td valign="top">Nice soft look.  I like the white drape.  The exposure was just right for the white drape.  I don''t know, maybe the face could come up just a little bit.  I think that I would try to retouch some of the blemishes on the face and arms.  I like the composition and balance.  It keeps me within the frame of the picture. Title good!  The more I look at this the more I like it.  If this was sharpened, it was just right.</td>', 'Nice soft look.  I like the white drape.  The exposure was just right for the white drape.  I don''t know, maybe the face could come up just a little bit.  I think that I would try to retouch some of the blemishes on the face and arms.  I like the composition and balance.  It keeps me within the frame of the picture. Title good!  The more I look at this the more I like it.  If this was sharpened, it was just right.', '2007-10-07 15:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149459, 585494, 28719, '<td valign="top">Not enough detail in the darks.  I  might tweak the contrast a little.  Good composition.</td>', 'Not enough detail in the darks.  I  might tweak the contrast a little.  Good composition.', '2007-10-07 15:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149465, 593924, 28719, '<td valign="top">Almost an abstract.   Maybe cropped too close. Not a lot here.</td>', 'Almost an abstract.   Maybe cropped too close. Not a lot here.', '2007-10-07 15:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149475, 593425, 28719, '<td valign="top">Sweet.  Doesn''t show a lot of "dance" though Maybe a closer crop getting rid of the armpits would help.  Maybe framing it as a head shot would be better.</td>', 'Sweet.  Doesn''t show a lot of "dance" though Maybe a closer crop getting rid of the armpits would help.  Maybe framing it as a head shot would be better.', '2007-10-07 15:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149486, 589763, 28719, '<td valign="top">Great closeup!  Wonderful detail. Nice background blur. Maybe a little dodging of the spider legs would help, maybe not.  Nice Crop. Good composition.</td>', 'Great closeup!  Wonderful detail. Nice background blur. Maybe a little dodging of the spider legs would help, maybe not.  Nice Crop. Good composition.', '2007-10-07 16:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149492, 593255, 28719, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl.  Good focus.  Horizontal crop works OK.  Balance of lights and darks good.  Color good.  Great skin.  I don''t know but the bright background spot behind her head is somewhat distracting.  It''s a little bit too intense.  I think if it could be brought down by about half that the focus would stay longer on the girl''s face.  Yes, I think that this picture could be inproved considerably if that bright spot were darkened.</td>', 'Pretty girl.  Good focus.  Horizontal crop works OK.  Balance of lights and darks good.  Color good.  Great skin.  I don''t know but the bright background spot behind her head is somewhat distracting.  It''s a little bit too intense.  I think if it could be brought down by about half that the focus would stay longer on the girl''s face.  Yes, I think that this picture could be inproved considerably if that bright spot were darkened.', '2007-10-07 16:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149494, 584786, 28719, '<td valign="top">Interesting color. Interesting design.  Not much else though.</td>', 'Interesting color. Interesting design.  Not much else though.', '2007-10-07 16:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149496, 593550, 67961, '<td valign="top">Great texture and crop.  One of my favourites.</td>', 'Great texture and crop.  One of my favourites.', '2007-10-07 16:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149499, 592729, 67961, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition.  One of my favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'Great lighting and composition.  One of my favourites in this challenge.', '2007-10-07 16:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149503, 593204, 28719, '<td valign="top">Too much saturation of color, especially the roofs. The bright color doesn''t work with the cloudy day. This is a nice subject and the composition is good.  Maybe this was sharpened too much.  I think that a softer look would have helped this one.</td>', 'Too much saturation of color, especially the roofs. The bright color doesn''t work with the cloudy day. This is a nice subject and the composition is good.  Maybe this was sharpened too much.  I think that a softer look would have helped this one.', '2007-10-07 16:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149505, 593973, 28719, '<td valign="top">Good color, Composition OK but not all that interesting.</td>', 'Good color, Composition OK but not all that interesting.', '2007-10-07 16:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149514, 594029, 28719, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen the original resolution.Interesting capture but not a lot for a photograph.  Maybe a little bit more cropping would help. If there is a border around this, I think that it is too dark, it adds too much space to the composition. A tighter crop and lighter border would help this one.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen the original resolution.Interesting capture but not a lot for a photograph.  Maybe a little bit more cropping would help. If there is a border around this, I think that it is too dark, it adds too much space to the composition. A tighter crop and lighter border would help this one.', '2007-10-07 16:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149516, 583587, 28719, '<td valign="top">Great photo.    Maybe a little more detail in the darks would help but maybe not.  I think that it is pretty good the way it is.  Square crop is good.</td>', 'Great photo.    Maybe a little more detail in the darks would help but maybe not.  I think that it is pretty good the way it is.  Square crop is good.', '2007-10-07 16:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149519, 593530, 28719, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  There is a lot of play between the cup in the lower left hand corner and the subject.  Maybe it should come out---maybe not.</td>', 'Good composition.  There is a lot of play between the cup in the lower left hand corner and the subject.  Maybe it should come out---maybe not.', '2007-10-07 16:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149521, 594007, 28719, '<td valign="top">Well, not a lot here.  Perhaps a tighter vertical or square crop would help.  There is too much space on the left side.  I know, I know, negative space is good--sometimes---but I think there is too much of it in this crop.  There is not that much to look at here.</td>', 'Well, not a lot here.  Perhaps a tighter vertical or square crop would help.  There is too much space on the left side.  I know, I know, negative space is good--sometimes---but I think there is too much of it in this crop.  There is not that much to look at here.', '2007-10-07 16:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149524, 593670, 28719, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Great color combinations, soft and subtle.  Great focus with blurred background.  Nice lines. Good composition.</td>', 'Nice.  Great color combinations, soft and subtle.  Great focus with blurred background.  Nice lines. Good composition.', '2007-10-07 16:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149526, 593739, 28719, '<td valign="top">Good telephoto.  Good square crop.  Good focus. Nice blurred background. Good balance.  Nice subtle colors.  I like it!</td>', 'Good telephoto.  Good square crop.  Good focus. Nice blurred background. Good balance.  Nice subtle colors.  I like it!', '2007-10-07 16:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149530, 593620, 28719, '<td valign="top">I like the color combination of the turquoise sky and rusty forground.  It''s a little murky in the middle though. The low clouds obscure what probably should be a main interst point in the shot. Maybe too much sharpening too---maybe not.</td>', 'I like the color combination of the turquoise sky and rusty forground.  It''s a little murky in the middle though. The low clouds obscure what probably should be a main interst point in the shot. Maybe too much sharpening too---maybe not.', '2007-10-07 16:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149532, 593163, 28719, '<td valign="top">Average shot---not a lot to say.  OK cropping. It''s just not that interesting though.</td>', 'Average shot---not a lot to say.  OK cropping. It''s just not that interesting though.', '2007-10-07 16:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149534, 593834, 28719, '<td valign="top">Maybe more detail in the darks would help.  Nice color in the sky. Nice crop.</td>', 'Maybe more detail in the darks would help.  Nice color in the sky. Nice crop.', '2007-10-07 16:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149536, 593699, 28719, '<td valign="top">OK---This is good.  Nice squarish crop.  Some detail in the darks which probably was better in the original photograph. Good detail in the flower.  the purply background splotches work well with the leaf color.  I think this is very elegant.</td>', 'OK---This is good.  Nice squarish crop.  Some detail in the darks which probably was better in the original photograph. Good detail in the flower.  the purply background splotches work well with the leaf color.  I think this is very elegant.', '2007-10-07 16:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149538, 593949, 28719, '<td valign="top">What are all of the orange splotches.  I think that it would have been better if the color had been confined to the tree and did not spill over into the black and white.</td>', 'What are all of the orange splotches.  I think that it would have been better if the color had been confined to the tree and did not spill over into the black and white.', '2007-10-07 16:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149543, 585655, 28719, '<td valign="top">A litle too much saturation of the yelllow plant. It is overpowering the rest of the picture.  Maybe if there was a little more purple in the sky it would help.  I would have tried some color gradient layers with this one.</td>', 'A litle too much saturation of the yelllow plant. It is overpowering the rest of the picture.  Maybe if there was a little more purple in the sky it would help.  I would have tried some color gradient layers with this one.', '2007-10-07 16:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149544, 593024, 28719, '<td valign="top">Great closeup.  A little closer croping would help.  There is a little bit too much on the left.</td>', 'Great closeup.  A little closer croping would help.  There is a little bit too much on the left.', '2007-10-07 16:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149546, 580726, 28719, '<td valign="top">Yes!  Beautiful capture.  Oh so rich and subtle colors.  I would like to see the 300 resolution print. It looks like you didn''t do much post processing with this one.  If you did, it was just right! this is my only 10 so far.</td>', 'Yes!  Beautiful capture.  Oh so rich and subtle colors.  I would like to see the 300 resolution print. It looks like you didn''t do much post processing with this one.  If you did, it was just right! this is my only 10 so far.', '2007-10-07 16:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149547, 592832, 28719, '<td valign="top">OK, interesting color.  Cropping good and composition good.</td>', 'OK, interesting color.  Cropping good and composition good.', '2007-10-07 16:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149552, 593643, 28719, '<td valign="top">Yes this is very good.  Color perfect, focus great (maybe a little bit oversharpened.)  If this was sharpened the sharpening could have been restricted to the ducks while the grass clippings, especially the light ones could have been toned down a little bit. But overall I like this one.</td>', 'Yes this is very good.  Color perfect, focus great (maybe a little bit oversharpened.)  If this was sharpened the sharpening could have been restricted to the ducks while the grass clippings, especially the light ones could have been toned down a little bit. But overall I like this one.', '2007-10-07 16:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149555, 593827, 28719, '<td valign="top">Nice focus.  Maybe a tighter crop would help to make a more interesting composition.  Maybe a little dark vignetting would help direct focus on the horse head.</td>', 'Nice focus.  Maybe a tighter crop would help to make a more interesting composition.  Maybe a little dark vignetting would help direct focus on the horse head.', '2007-10-07 16:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149569, 593204, 44882, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape, bravo.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape, bravo.', '2007-10-07 17:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149570, 592520, 69368, '<td valign="top">I love this pic! a really nice scenery!</td>', 'I love this pic! a really nice scenery!', '2007-10-07 17:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149573, 593907, 28719, '<td valign="top">Nice lines Composition OK although I think I would have liked to see a little bit more blue sky on the left for balance. If this was sharpened I think that it was almost a little bit too much.</td>', 'Nice lines Composition OK although I think I would have liked to see a little bit more blue sky on the left for balance. If this was sharpened I think that it was almost a little bit too much.', '2007-10-07 17:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
