(4149607, 594068, 44882, '<td valign="top">Such a great expression on this one !</td>', 'Such a great expression on this one !', '2007-10-07 17:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149610, 593564, 69368, '<td valign="top">really nice bokeh, colors and DOF! But not sure about the frame and it looks more like a painting than  a photo. <br/>Otherwise I like this shot!  <br/>aaaah! It''s not easy for me....</td>', 'really nice bokeh, colors and DOF! But not sure about the frame and it looks more like a painting than  a photo. Otherwise I like this shot!  aaaah! It''s not easy for me....', '2007-10-07 17:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149613, 590340, 44882, '<td valign="top">Great colors here.</td>', 'Great colors here.', '2007-10-07 17:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149617, 594051, 28719, '<td valign="top">OK, nice misty morning. I don''t know but maybe the fence post is too distracting.  What is the subject of this photo.  The fog?  The fence post?  the distant barn, the field, the distant trees?    I would have liked to see the color version of this; I don''t think this works as a black and white.  I think that a long landscape cropping of this to include just the distant hills, trees, fog, field and barn with some cloning out of the top of the fence post would help this picture.  I think that this is one that could be made into a spectacular misty atmospheric color photograph.</td>', 'OK, nice misty morning. I don''t know but maybe the fence post is too distracting.  What is the subject of this photo.  The fog?  The fence post?  the distant barn, the field, the distant trees?    I would have liked to see the color version of this; I don''t think this works as a black and white.  I think that a long landscape cropping of this to include just the distant hills, trees, fog, field and barn with some cloning out of the top of the fence post would help this picture.  I think that this is one that could be made into a spectacular misty atmospheric color photograph.', '2007-10-07 17:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149620, 593688, 69368, '<td valign="top">ha-ha-ha! Have to look twice....<br/>funny capture! <br/>Back to bump you up!</td>', 'ha-ha-ha! Have to look twice....funny capture! Back to bump you up!', '2007-10-07 17:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149622, 593979, 28719, '<td valign="top">Nice picture for an ad.  Plenty of space for copy at the top and middle.  But, don''t like the large blurred flower in the forground.</td>', 'Nice picture for an ad.  Plenty of space for copy at the top and middle.  But, don''t like the large blurred flower in the forground.', '2007-10-07 17:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149631, 590758, 28719, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite meet its potential.  Maybe a square crop would help--- taking out about a fourth on the left side.  Then maybe some subtle dark vignetting to direct the attention to the brighter misty center of the picture.  the color seems to be a little washed out.   this is a difficult shot to make something really good out of since there is little form to work with.</td>', 'Doesn''t quite meet its potential.  Maybe a square crop would help--- taking out about a fourth on the left side.  Then maybe some subtle dark vignetting to direct the attention to the brighter misty center of the picture.  the color seems to be a little washed out.   this is a difficult shot to make something really good out of since there is little form to work with.', '2007-10-07 17:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4149634, 591157, 28719, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good composition. Good color. Nice lines.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good composition. Good color. Nice lines.', '2007-10-07 17:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
