(4149650, 593835, 28719, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of this portrait.  Nice skin.  It''s good to see that it is not overworked. Maybe a little bit of brightening would help but I don''t know.  Maybe a bit of vignette darkening on the left side or lower left side would help.  Overall with a frame I think this is OK.</td>', 'I like the softness of this portrait.  Nice skin.  It''s good to see that it is not overworked. Maybe a little bit of brightening would help but I don''t know.  Maybe a bit of vignette darkening on the left side or lower left side would help.  Overall with a frame I think this is OK.', '2007-10-07 17:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
