(4149675, 592805, 28719, '<td valign="top">Nice color, eventhough the reds and yellows might be a little too oversaturated. The blured water doesn''t work here. that white spot is a main focus point in this photograph and when one looks there, there is nothing but fuzzy white.   I think that more form to the water (fall)? would have helped. I also think that more detail in the dark water pool would have helped. The middle of this picture is lacking in detail.</td>', 'Nice color, eventhough the reds and yellows might be a little too oversaturated. The blured water doesn''t work here. that white spot is a main focus point in this photograph and when one looks there, there is nothing but fuzzy white.   I think that more form to the water (fall)? would have helped. I also think that more detail in the dark water pool would have helped. The middle of this picture is lacking in detail.', '2007-10-07 17:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
