(4149682, 593566, 28719, '<td valign="top">Maybe the original print would show more detail but in this small version much of the detail in the dark area is lost.  The color is good and the picture has a certain charm and feeling to it.  Perhaps a little bit more cropping of the top and left side would help it.</td>', 'Maybe the original print would show more detail but in this small version much of the detail in the dark area is lost.  The color is good and the picture has a certain charm and feeling to it.  Perhaps a little bit more cropping of the top and left side would help it.', '2007-10-07 17:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
