(4149692, 587058, 70000, '<td valign="top">YES! finally a ladybug that is the right color....I don''t think I have ever seen a lady bug as red as they normally are presented. Beautiful color scheme, this could be a tad sharper in my opinion but I love the dynamic between the hole in the leaf and the ladybug all hidden in its shell</td>', 'YES! finally a ladybug that is the right color....I don''t think I have ever seen a lady bug as red as they normally are presented. Beautiful color scheme, this could be a tad sharper in my opinion but I love the dynamic between the hole in the leaf and the ladybug all hidden in its shell', '2007-10-07 17:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
