(4149722, 593159, 28719, '<td valign="top">I do like color.  What was the color version like?  the fence takes me right out of the picture and quickly.  There is not much left after that.  Maybe a close landscape crop of the fence would have made a better composition.</td>', 'I do like color.  What was the color version like?  the fence takes me right out of the picture and quickly.  There is not much left after that.  Maybe a close landscape crop of the fence would have made a better composition.', '2007-10-07 18:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
