(4149737, 593518, 28719, '<td valign="top">Interesting color.  Almost too much color saturation and sharpening on this one.  Nice abstract form and line.  Would work better as a blurry abstract.  I think that I would redo this without the sharpening an dodging(?) and see what I would get.</td>', 'Interesting color.  Almost too much color saturation and sharpening on this one.  Nice abstract form and line.  Would work better as a blurry abstract.  I think that I would redo this without the sharpening an dodging(?) and see what I would get.', '2007-10-07 18:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
