(4150618, 593910, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really good portrait and am surprised it didn''t score higher (not that 6.3 is anything to be ashamed of).  I only gave out four "10s" this challenge and this was one of them.  I like the glow of the white hair and the deep blacks of the background.  Great texture revealed in the face.  How neat that it''s your dad.</td>', 'I think this is a really good portrait and am surprised it didn''t score higher (not that 6.3 is anything to be ashamed of).  I only gave out four "10s" this challenge and this was one of them.  I like the glow of the white hair and the deep blacks of the background.  Great texture revealed in the face.  How neat that it''s your dad.', '2007-10-08 01:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
