(4150634, 593637, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh for heaven''s sake!!!!  This is breathtaking.   Even more beautiful to me because her name is Abbie.<br/> <br/>Congratulations. ..an excellent finish in a challenge like this for sure, but this goes way beyond any challenge results.  It''s a timeless treasure that will still take your breath away when Abbie is grown with kids of her own!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh for heaven''s sake!!!!  This is breathtaking.   Even more beautiful to me because her name is Abbie. Congratulations. ..an excellent finish in a challenge like this for sure, but this goes way beyond any challenge results.  It''s a timeless treasure that will still take your breath away when Abbie is grown with kids of her own! ', '2007-10-08 01:33:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4150637, 581610, 61961, '<td valign="top">Great image, it would do well in "expert editing."  Sorry to see it was disqualified.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Great image, it would do well in "expert editing."  Sorry to see it was disqualified.  Keep up the good work!', '2007-10-08 01:34:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4150639, 584617, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m glad this did so well. Outstanding work both technically and "metaphorically". The arrangement, altogether, is sublime, the lighting is spot-on, the B/W conversion is flawless, what more can you ask? I particularly appreciate the expanse of black above the figures, which I believe is proportioned just right. The way the upper arc of the woman''s body precisely is tangent to the equator of the image, gently thrusting the newborn into subtle but distinct prominence/ascendancy, is a grace note.<br/> <br/>This is a truly fine image, a masterful one even.<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'Wow, I''m glad this did so well. Outstanding work both technically and "metaphorically". The arrangement, altogether, is sublime, the lighting is spot-on, the B/W conversion is flawless, what more can you ask? I particularly appreciate the expanse of black above the figures, which I believe is proportioned just right. The way the upper arc of the woman''s body precisely is tangent to the equator of the image, gently thrusting the newborn into subtle but distinct prominence/ascendancy, is a grace note. This is a truly fine image, a masterful one even. R.', '2007-10-08 01:34:41.000000', NULL, 0),
