(4150701, 592872, 30861, '<td valign="top">Criminally underrated; one of my two 10''s in the challenge. This is so matter-of-fact, so casual and yet so precise. It comes across as a perfectly-frozen moment in time, and the murky quality of the PP, the squareness of the framing, the hovering and brooding sky, all lend an almost aching sense of immediate reality, a glimpse into something we were not meant to see.<br/> <br/>R.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-08 00:50:48.</i></td>', 'Criminally underrated; one of my two 10''s in the challenge. This is so matter-of-fact, so casual and yet so precise. It comes across as a perfectly-frozen moment in time, and the murky quality of the PP, the squareness of the framing, the hovering and brooding sky, all lend an almost aching sense of immediate reality, a glimpse into something we were not meant to see. R.', '2007-10-08 01:49:56.000000', '2007-10-08 01:50:48.000000', 0),
