(4150781, 593203, 6388, '<td valign="top">not the direction I''d have gone with the title, but the model is certainly handsome and charming.<br/> <br/>and to all those who read WAY too much into this - it was completely unscripted and nothing more than me being a dork.  I was wearing the skull cap under a wig and came into the room with it pulled down over my face while Roz was doing a shoot in my studio.<br/> <br/>Everyone''s entitled to have opinions and share their feelings, but at least recognize it''s <i>your</i> preconception that makes this offensive, not the photographer''s or model''s.</td>', 'not the direction I''d have gone with the title, but the model is certainly handsome and charming. and to all those who read WAY too much into this - it was completely unscripted and nothing more than me being a dork.  I was wearing the skull cap under a wig and came into the room with it pulled down over my face while Roz was doing a shoot in my studio. Everyone''s entitled to have opinions and share their feelings, but at least recognize it''s your preconception that makes this offensive, not the photographer''s or model''s.', '2007-10-08 02:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
