(4150828, 584617, 5822, '<td valign="top">The person who voted your image a "1" should be shot! (Photographically, of course, so we know who they are:). Even the person who voted a "4" should be shot too...and come to think of it, the five people who voted it a "5" should be equally shot, as well as, the 23 people who voted it a "6" and the 32 people voting it a "7", the 27 people who voted it a "8" and the 20 people who voted it a "9". That leaves 21 people of the 130 who voted still walking around. lol<br/> <br/>Seriously, though, I love the metaphorical interpretations that are evoked by this image. Mother as sacrfice (posed as on alter); mother as bridge for baby; mother representative as half of the circle of life for the baby; mother as soft, yet strong and supportive; and the list goes on...<br/> <br/>There''s a timelessness to it and it reminds me of the image of the fetus floating in space at the end of the movie: "2001: A Space Oddessy."  It''s very powerful. Congratulations on your blue.</td>', 'The person who voted your image a "1" should be shot! (Photographically, of course, so we know who they are:). Even the person who voted a "4" should be shot too...and come to think of it, the five people who voted it a "5" should be equally shot, as well as, the 23 people who voted it a "6" and the 32 people voting it a "7", the 27 people who voted it a "8" and the 20 people who voted it a "9". That leaves 21 people of the 130 who voted still walking around. lol Seriously, though, I love the metaphorical interpretations that are evoked by this image. Mother as sacrfice (posed as on alter); mother as bridge for baby; mother representative as half of the circle of life for the baby; mother as soft, yet strong and supportive; and the list goes on... There''s a timelessness to it and it reminds me of the image of the fetus floating in space at the end of the movie: "2001: A Space Oddessy."  It''s very powerful. Congratulations on your blue.', '2007-10-08 03:00:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4150830, 593203, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Looks like you struck a nerve girl. :)<br/> <br/>Value Village, brings back memories of highschool rebellion.  LOL!!</td>', 'Wow!  Looks like you struck a nerve girl. :) Value Village, brings back memories of highschool rebellion.  LOL!!', '2007-10-08 03:00:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4150836, 592138, 63398, '<td valign="top">Why this isn''t waaaaaay further up the scale is completely beyond my comprehension. This is just such an amazing image! I just love everything about it......the lighting, the detail, the setting is just so incongruous, yet intimate in its own special way......severely underrated.</td>', 'Why this isn''t waaaaaay further up the scale is completely beyond my comprehension. This is just such an amazing image! I just love everything about it......the lighting, the detail, the setting is just so incongruous, yet intimate in its own special way......severely underrated.', '2007-10-08 03:03:49.000000', NULL, 0),
