(4150914, 593908, 76198, '<td valign="top">I love this shot... very emotive to me. Peaceful, yet ever so vaguely threatening. I''m fascinated by abandoned buildings, and the lives they once held... I can''t help but think of the time and love that went into constructing it; the plans the builders had, and wonder what happened that caused it all to go awry. <br/> <br/>PM me if you post any outtakes - I''d love to see them.</td>', 'I love this shot... very emotive to me. Peaceful, yet ever so vaguely threatening. I''m fascinated by abandoned buildings, and the lives they once held... I can''t help but think of the time and love that went into constructing it; the plans the builders had, and wonder what happened that caused it all to go awry.  PM me if you post any outtakes - I''d love to see them.', '2007-10-08 03:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4150916, 591622, 3032, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m quite delighted to see this is natural light - WONDERFUL use of such.  An excellent shot all around - it was one of my top picks for the free study.  Very nice work, Sander! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you very much! :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: I''m quite delighted to see this is natural light - WONDERFUL use of such.  An excellent shot all around - it was one of my top picks for the free study.  Very nice work, Sander!   Thank you very much! :)', '2007-10-08 03:41:33.000000', NULL, 0),
