(4150989, 586664, 67145, '<td valign="top">OMG sandy .. this is an amazing moment that you have photographed .. i felt a bit teary reading your comments coz a connection with a wild animal would be a rare and beautiful thing .. congratulations on another incredible photograph to add to your collection .. and a fantastic place in the challenge .. <br/>also i''d like to say thankyou for your wonderful comment on my free study .. i saw it on my mobile phone coz i wasnt at home and really really wanted to see my score after roll-over, as you can imagine!!! .. i read wot you''d said out to my family .. we wre having something to eat while making a final decision on a car for elle, who is greg''s daughter .. it was a great moment, coz coupled with my pb &amp; your comment, elle decided on a fantastic first car .. safe as and very good value .. <br/>this has been a great day for all of us .. :)xx  <br/>this probably isnt the place to say all this but i''m pushed for time and its easier .. :)x</td>', 'OMG sandy .. this is an amazing moment that you have photographed .. i felt a bit teary reading your comments coz a connection with a wild animal would be a rare and beautiful thing .. congratulations on another incredible photograph to add to your collection .. and a fantastic place in the challenge .. also i''d like to say thankyou for your wonderful comment on my free study .. i saw it on my mobile phone coz i wasnt at home and really really wanted to see my score after roll-over, as you can imagine!!! .. i read wot you''d said out to my family .. we wre having something to eat while making a final decision on a car for elle, who is greg''s daughter .. it was a great moment, coz coupled with my pb & your comment, elle decided on a fantastic first car .. safe as and very good value .. this has been a great day for all of us .. :)xx  this probably isnt the place to say all this but i''m pushed for time and its easier .. :)x', '2007-10-08 05:14:31.000000', NULL, 0),
