(4151007, 594045, 30982, '<td valign="top">Composition and lighting are exquisite, as always.  I very nearly typed the comment "banmorn?" during voting as I figured it to either be yours or a most excellent tribute to your work.  One of these days you need to have an exhibit, and it should simply be titled "Three, by Robert Mann", or some such thing.</td>', 'Composition and lighting are exquisite, as always.  I very nearly typed the comment "banmorn?" during voting as I figured it to either be yours or a most excellent tribute to your work.  One of these days you need to have an exhibit, and it should simply be titled "Three, by Robert Mann", or some such thing.', '2007-10-08 05:36:36.000000', NULL, 0),
