(4151124, 592869, 84520, '<td valign="top">In my (humble) opinion, this image is underrated.  You''ve got such an amazing juxtaposition between the energy of the auroras and the energy of (city lights?).  Not to mention, getting those damn clouds to co-operate and position in such a perfect manner is a feat in and of itself.  <br/> <br/>This image blew me away when I first saw it and I still think its amazing.  Great work!</td>', 'In my (humble) opinion, this image is underrated.  You''ve got such an amazing juxtaposition between the energy of the auroras and the energy of (city lights?).  Not to mention, getting those damn clouds to co-operate and position in such a perfect manner is a feat in and of itself.   This image blew me away when I first saw it and I still think its amazing.  Great work!', '2007-10-08 06:46:57.000000', NULL, 0),
