(4151263, 592990, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is my second post, since rollover, and I have just finished talking to Roz, to congratulate her on this entry, which is her personal best, and I am so very proud of her achevement, with this image.<br/>I was looking at the image when speaking to her on the phone, and noticed something. <br/> <br/>Do you see what I see.<br/> <br/>I see a person face in the cloud of smoke, next to the tall black chimmey, near the centre of the image. It has two eyes, a round nose, and a mouth which is blowing out the golden/red firey flames. Can you see it also.....<br/><b>A W E S O M E.......</b><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-08 07:17:18.</i></td>', 'This is my second post, since rollover, and I have just finished talking to Roz, to congratulate her on this entry, which is her personal best, and I am so very proud of her achevement, with this image.I was looking at the image when speaking to her on the phone, and noticed something.  Do you see what I see. I see a person face in the cloud of smoke, next to the tall black chimmey, near the centre of the image. It has two eyes, a round nose, and a mouth which is blowing out the golden/red firey flames. Can you see it also.....A W E S O M E.......', '2007-10-08 08:14:36.000000', '2007-10-08 08:17:18.000000', 0),
