(4153520, 592748, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by EyeTrap:</b></div><hr/><i> low vote, subject has a sort of numb look on his face, does not give feeling of a drum jam, background is distracting as well especially the arm sort of hanging out in mid air on right/top side of pic. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>first he says that it doesn''t give the feeling of a drum jam, then he says the background elements are distracting. the background elements ARE the drum jam!! welcome to DPC.</td>', 'Originally posted by EyeTrap: low vote, subject has a sort of numb look on his face, does not give feeling of a drum jam, background is distracting as well especially the arm sort of hanging out in mid air on right/top side of pic.   first he says that it doesn''t give the feeling of a drum jam, then he says the background elements are distracting. the background elements ARE the drum jam!! welcome to DPC.', '2007-10-09 00:46:35.000000', NULL, 0),
