(4153679, 584617, 70000, '<td valign="top">I love this shot and I am so glad it won. I am getting really tired of the overphotoshopped multicolored landscapes that normally prevail in freestudies. The lighting here reminds me of the two black and whites I did for my half entry and free study entry. I love this and think it is a beautiful, artistic and unique portrait. The white cloth is perfectly exposed and the whole thing flows so well. Congrats on an amazing shot</td>', 'I love this shot and I am so glad it won. I am getting really tired of the overphotoshopped multicolored landscapes that normally prevail in freestudies. The lighting here reminds me of the two black and whites I did for my half entry and free study entry. I love this and think it is a beautiful, artistic and unique portrait. The white cloth is perfectly exposed and the whole thing flows so well. Congrats on an amazing shot', '2007-10-09 03:05:15.000000', NULL, 0),
