(4153966, 592830, 54044, '<td valign="top">Ok here it comes the bad coment, you have beautyfull image there no question about it,but there is one thing (the processing !) i am starting too see this more and more in DPC and images are starting too loose the feeling betwin a real photograph and a digital image. Yes we have the advanced rules and photoshop gives us the oprtunity too alter our images ,but when i see a beatyfull photo being overprocessed it looses its feeling of actualy being a photograph. I am sorry i dont mean to be harsh it just happend too be your image that i had too put my comment on . Thanks</td>', 'Ok here it comes the bad coment, you have beautyfull image there no question about it,but there is one thing (the processing !) i am starting too see this more and more in DPC and images are starting too loose the feeling betwin a real photograph and a digital image. Yes we have the advanced rules and photoshop gives us the oprtunity too alter our images ,but when i see a beatyfull photo being overprocessed it looses its feeling of actualy being a photograph. I am sorry i dont mean to be harsh it just happend too be your image that i had too put my comment on . Thanks', '2007-10-09 09:37:24.000000', NULL, 0),
