(4154470, 593478, 41746, '<td valign="top">Thanks for reading my mind, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a>. Without the white strip of the other house on the left the image loose energy, not the opposite like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=55956" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Rino63</a> and some other said. I also totally agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a> that cutting the end of the curtain makes the image more powerful. So thanks a lot for your support and kind remarks!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-09 13:55:58.</i></td>', 'Thanks for reading my mind,  posthumous. Without the white strip of the other house on the left the image loose energy, not the opposite like  Rino63 and some other said. I also totally agree with  posthumous that cutting the end of the curtain makes the image more powerful. So thanks a lot for your support and kind remarks!', '2007-10-09 13:31:37.000000', '2007-10-09 14:55:58.000000', 0),
