(4155391, 592830, 59267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautifully processed, luminous &amp; lyrical image. My only quibble is, I wish you''d toned down the lower left corner a full zone, made it darker. It distracts me with detail I don''t feel contributes to the image. <br/> <br/>Great shot! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your suggestion. After toned down the lower left corner, it will be like this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=596989" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/59267/120/596989.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/59267/120/596989.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/59267/120/596989.jpg"/></a>, how is that? better? or too dark?</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: Beautifully processed, luminous & lyrical image. My only quibble is, I wish you''d toned down the lower left corner a full zone, made it darker. It distracts me with detail I don''t feel contributes to the image.  Great shot!   Thanks for your suggestion. After toned down the lower left corner, it will be like this , how is that? better? or too dark?', '2007-10-09 21:44:37.000000', NULL, 0),
