(4155458, 584492, 81390, '<td valign="top">If I''m not mistaken, this is one of the most photographed arches in any given desert. So I''d think I''ve seen them all - apparently not. The addition of a person seriously helps, especially by giving you a feeling of scale. The world is, by far, bigger than we are.</td>', 'If I''m not mistaken, this is one of the most photographed arches in any given desert. So I''d think I''ve seen them all - apparently not. The addition of a person seriously helps, especially by giving you a feeling of scale. The world is, by far, bigger than we are.', '2007-10-09 22:37:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4155486, 592137, 70484, '<td valign="top">This is great! I was just browsing throught the October light challenge and saw this. What an awesome picture. Thanks so much for listing your setup, it really helps us newbies. Her expression is wonderful. Great capture.</td>', 'This is great! I was just browsing throught the October light challenge and saw this. What an awesome picture. Thanks so much for listing your setup, it really helps us newbies. Her expression is wonderful. Great capture.', '2007-10-09 22:49:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4155524, 594028, 42100, '<td valign="top"><strike>Oops, forgot to fave the absolute best entry of the challenge!</strike> <br/> <br/>Oops, forgot to fave the absolute best <i>damn</i> entry of the challenge!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-09 22:11:38.</i></td>', 'Oops, forgot to fave the absolute best entry of the challenge!  Oops, forgot to fave the absolute best damn entry of the challenge!', '2007-10-09 23:02:50.000000', '2007-10-09 23:11:38.000000', 0),
(4155565, 584617, 24111, '<td valign="top">superb!</td>', 'superb!', '2007-10-09 23:18:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4155577, 593633, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh this is so pretty!  And it brings back such happy memories.  I used to live in El Paso when I was growing up, and it was such a treat when we used to get to go to White Sands.  I''d love to go see it again sometime.   Thanks for the photo in the meantime!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh this is so pretty!  And it brings back such happy memories.  I used to live in El Paso when I was growing up, and it was such a treat when we used to get to go to White Sands.  I''d love to go see it again sometime.   Thanks for the photo in the meantime! ', '2007-10-09 23:23:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4155731, 583294, 69325, '<td valign="top">gorgeous, i told you many times now you are your own best model, love the lighting and your makeup work and the look on your face....beautiful<br/> <br/>ETA: whoops! i thought this was you then i saw the title of the picture was "sara" lol oh well comments still apply!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-09 23:14:01.</i></td>', 'gorgeous, i told you many times now you are your own best model, love the lighting and your makeup work and the look on your face....beautiful ETA: whoops! i thought this was you then i saw the title of the picture was "sara" lol oh well comments still apply!', '2007-10-10 00:12:12.000000', '2007-10-10 00:14:01.000000', 0),
(4155845, 593628, 31403, '<td valign="top">this is brilliant</td>', 'this is brilliant', '2007-10-10 00:51:20.000000', NULL, 0),
