(4156882, 593860, 67697, '<td valign="top">Alicia, the sky is gorgeous!  I love the light on the sail and and the contrast of the yellow against the blue is beautiful!</td>', 'Alicia, the sky is gorgeous!  I love the light on the sail and and the contrast of the yellow against the blue is beautiful!', '2007-10-10 09:22:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4156927, 584617, 83391, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I love the placement and lighting.  I may try to re-create this in my studio since I do portraiture.  One question though, is this the woman that gave birth to that tiny baby?  If so, she bounced back fabulously!<br/></td>', 'Very nice shot!  I love the placement and lighting.  I may try to re-create this in my studio since I do portraiture.  One question though, is this the woman that gave birth to that tiny baby?  If so, she bounced back fabulously!', '2007-10-10 09:47:02.000000', NULL, 0),
