(4157610, 592869, 70000, '<td valign="top">Interesting cloud layer, The three elements of the green red and gray clouds seem to clash to me, but it must be SO nice to just go out and chill with your camera and music. Great getawa</td>', 'Interesting cloud layer, The three elements of the green red and gray clouds seem to clash to me, but it must be SO nice to just go out and chill with your camera and music. Great getawa', '2007-10-10 12:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
