(4159236, 593612, 56880, '<td valign="top">You got just the right DOF for this type of shot; the frog''s eye and fingers are very sharp yet the background is blurred enough to eliminate any cluttering or distraction.  Well done!</td>', 'You got just the right DOF for this type of shot; the frog''s eye and fingers are very sharp yet the background is blurred enough to eliminate any cluttering or distraction.  Well done!', '2007-10-10 23:47:02.000000', NULL, 0),
