(4161256, 594091, 41794, '<td valign="top">Love how the white dress stands out from the background. Great scenery for this shot - but I have to agree, the pose does look quite uncomfortable!</td>', 'Love how the white dress stands out from the background. Great scenery for this shot - but I have to agree, the pose does look quite uncomfortable!', '2007-10-11 20:01:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4161294, 593411, 29011, '<td valign="top">Looking at the shot again, the eyes and lips have a purplish cast. Some slight adjustments to the charming young baby lady''s skin and eyes, to warm them tones up a bit. Otherwise I still stand by my first comment, that I really like this shot and everything else works great here. Really hoped this would do better. But you have a wonderful shot. Must be printed big :)</td>', 'Looking at the shot again, the eyes and lips have a purplish cast. Some slight adjustments to the charming young baby lady''s skin and eyes, to warm them tones up a bit. Otherwise I still stand by my first comment, that I really like this shot and everything else works great here. Really hoped this would do better. But you have a wonderful shot. Must be printed big :)', '2007-10-11 20:18:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4161359, 591653, 42100, '<td valign="top">Ooh, and I really liked this one as well during voting...and both by the same photographer.  Great photo!</td>', 'Ooh, and I really liked this one as well during voting...and both by the same photographer.  Great photo!', '2007-10-11 21:18:18.000000', NULL, 0),
