(4165756, 592571, 65319, '<td valign="top">Yet another example of why you are high on my list of favorite photographers.  Interesting to note that none of your votes are below a 5....how often does THAT happen!!!!  Rare indeed...;-)</td>', 'Yet another example of why you are high on my list of favorite photographers.  Interesting to note that none of your votes are below a 5....how often does THAT happen!!!!  Rare indeed...;-)', '2007-10-14 00:34:08.000000', NULL, 0),
