(4165884, 593176, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a BEAUTIFUL!  BEAUTIFUL boy!  And the sepia processing makes it even more awesome.  It gives it a nostalgic, old-timey look.  I just love this.<br/> <br/></td>', 'What a BEAUTIFUL!  BEAUTIFUL boy!  And the sepia processing makes it even more awesome.  It gives it a nostalgic, old-timey look.  I just love this. ', '2007-10-14 01:41:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4166011, 590512, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ve no concrete idea as to why this didn''t score a six, to tell you the truth.  DPC is a very picky place and free studies are tougher than most challenges.  Good clarity, very pleasing color.  The OOF branch in the foreground (which I like) may have hurt some.  Composition is a bit centered, but appropriate for this subject.  And I have a theory that half the time score is luck of the draw - it makes me feel better, anyway.  :-)</td>', 'I''ve no concrete idea as to why this didn''t score a six, to tell you the truth.  DPC is a very picky place and free studies are tougher than most challenges.  Good clarity, very pleasing color.  The OOF branch in the foreground (which I like) may have hurt some.  Composition is a bit centered, but appropriate for this subject.  And I have a theory that half the time score is luck of the draw - it makes me feel better, anyway.  :-)', '2007-10-14 02:32:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4166506, 593600, 84440, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Gelert:</b></div><hr/><i> If this is a lock then where is the lock? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is the side panel of an electronics box on an Eire Canal Lock. The "key" is a tool to open the box. The box is large, about 6feet by 6feet by 8 feet. I distorted the image. I did report this to the "DPC" committee that I thought I might have broken the  rules. They were going to get back to me, but I didn''t hear back. I used the lens distortion feature in Capture to add distortion. <br/> <br/>I was really just playing around with this. I usually shoot landscape. Cheers.</td>', 'Originally posted by Gelert: If this is a lock then where is the lock?   This is the side panel of an electronics box on an Eire Canal Lock. The "key" is a tool to open the box. The box is large, about 6feet by 6feet by 8 feet. I distorted the image. I did report this to the "DPC" committee that I thought I might have broken the  rules. They were going to get back to me, but I didn''t hear back. I used the lens distortion feature in Capture to add distortion.  I was really just playing around with this. I usually shoot landscape. Cheers.', '2007-10-14 12:53:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4166582, 593633, 74559, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a high finishing beautiful image and a new PB score! I love the shadows, awesome!</td>', 'Congrats on a high finishing beautiful image and a new PB score! I love the shadows, awesome!', '2007-10-14 13:29:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4167081, 592392, 14414, '<td valign="top">nice shot, congrats on the pb.</td>', 'nice shot, congrats on the pb.', '2007-10-14 19:04:24.000000', NULL, 0),
