(4167512, 592872, 66384, '<td valign="top">With the girl in that position and the boats in the background, I am reminded of a figurehead. It''s a wonderful and strange capture. I think I would like it better without the bit of girl on the right.</td>', 'With the girl in that position and the boats in the background, I am reminded of a figurehead. It''s a wonderful and strange capture. I think I would like it better without the bit of girl on the right.', '2007-10-14 23:09:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4167543, 593589, 66384, '<td valign="top">He looks locked away in a tower prison -- an unfortunate, lonely, little prince reaching out for human contact. Sort of makes me think of the way severe depression can keep a person trapped and isolated even on the sunniest day. I really like the b&amp;w, the light, and the lines of this image. Nice composition.</td>', 'He looks locked away in a tower prison -- an unfortunate, lonely, little prince reaching out for human contact. Sort of makes me think of the way severe depression can keep a person trapped and isolated even on the sunniest day. I really like the b&w, the light, and the lines of this image. Nice composition.', '2007-10-14 23:18:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4167553, 591641, 66384, '<td valign="top">Oooo, very impressionistic. I like the angle of your subject and the soft blur - which is very obviously intentional. And even in that blurred state, your daughter is still beautiful.</td>', 'Oooo, very impressionistic. I like the angle of your subject and the soft blur - which is very obviously intentional. And even in that blurred state, your daughter is still beautiful.', '2007-10-14 23:22:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4167564, 593301, 66384, '<td valign="top">Well, you know I love butterflies, and what can I say, this is exquisite. The butterfly is in perfect condition, the focus and color are great, and I really like the composition. The soft green background really off-sets the subject.</td>', 'Well, you know I love butterflies, and what can I say, this is exquisite. The butterfly is in perfect condition, the focus and color are great, and I really like the composition. The soft green background really off-sets the subject.', '2007-10-14 23:28:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4167572, 593484, 66384, '<td valign="top">I understand this is evening, but I really would like to be able to see this lovely scene better. I love the composition.</td>', 'I understand this is evening, but I really would like to be able to see this lovely scene better. I love the composition.', '2007-10-14 23:31:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4167583, 581010, 66384, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful child and a tender moment. Lovely light and soft focus. I like the colors too. I''m really surprised this didn''t score at least in the mid fives.</td>', 'What a beautiful child and a tender moment. Lovely light and soft focus. I like the colors too. I''m really surprised this didn''t score at least in the mid fives.', '2007-10-14 23:37:19.000000', NULL, 0),
