(4168693, 589743, 30982, '<td valign="top">Exposure is perfect.  I didn''t comment in the challenge (figured you already knew it was good) and fully expected this to be top ten, easily.  Perhaps a bit too subtle for the full-on in-your-face color-rules crowd but an exceptional photo just the same.</td>', 'Exposure is perfect.  I didn''t comment in the challenge (figured you already knew it was good) and fully expected this to be top ten, easily.  Perhaps a bit too subtle for the full-on in-your-face color-rules crowd but an exceptional photo just the same.', '2007-10-15 10:23:19.000000', NULL, 0),
