(4172159, 593703, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is one I''d like to see the original of and maybe have you redo the post processing.  You have a very good composition here.</td>', 'This is one I''d like to see the original of and maybe have you redo the post processing.  You have a very good composition here.', '2007-10-16 16:13:03.000000', NULL, 0),
