(4183711, 594007, 47483, '<td valign="top">I saw yours in challenge. There are two problems why your did not score well. <br/>1. There is a red round glow on it, which distroys the main shape, which is well visible in my shot.<br/>2. your crop is not good. I mean it is good but it makes it ordinary. Everybody who shoots this subject crops like that. So what would have helped is unusual crop. Something that you do not see often. There are two in my portfolio, both of them are close and different crops. I think you should try again with this subject but with in mind that you are not going to shoot ordinary thing this time. <br/>Thanks for comment.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-20 19:31:37.</i></td>', 'I saw yours in challenge. There are two problems why your did not score well. 1. There is a red round glow on it, which distroys the main shape, which is well visible in my shot.2. your crop is not good. I mean it is good but it makes it ordinary. Everybody who shoots this subject crops like that. So what would have helped is unusual crop. Something that you do not see often. There are two in my portfolio, both of them are close and different crops. I think you should try again with this subject but with in mind that you are not going to shoot ordinary thing this time. Thanks for comment.', '2007-10-20 20:25:57.000000', '2007-10-20 20:31:37.000000', 0),
(4183732, 594007, 74605, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!</td>', 'Very pretty!', '2007-10-20 20:45:23.000000', NULL, 0),
