(4233269, 588605, 22301, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, it has a really cool perspective and I like the reflections in the guitar. You might want to look at this <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a> for sizing your images for the web. I notice all your entries have a small file size, this one is 65 kb. You are allowed to use up to 150 kb. Doing this would get rid of those jagged edges and make the finer details in your image clearer. I find making the highest file size possible presents my images the best. I like your portfolio too. :)<br/>Joe</td>', 'I like this shot, it has a really cool perspective and I like the reflections in the guitar. You might want to look at this tutorial for sizing your images for the web. I notice all your entries have a small file size, this one is 65 kb. You are allowed to use up to 150 kb. Doing this would get rid of those jagged edges and make the finer details in your image clearer. I find making the highest file size possible presents my images the best. I like your portfolio too. :)Joe', '2007-11-08 19:22:35.000000', NULL, 0),
