(5565089, 593478, 3087, '<td valign="top">I just came across this.<br/>I like the inclusion of the white wall in the frame - it provides a balance or echo for the white lines of the window frame.<br/>I like the high contrast colours and the wonderful textures - they give a slightly surreal or timeless quality.<br/>The clipping of the curtain doesn''t bother me. <br/>I don''t agree that NOT clipping would stabilise or reduce energy. But nor do I think that clipping it is a negative.</td>', 'I just came across this.I like the inclusion of the white wall in the frame - it provides a balance or echo for the white lines of the window frame.I like the high contrast colours and the wonderful textures - they give a slightly surreal or timeless quality.The clipping of the curtain doesn''t bother me. I don''t agree that NOT clipping would stabilise or reduce energy. But nor do I think that clipping it is a negative.', '2009-07-08 12:13:36.000000', NULL, 0),
